#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:35
msgid ""
"Compaction keeps the newest 50 history segments instead of every span a "
"session ever evicted. `seg.N` keys keep counting past the bound, so a key"
" is never reused for different content, and `RecallContext` answers a key"
" below the window with what happened to it and where the retained ones "
"start rather than a bare `missing`. `/compact log` already showed "
"compactions and stored segments separately, so a capped session reads as "
"what it is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:43
msgid ""
"Compaction no longer evicts the request a turn is executing when the "
"runtime appended a message of its own behind it: an `@server` or `$skill`"
" mention expansion, or the protocol correction sent after a model prints "
"a tool call as text. Those are session events now, not user turns, so the"
" boundary compaction never crosses stays the request itself. A worker "
"delegation is where this cost the most — the order is the entire spec, "
"the worker cannot see the parent's history, and nothing re-sends it — but"
" a long parent turn could lose its own request the same way."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:49
msgid "0.24.0 - 2026-08-14"
msgstr "0.24.0 - 2026-08-14"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:53
msgid ""
"The Delegate order viewer renders the order as markdown and aligns its "
"field header."
msgstr "Delegate order 查看器将 order 按 markdown 渲染，并对其字段表头。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:54
msgid ""
"Compaction now names the span it evicts, in the same reply that produces "
"the summary, so a history segment is titled by what the work was about "
"instead of by the first user message in the window — often `ok` or "
"`continue` once a span starts mid-work. Titles show in `/compact log` and"
" in the agent's `RecallContext` listing. A compaction that returns no "
"name, including a deterministic trim after a summarizer failure, keeps "
"the old first-message title."
msgstr ""
"压缩现在会在生成摘要的同一次回复里为它丢弃的这段对话命名，因此历史片段的标题描述的是这段工作本身，而不是窗口里的第一条用户消息——当一段对话从工作中途开始时，那往往只是"
" `ok` 或 `continue`。标题会显示在 `/compact log` 以及 agent 的 `RecallContext` "
"列表中。没有返回名字的压缩（包括摘要失败后的确定性裁剪）仍沿用原来的首条消息标题。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:59
msgid ""
"`/compact log` reviews what compaction kept: stored segments newest first"
" with when each ran, whether it was automatic or manual, whether it "
"covered prior conversation or the running turn, and how much it evicted; "
"opening one shows the summary it produced, which the active context keeps"
" only until the next compaction. `/compact log seg.N` prints that summary"
" without the viewer."
msgstr ""
"`/compact log` "
"用于回顾压缩保留了什么：按时间倒序列出已存储的片段，显示每次压缩发生的时间、是自动还是手动、覆盖的是先前对话还是当前回合，以及丢弃了多少内容；打开某个片段可看到当时生成的摘要——下一次压缩会把它从活动上下文里替换掉。`/compact"
" log seg.N` 则不经查看器直接打印该摘要。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:64
msgid ""
"A `[compaction]` config section gives context compaction its own provider"
" entry: `provider` names a base entry (empty = the active provider), and "
"`model`/`reasoning`/`api` override it per field (empty inherits the "
"entry's value), mirroring `[worker]`. The summary request runs on the "
"resolved entry — including its `response_timeout` — while the context "
"budget still measures the active provider's window; `/compact log` "
"records which model produced each segment and `/config` shows the "
"effective `compaction.*` values. While a summary is in flight the status "
"bar names the entry serving it, `[compaction] entry/model effort`, the "
"way it already names an in-flight worker; a compaction that resolves to "
"the row's own entry leaves the row alone. An incomplete compaction entry "
"is refused by name before the request, instead of reaching the provider "
"SDK and coming back as a credentials error that names nothing. Summary "
"tokens are counted apart from the conversation and reported on their own "
"`/status` row: they can be billed to another account at another price, "
"and a summary is a fresh prefix that never hits the conversation's cache,"
" so one blended total could be read against neither model."
msgstr ""
"`[compaction]` 配置节为上下文压缩提供独立的 provider 条目：`provider` 指定基础条目（留空 = 当前激活的 "
"provider），`model`/`reasoning`/`api` 逐字段覆盖（留空继承该条目的值），镜像 "
"`[worker]`。摘要请求使用解析后的条目——包括它的 `response_timeout`——而上下文预算仍按激活 provider "
"的窗口计算；`/compact log` 记录每个段由哪个模型生成，`/config` 显示生效的 `compaction.*` "
"值。摘要进行中时，状态栏会以 `[compaction] 条目/模型 强度` 命名正在服务它的条目，就像它已经会显示进行中的 worker "
"一样；如果解析出的条目就是当前这一行本身，则不改动该行。不完整的 compaction 条目会在请求发出前被按名字拒绝，而不是走到 "
"provider SDK 之后返回一个什么也没点名的凭据错误。摘要消耗的 token 与对话分开统计，并在 `/status` "
"中单独成行：它们可能计费到另一个账号、按另一种价格，而且摘要是全新的前缀、不会命中对话的缓存，混在一起的总量按哪个模型读都不对。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:77
msgid ""
"Each provider entry can nest its own `[provider.NAME.compaction]` table "
"with the same `model`/`reasoning`/`api` keys, so a provider can route "
"summaries to a cheap model per entry instead of one global choice. Per "
"field the most specific value wins: the entry's nested table, then the "
"global `[compaction]` section, then the entry's own value; `/config` "
"shows the resolved effective values."
msgstr ""
"每个 provider 条目都可以嵌套自己的 `[provider.NAME.compaction]` "
"表，键与全局相同（`model`/`reasoning`/`api`），于是每个条目可以把摘要路由到便宜的模型，而不是只有一个全局选择。逐字段取最具体的值：条目的嵌套表，然后是全局"
" `[compaction]` 节，最后是条目自身的值；`/config` 显示解析后的生效值。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:86
msgid ""
"Typing `@` or `$` opens the completion list as you type, instead of "
"waiting for `Tab`. Both symbols exist only to name an MCP server or a "
"skill, so the list belongs on the keystroke that declares one; prose, `/`"
" commands, and everything else still complete on `Tab`."
msgstr ""
"输入 `@` 或 `$` 时会立刻弹出补全列表，而不再需要先按 `Tab`。这两个符号的唯一用途就是指名一个 MCP 服务器或 "
"skill，所以列表应该出现在你敲下它们的那一刻；普通文字、`/` 命令以及其他内容仍然按 `Tab` 补全。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:90
msgid ""
"Provider `429` responses whose error body carries account/billing wording"
" (e.g. OpenAI `insufficient_quota`, Kimi `exceeded_current_quota_error`, "
"z.ai \"Insufficient balance ...\") are treated as permanent quota/billing"
" failures: the request fails immediately instead of retrying through the "
"backoff. Transient rate-limit 429s retry exactly as before, including the"
" ones phrased with the same vocabulary — Google/Vertex `Quota exceeded "
"for quota metric …` and DashScope `Throttling.RateQuota` are per-minute "
"limits, not billing failures."
msgstr ""
"错误体中带有账号/账单措辞的 Provider `429` 响应（例如 OpenAI `insufficient_quota`、Kimi "
"`exceeded_current_quota_error`、z.ai \"Insufficient balance ...\"）被当作永久性 "
"quota/账单失败处理：请求立即失败，不再退避重试。瞬时限流 429 的既有重试行为不变，包括那些用同样词汇表述的——Google/Vertex"
" 的 `Quota exceeded for quota metric …` 与 DashScope 的 "
"`Throttling.RateQuota` 都是按分钟的限流，而不是账单失败。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:96
msgid ""
"Compaction's summary request honors `provider.response_timeout` instead "
"of an undocumented 60s cap, which also made the timeout's \"set it to 0 "
"to disable\" advice a no-op for compaction. A summary that hits the limit"
" now says so in the fallback error."
msgstr ""
"压缩摘要请求现在遵循 `provider.response_timeout` 而非未文档化的 60 秒上限，这也让超时提示里“设为 0 "
"可禁用”的建议对压缩真正生效。超过该上限的摘要会在 fallback 错误中明确说明。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:101
msgid "0.23.0 - 2026-08-11"
msgstr "0.23.0 - 2026-08-11"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:104
msgid ""
"`[provider.NAME] max_context_tokens` overrides "
"`runtime.max_context_tokens` for that entry, so a 1M-window model and a "
"128K one no longer have to share one global number — the big one compacts"
" far less often without risking overflow on the small one. `0` (the "
"default) inherits. The budget resolves per request, so `/provider` moves "
"it with the entry and a worker on its own entry stops borrowing the "
"parent model's window. `/status` shows the effective limit, and `/set "
"provider.max_context_tokens` changes it for the session."
msgstr ""
"`[provider.NAME] max_context_tokens` 可以覆盖该条目的 "
"`runtime.max_context_tokens`，于是 1M 窗口的模型和 128K 的模型不必再共用一个全局数值 "
"——大窗口的那个压缩频率大幅下降，同时不会让小窗口的那个溢出。`0`（默认）表示继承。预算按请求实时解析，因此 `/provider` "
"会让它随条目一起切换，跑在自己条目上的 worker 也不再借用父模型的窗口。`/status` 会显示生效的上限，`/set "
"provider.max_context_tokens` 可以在会话内修改。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:110
msgid ""
"The project's `AGENTS.md` (or `CLAUDE.md` fallback) is now injected into "
"every request as a bounded \"Project instructions\" section of the "
"Environment block, so repo-specific conventions ride the cache-stable "
"prefix. Controlled by `[runtime] agents_md` (default on); `/status` and "
"`/config` show whether it is loaded."
msgstr ""
"项目的 `AGENTS.md`（或回退 `CLAUDE.md`）现在会作为有边界的「Project instructions」段落注入 "
"Environment 块，出现在每次请求中，使仓库相关约定搭载在 cache-stable 前缀上。由 `[runtime] "
"agents_md` 控制（默认开启）；`/status` 与 `/config` 显示是否已加载。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:114
msgid ""
"Tool approvals are a small form instead of a line to type at. The actions"
" sit in a row above the input line with `Approve` selected — `Tab` and "
"the arrows move along it, `Enter` fires what is selected, `Esc` refuses —"
" so nothing has to be memorized and, for a Delegate send, viewing the "
"order or editing the worker config no longer takes a letter plus Enter. "
"Typing still goes to the refusal reason, and because no letter is a "
"shortcut, a reason can start with any word at all. Each action submits "
"exactly the line you could have typed, so the protocol underneath is "
"unchanged and headless runs keep `y`/`n`/`v`/`c` verbatim."
msgstr ""
"工具确认从一行待输入的文本变成了一个小表单。动作排成一行显示在输入行上方，默认选中 `Approve` —— `Tab` "
"和方向键在行内移动，`Enter` 执行选中项，`Esc` 拒绝 —— 因此不需要记任何东西，Delegate 发送时查看 order 或修改 "
"worker 配置也不再需要「字母 + "
"Enter」。输入仍然进入拒绝理由，而且因为没有字母被占作快捷键，理由可以用任何词开头。每个动作提交的正是你本可以手打的那一行，因此底层协议不变，无界面运行仍然原样使用"
" `y`/`n`/`v`/`c`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:121
msgid ""
"Context at 100% no longer sits there without compacting. The compactable "
"head is everything before the latest user message, and after a compaction"
" that is only the previous summary — which is filtered out — so a session"
" whose latest user message was followed by fewer than eight messages had "
"nothing to compact and went over budget on every request from then on. "
"Since the recent window is a message count rather than a size, a few "
"large messages were enough to trigger it. A smaller window is now tried "
"when the ordinary one leaves nothing, and when nothing can be compacted "
"at all the run says so instead of silently sending an over-budget "
"request."
msgstr ""
"上下文到 100% "
"后不再卡在那里不压缩。可压缩的部分是最后一条用户消息之前的全部内容，而一次压缩之后那里只剩上一份摘要——摘要又会被过滤掉——因此只要最后一条用户消息之后不足八条消息，就没有任何东西可压，此后每次请求都超预算。由于「最近窗口」按消息条数而不是体积计算，几条大消息就足以触发。现在当常规窗口什么都留不下时会改用更小的窗口；确实完全无可压缩时，也会明确说明，而不是默默发出一个超预算的请求。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:128
msgid ""
"Automatic compaction is now explicitly limited to one pass per scope "
"until the messages change. Nothing enforced that before — the loop was "
"prevented only as a side effect of the bug above, so fixing it without a "
"real guard would have turned a stuck context into a compaction loop."
msgstr ""
"自动压缩现在被显式限制为：在消息未发生变化之前，每个作用域只执行一次。此前没有任何机制保证这一点——死循环只是上述 bug "
"的副作用挡住的，所以如果不加真正的保护就去修它，只会把「上下文卡死」变成「反复压缩」。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:131
msgid ""
"A rejected `Note` no longer prints its whole body in grey. An argument "
"rejection is meant to be a quiet one-line summary, but it reused the "
"tool's display, and `Note` keeps the entire rendered note there so a "
"successful call can print it — so a rejected update dimmed thirty lines "
"and left the reason hanging off the end of the last one. The rejection "
"line is one line now, and a failed call's red root is collapsed the same "
"way; a successful `Note` still prints in full."
msgstr ""
"被拒绝的 `Note` 不再把整份内容打成灰色。参数拒绝本应是一行安静的摘要，但它复用了工具的显示内容，而 `Note` "
"会把整份渲染好的笔记放在那里以便成功调用时打印出来——于是一次被拒绝的更新会把三十行变暗，并把原因挂在最后一行的末尾。现在拒绝行就是一行，失败调用的红色根行也用同样方式收拢；成功的"
" `Note` 仍然完整打印。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:136
msgid ""
"A tool approval no longer reprints its whole brief every time you come "
"back to it. Viewing a Delegate order or editing the worker config re-"
"asked by redrawing the entire brief, stacking a copy in the transcript "
"per visit; the brief is printed once and the config cycle now reports the"
" values the picker left behind rather than the ones it started from."
msgstr ""
"工具确认不再每次返回时重打整份摘要。查看 Delegate order 或修改 worker 配置时是靠重画整份摘要来重新提问的，每进出一次就在 "
"transcript 里堆一份副本；现在摘要只打印一次，配置流程也改为报告 picker 结束后的值，而不是它开始时的值。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:140
msgid ""
"The Delegate send confirmation prompt now accepts `v` (or `view`) to open"
" a read-only, full-screen viewer of the complete delegation order before "
"approving (Esc/q closes back to the prompt). The approval brief still "
"shows only a one-line excerpt; the viewer is for reading the whole spec. "
"Headless/no-TUI falls back to printing the full order."
msgstr ""
"Delegate send 确认提示现在接受 `v`（或 `view`）在批准前打开一个只读全屏查看器，展示完整的委托 order（Esc/q "
"关闭回到提示）。确认摘要仍只显示一行摘录；查看器用于阅读完整规格。Headless/无 TUI 时回落为打印完整 order。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:144
msgid ""
"A tool result too large for the context budget is now materialized to a "
"file alongside its truncated marker. The `<bounded_output>` marker "
"carries the file's absolute path under `file=\"...\"`, so the model can "
"`Read`, `Search`, or `grep` the full output instead of paging through "
"`Recall` slices - which are themselves re-truncated and can't show the "
"whole thing at once. The marker also carries a `hint=\"...\"` naming the "
"cheaper move, because an attribute name says where the rest of the output"
" went, not what to do about it. The file lives in the session's `.assets`"
" directory and is cleaned up with it; only outputs over the budget are "
"written, and a read-only or full disk leaves truncation itself untouched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:154
msgid ""
"`Read` and `Search` no longer ask for confirmation to open the session's "
"own assets. The file a truncated tool result is materialized to lives "
"outside the workspace, so following the path the `<bounded_output>` "
"marker just handed the model tripped the out-of-workspace prompt. Every "
"other path outside the workspace still asks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:158
msgid ""
"The file a truncated tool result is materialized to is no longer deleted "
"on the next save. The session's asset collector kept only image "
"references, so it collected the file immediately while the "
"`<bounded_output>` marker went on advertising its path - the model was "
"sent looking for a file that no longer existed. The file is now retained "
"for as long as its tool result is, and collected with it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:163
msgid ""
"A truncated tool result no longer collapses to nothing when the output "
"has very long lines. The head and tail excerpts snap to a line boundary, "
"which threw away the whole excerpt when a single line was longer than the"
" budget - the common shape of an MCP server returning compact JSON, where"
" the model was left with a marker announcing that nearly everything was "
"omitted and no content on either side of it. Snapping is now abandoned "
"when it would cost more than half the budget, so such a result keeps a "
"real head and tail, and `Recall` over it returns real content too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:169
msgid ""
"An `Ask` free-text question no longer renders its line breaks as stray "
"`^J` control characters. The prompt reaches the input row through a "
"single-line prefix, which draws a literal newline as `^J` rather than "
"breaking the line - so the blank line above the question, and every line "
"break in a multi-line question, arrived as `^J`. Each line but the last "
"is now its own row above the input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:173
msgid ""
"`Job(action=\"wait\")` can no longer hold the agent indefinitely. Waiting"
" with no timeout blocked until the process exited, which is exactly what "
"a model does right after a slow `Bash` is backgrounded — so backgrounding"
" handed control back and the very next call gave it away again, for as "
"long as the command ran. A wait now lasts 60s by default, the model can "
"ask for up to 900s when it knows the job is slow, and a wait that ends "
"with the job still running says so instead of looking like a result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:179
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-C` now interrupts a `Job` wait. Only `Bash` was wired to the "
"runner's cancellation, so a wait was unreachable from the cancelling "
"thread and could not be taken back. Interrupting a wait abandons the wait"
" only: the command keeps running and stays addressable through `Job`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:182
msgid ""
"Ctrl-C at a tool approval prompt no longer approves the call. The "
"approval cancel returned an empty reply, which the confirmation loop read"
" as the default \"yes\", so interrupting a Delegate (or any tool) "
"confirmation silently started it instead of cancelling. Ctrl-C at an "
"approval now refuses the call."
msgstr ""
"工具确认提示下的 Ctrl-C 不再批准调用。确认取消原本返回空回复，被确认循环当成默认的 “yes”，于是中断一个 "
"Delegate（或任何工具）确认时反而静默启动了它。现在确认提示下 Ctrl-C 会拒绝该调用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:186
msgid ""
"Cancelling an approval is now its own signal rather than a stand-in "
"string, closing the two remaining ways a cancel could still be read as an"
" answer: `Ctrl-D` on an empty approval line approved the call, and so did"
" quitting the app while an approval was waiting. Both now refuse. The "
"placeholder text a cancel used to submit also no longer leaks — it "
"reached the model as the refusal reason, and it became the literal answer"
" to an `Ask` free-text question; Ctrl-C on an `Ask` page now dismisses "
"the batch."
msgstr ""
"取消确认现在是一个独立信号，而不再是一个占位字符串，由此堵上了取消仍可能被读成回答的最后两条路径：空确认行上的 `Ctrl-D` "
"会批准调用，确认等待期间退出程序同样会批准。两者现在都会拒绝。取消原本提交的占位文本也不再泄漏——它会作为拒绝理由送达模型，也会成为 `Ask` "
"自由文本题的字面答案；现在 `Ask` 页面上的 Ctrl-C 会撤销整批提问。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:192
msgid ""
"The Delegate order viewer no longer overflows on CJK text. It wrapped by "
"character count, so an order written in Chinese produced rows twice the "
"terminal width and the overflow was cut off. Wrapping now measures "
"terminal cells, follows a terminal resize while the viewer is open, keeps"
" the indentation of wrapped code lines, and shortens its key legend on "
"narrow terminals."
msgstr ""
"Delegate 指令查看器不再在 CJK "
"文本上溢出。它原本按字符数折行，因此中文写的指令会产生两倍终端宽度的行，超出部分被直接截断。现在折行按终端单元格宽度计算，查看器打开期间跟随终端尺寸变化，保留折行后代码行的缩进，并在窄终端上缩短按键图例。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:198
msgid ""
"`runtime.max_agent_steps` defaults to `400` instead of `200`. The cap is "
"a runaway stop, not a budget, and long tool loops were hitting it as "
"ordinary work rather than as a fault."
msgstr ""
"`runtime.max_agent_steps` 默认值从 `200` 改为 "
"`400`。这个上限是用来兜住失控的，不是预算；长工具循环撞上它时往往是正常工作，而不是出了故障。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:200
msgid ""
"The note on a backgrounded `Bash` leads with `status` rather than `wait`,"
" and says to keep working. It is read at the moment control comes back, "
"and waiting is what gives it away."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:204
#, fuzzy
msgid "0.22.1 - 2026-08-09"
msgstr "0.9.1 - 2026-07-09"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:207
msgid ""
"A whole-file `Read` no longer echoes `1:0` back to the model. The tool "
"message repeats the call's ranges into the conversation, and `end` 0 is "
"the \"to the end of the file\" sentinel, so a read the model made by "
"omitting `ranges` came back showing a range it never wrote — one that, "
"under 1-based inclusive bounds, reads as empty. A whole-file read now "
"echoes just the path, and `[[50, 0]]` echoes `50:`. Reading from a line "
"to the end of the file is documented in the `Read` schema instead of "
"being an undocumented sentinel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:215
#, fuzzy
msgid "0.22.0 - 2026-08-09"
msgstr "0.20.0 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:218
msgid ""
"Line numbers are now 1-based everywhere the model sees them, and line "
"ranges include both ends. `Read`, `Search`, `InspectCode`, edit anchors, "
"and `Recall` ranges previously counted from 0 with an exclusive end, "
"which disagreed with every other source of line numbers in the same "
"context — `grep -n`, Bash output, tracebacks, diff hunks, editors. A line"
" reported as `anchor=91:49shj` is now the line `grep -n` calls 91, and "
"`Read` with `ranges: [[91, 91]]` returns exactly that line. Requires "
"`code-symbol-index>=0.4.0`, which makes the same change to "
"`InspectCode`'s output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:224
msgid ""
"Anchors captured in sessions created before this change decode one line "
"low. The content hash makes that safe: such an anchor is either relocated"
" to the line it actually describes or refused with `stale anchor`, and "
"cannot silently apply to the neighbouring line. Re-read the file when one"
" is refused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:230
#, fuzzy
msgid "0.21.4 - 2026-08-07"
msgstr "0.20.0 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:233
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-R` history search: `Enter` now ends the search with the match "
"placed in the input box instead of submitting it immediately, so the text"
" can be reviewed or edited first; a second `Enter` sends it. `Ctrl-C` and"
" `Ctrl-U` during a search abort it and restore the input that was there "
"before the search started."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:237
msgid ""
"A focused quick-hint chip: `Enter` now only fills the chip text into the "
"input box instead of submitting it immediately, so the text can be "
"reviewed or edited first; a second `Enter` sends it. The input "
"placeholder now reflects the two-step flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:241
#, fuzzy
msgid "0.21.3 - 2026-08-06"
msgstr "0.20.0 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:244
msgid ""
"Keep a separate append-only CLI transcript when model context is "
"compacted, so resuming a session still shows its original user/assistant "
"turns, tool calls, failures, and Edit previews. Transcript checkpoints no"
" longer re-hash the full history, provider-only continuation data and "
"large tool arguments are excluded, and tool results replay by call id "
"instead of name/order. Successful tool output containing the text "
"`status: failed` is no longer misclassified, and interrupted calls get an"
" explicit failed transcript result. Existing snapshots remain loadable "
"and migrate the history they still contain on their next save; if an "
"older minacode later writes the same log, resume warns that the "
"transcript may be incomplete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:252
msgid ""
"Persist automatic current-turn compaction in the live turn instead of "
"rewriting a throwaway request copy, so the next step or a post-Ctrl-C "
"“continue” does not compact the same oversized prefix again. A queued "
"live follow-up now commits its staged compacted turn after the provider "
"accepts it instead of compacting the same prefix again. Cancelling "
"compaction now applies deterministic trimming before the turn stops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:257
msgid ""
"Enforce `provider.response_timeout` as a real caller-side deadline even "
"when an SDK's synchronous request ignores cross-thread `close()`, and cap"
" compaction requests at 60 seconds before falling back to deterministic "
"trimming. Timed-out or cancelled request threads can no longer publish "
"late stream previews, completed output, or provider-side tool activity "
"into a later turn."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:263
#, fuzzy
msgid "0.21.2 - 2026-08-06"
msgstr "0.20.0 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:266
msgid ""
"Compact long active turns around the latest follow-up instead of "
"retaining the entire prefix before that user boundary, which could leave "
"a session permanently over budget and make every resume enter compaction "
"again. The compacting divider now includes elapsed time, preserves its "
"phase around model retry waits, and reports the provider error when "
"compaction falls back to deterministic trimming."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:272
#, fuzzy
msgid "0.21.1 - 2026-08-05"
msgstr "0.19.1 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:275
msgid ""
"Suppress the MCP client transport loggers (`mcp.client.streamable_http`, "
"`mcp.client.sse`, `mcp.client.stdio`). They log expected, already-"
"surfaced failures (an `httpx.ReadTimeout` on a slow server, dropped "
"SSE/stdio frames, JSON-RPC parse errors) at `ERROR` with full tracebacks "
"via `logging.lastResort`, which dumped them onto the TUI mid-render (e.g."
" the `Error in post_writer` traceback that appeared behind `/provider` "
"while background discovery timed out). `MCPManager` already captures "
"these same failures into `server_errors` and the status bar, so the "
"library's own transport traceback was pure noise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:282
msgid ""
"Retry streaming transport errors that the provider SDKs raise unwrapped. "
"The SDKs' `Stream` iterator re-raises httpx failures directly instead of "
"wrapping them as `APIConnectionError`, so a server dropping the "
"connection mid-stream (`httpx.ReadError`) or closing before the chunked "
"body completes (`httpx.RemoteProtocolError` — \"peer closed connection "
"without sending complete message body (incomplete chunked read)\") "
"reached `retryable_error` with an httpx cause. httpx transport errors "
"don't inherit `OSError`, so the existing `ConnectionError`/`TimeoutError`"
" isinstance checks missed them and the first failure surfaced as `Error: "
"...` instead of retrying. httpx `TransportError` is now retryable, the "
"same class of transient failure as the SDK connection/timeout errors "
"already handled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:292
#, fuzzy
msgid "0.21.0 - 2026-08-04"
msgstr "0.20.0 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:295
msgid ""
"A `[runtime] language` key and a `/language [NAME]` command force the "
"reply language for the session. `auto` (the default) injects nothing, "
"keeping requests byte-identical to before; a language name (e.g. "
"`Chinese` or `简体中文`) appends one fixed `LANGUAGE OVERRIDE` block to the "
"tail of the system prompt. The block is a pure function of the value — no"
" timestamps or session state — so the cacheable system prefix is "
"unchanged, and workers inherit the setting from the parent on every "
"`Delegate` send."
msgstr ""
"新增 `[runtime] language` 键和 `/language [NAME]` "
"命令,用于强制会话的回复语言。`auto`(默认)不注入任何内容,让请求与之前逐字节一致;语言名(如 `Chinese` 或 "
"`简体中文`)会在系统提示词尾部追加一个固定的 `LANGUAGE OVERRIDE` "
"块。该块是值的纯函数——没有时间戳或会话状态——所以可缓存的系统前缀不变,worker 也会在每次 `Delegate` send "
"时从父级继承该设置。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:303
msgid ""
"Confirm a `Delegate` send even under `yolo`. `yolo` means \"I trust you "
"to edit files and run commands without asking\", and those mistakes are "
"visible in the diff or the command output at once; a delegation's mistake"
" is the order text, which only surfaces a whole worker round later. The "
"prompt shows the order, so it stays the one cheap check on a spec the "
"model wrote for itself. `Delegate` status and reset still follow `yolo`, "
"as does every other tool."
msgstr ""
"即使在 `yolo` 下也确认 `Delegate` 发送。`yolo` 意味着「我信任你无需询问即可编辑文件、运行命令」，这类错误会立刻显示在 "
"diff 或命令输出里；而委派的错误是 order 文本，要等整个 worker 回合结束后才会浮现。提示会显示 "
"order，因此它仍然是对模型自己写的规格的唯一廉价检查。`Delegate` 的状态与重置仍遵循 `yolo`，与其他工具一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:308
msgid ""
"A successful `Edit` now refunds the fresh anchors for the region it "
"changed (the same `anchor=line:hash` lines `Read` shows), so consecutive "
"edits to the same file can keep going without a re-Read; `create` and "
"`replace_all`, which have no per-hunk region, skip the refund to keep "
"output bounded. Anchor validation is unchanged: a stale anchor is still "
"refused with the current line echoed."
msgstr ""
"成功的 `Edit` 现在会为它修改的区域回退最新锚点(即 `Read` 显示的 `anchor=line:hash` "
"行),因此对同一文件的连续编辑无需重新 Read 也能继续;`create` 和 `replace_all` 没有逐 hunk "
"的区域,跳过回退以保持输出有界。锚点校验不变:过期锚点仍会被拒绝并回显当前行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:313
msgid ""
"Model request retries now back off exponentially with jitter and honor "
"the provider's `Retry-After` header (clamped to a 30s ceiling) instead of"
" a fixed linear 0.5/1.0/1.5/2.0/2.5s ramp; the total budget goes from "
"about 8s to about a minute. The wait is interruptible (observed in ~0.1s "
"slices, so Ctrl-C aborts promptly) and shows a live countdown in the "
"status bar. Only the pacing changed: which failures are retryable is "
"untouched, and a single aberrant header cannot stall the CLI."
msgstr ""
"模型请求重试现在带抖动地指数退避,并遵循 provider 的 `Retry-After` 头(上限 30 秒),取代原先固定的线性 "
"0.5/1.0/1.5/2.0/2.5 秒斜坡;总预算从约 8 秒提高到约一分钟。等待可中断(以约 0.1 秒的切片观察,所以 Ctrl-C "
"能立即中止),并在状态栏显示实时倒计时。只有节奏变了:哪些失败可重试保持不变,单个异常的 header 也无法拖垮 CLI。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:319
msgid ""
"A retry backoff wait now shows as its own live phase (`retrying`) instead"
" of claiming the agent is `working`, mirroring the existing compaction "
"phase. While the wait lasts, the divider shows the `retrying` label with "
"the attempt count, reason, and a live countdown for its whole duration, "
"no longer capped by the two-second notice window; the notice still "
"lingers for two seconds after the wait ends, and the status bar keeps "
"`attempt N/6`."
msgstr ""
"重试退避等待现在作为独立的实时阶段（`retrying`）显示，而不是声称 agent 正在 "
"`working`，与已有的压缩阶段保持一致。等待期间，divider 在整个等待过程中显示 `retrying` "
"标签，带尝试次数、原因和实时倒计时，不再受两秒通知窗口的限制；等待结束后通知仍保留两秒，状态栏继续显示 `attempt N/6`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:324
msgid ""
"Reword the Edit `start`/`end` anchor parameter descriptions: the anchor "
"must be the exact current `line:hash` value copied verbatim from Read, "
"Search, or InspectCode, never invented or calculated, and re-read after "
"any file change or stale-anchor error. The old wording only named the "
"format and the inclusive range, giving the model no instruction against "
"deriving anchors itself."
msgstr ""
"改写 Edit `start`/`end` 锚点参数的描述:锚点必须是直接从 Read、Search 或 InspectCode 逐字复制的当前 "
"`line:hash` "
"值,绝不能自己编造或计算,并且任何文件改动或过期锚点错误后都要重新读取。旧措辞只说明了格式和闭区间,没有告诉模型不要自行推导锚点。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:328
msgid ""
"The status bar shows the worker only while a delegation is actually in "
"flight: it leads with a yellow `[worker]` marker and reads the worker's "
"provider, model, reasoning, and context/cache usage, returning to the "
"parent's values the moment the worker answers (the engine clears the in-"
"flight turn in `finish_turn`). An idle worker no longer shadows the "
"parent's row. The working divider carries the same yellow `[worker]` "
"prefix while a delegation runs. `/status` is now sectioned — common "
"workspace/session/goal/runtime first, then the parent's "
"model/context/cache/ activity/usage, then the worker's "
"model/context/state rows whenever a worker session exists (or the "
"configured `[worker] provider` line when none does)."
msgstr ""
"状态栏只在委派真正进行时显示 worker:以黄色 `[worker]` 标记开头,显示 worker 的 "
"provider、model、推理以及上下文/缓存用量,worker 一回答就回到父级的值(引擎在 `finish_turn` 中清除进行中的 "
"turn)。空闲的 worker 不再遮蔽父级的行。委派运行期间,working 分隔线也带同样的黄色 `[worker]` "
"前缀。`/status` 现在分区显示——先公共的 workspace/session/goal/runtime,然后是父级的 "
"model/context/cache/activity/usage,最后在存在 worker 会话时显示 worker 的 "
"model/context/state 行(没有 worker 时显示配置的 `[worker] provider` 行)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:336
msgid ""
"The worker delegation bracket is now visibly closed on both ends: the "
"finish block of a successful `Delegate` send or reset carries the same "
"yellow `[worker]` identity as the start marker, and a reset states in the"
" log exactly what it cleared and what survives (file changes and merged "
"diffs stay). `/worker reset` answers in plain terms too, instead of "
"echoing the raw envelope. `/status` sections lost the spare blank lines "
"between a heading and its table."
msgstr ""
"worker 委派括号现在两端都清晰闭合:成功的 `Delegate` send 或 reset 的结束块与开始标记携带同样的黄色 "
"`[worker]` 身份,reset 会在日志中明确说明它清除了什么、什么得以保留(文件改动与已合并的 diff 保留)。`/worker "
"reset` 也用直白的措辞回答,而不是回显原始 envelope。`/status` 的各分区去掉了标题与其表格之间多余的空行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:341
msgid ""
"The delegation bracket is now a pair of full-width rule dividers in the "
"same family as the turn-end line: the start marker and the finish of a "
"successful send or reset each render as a gray rule carrying a yellow "
"label (`worker · provider/model · order summary` and `worker done · steps"
" · elapsed · tokens in/out · files`, or `worker reset · context "
"cleared`), with the order summary capped at 60 characters and the file "
"list at 48; when the worker touched no files the files segment is omitted"
" from the done label instead of reading `(none)`. Without a wired UI the "
"old `[worker] ▶` / `[worker] ◀` log lines remain, and the finish block "
"still previews the worker's answer and its stored key."
msgstr ""
"委派括号现在是一对全宽规则分隔线,与回合结束线同一族:开始标记与成功 send 或 reset "
"的结束各渲染为一条带黄色标签的灰色规则(`worker · provider/model · order summary` 与 `worker "
"done · steps · elapsed · tokens in/out · files`,或 `worker reset · context"
" cleared`),order 摘要上限 60 字符、文件列表 48 字符;worker 未触及任何文件时,done 标签省略文件段而不是显示 "
"`(none)`。未接入 UI 时仍保留旧的 `[worker] ▶` / `[worker] ◀` 日志行,结束块仍会预览 worker "
"的答案及其存储键。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:350
msgid ""
"The `Delegate` description now leads with when to delegate: bounded, "
"verifiable work you can spec in one order, bought for context hygiene and"
" the worker's model, never speed; small work, open exploration, and the "
"heart of the current request stay in the parent session, since writing "
"the order and reviewing the result cost about as much as doing the work."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` 描述现在以何时委派开头:把有边界、可验证的工作写进一条 order 交出去,换来的是上下文卫生和 worker "
"的模型,绝不是速度;小工作、开放式探索以及当前请求的核心留在父会话,因为写 order 和评审结果的花费与自己做差不多。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:354
msgid ""
"`Delegate` send confirmation now shows an approval brief under the "
"prompt: the title, an excerpt of the first 12 order lines (with a "
"trailing \"… N more lines\" when the order is longer), any explicit "
"`language`/`max_steps`, and a `worker:` line reading the effective "
"provider/model/effort/api. The send prompt accepts `c` (or the whole word"
" `config`) to open a small configuration loop — provider/model/effort/api"
" with `off`/`default` clearing, each change live-applied to a running "
"worker — that returns to a redrawn brief before confirming. A "
"`c`-prefixed reason sentence never opens the loop: only a whole-line "
"exact `c`/`config` does."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` send 的确认现在会在提示下方显示审批简报：标题、order 前 12 行的摘录（order 更长时带「… N more "
"lines」后缀）、任何显式的 `language`/`max_steps`，以及一行 `worker:` 显示生效的 "
"provider/model/effort/api。发送提示接受 `c`（或完整单词 "
"`config`）打开一个小配置循环——provider/model/effort/api，可用 `off`/`default` "
"清除，每次修改都会实时应用到正在运行的 worker——确认前会返回重绘后的简报。以 `c` 开头的理由句子不会打开循环：只有整行精确的 "
"`c`/`config` 才会。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:361
msgid ""
"The `[worker]` section and `/worker api [API]` now set a `worker.api` "
"protocol override (`auto|chat|responses|anthropic`, empty = inherit the "
"provider entry's own protocol); the live worker's entry is refreshed the "
"same way `/worker model|reason` already did. The three copy-on-write "
"refresh blocks behind `/worker provider|model|reason|api` are now one "
"shared helper, `refresh_worker_entry`."
msgstr ""
"`[worker]` 小节和 `/worker api [API]` 现在设置 `worker.api` "
"协议覆盖(`auto|chat|responses|anthropic`,空 = 继承 provider 条目自己的协议);实时 worker "
"的条目以 `/worker model|reason` 已有的方式刷新。`/worker provider|model|reason|api` "
"背后的三个 copy-on-write 刷新块现在合并为一个共享辅助函数 `refresh_worker_entry`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:366
msgid ""
"The one-time per-task Delegate authorization is retired: the confirm "
"prompt's `a` key and `/worker auto on|off` are gone, so every `Delegate` "
"send asks again (still even under `yolo`), and the task-boundary reset "
"hooks that cleared the flag are removed with it."
msgstr ""
"一次性 per-task Delegate 授权已退役:确认提示的 `a` 键和 `/worker auto on|off` 都消失了,所以每次 "
"`Delegate` send 都会再次询问(即使在 `yolo` 下也一样),清除该标志的任务边界 reset 钩子也随之移除。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:369
msgid ""
"The system prompt's SCOPE now gates action on intent: discussion -- "
"questions, opinions, proposals -- is answered only, action does exactly "
"what was instructed, ambiguity between the two resolves to discussion, "
"and a reply that rejects or narrows a proposal approves only what it "
"explicitly accepts."
msgstr ""
"系统提示词的 SCOPE "
"现在按意图约束行动:讨论——问题、意见、提议——只作回答,行动严格按指示执行,两者之间的歧义按讨论处理,拒绝或收窄提议的回复只批准它明确接受的部分。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:373
msgid ""
"The `Delegate` send finish block now shows what that delegation cost: the"
" envelope records the worker's prompt/completion token delta for the send"
" (the program subtracts `worker.usage` before and after the run, never "
"the model's word), and the summary line renders it as e.g. `8.2K in / "
"1.3K out`. Envelopes written before the `tokens` attribute still parse "
"and simply omit the token part."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` send 的结束块现在显示这次委派的成本:envelope 记录该次 send 的 worker "
"prompt/completion token 增量(程序取 `worker.usage` 在运行前后的差值,绝不信模型的话),摘要行将其渲染为如"
" `8.2K in / 1.3K out`。在 `tokens` 属性之前写入的 envelope 仍可解析,只是省略 token 部分。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:378
msgid ""
"The delegation start divider now reads `worker start · provider/model · "
"order summary` instead of `worker · provider/model · order summary`."
msgstr ""
"委派开始分隔线现在读作 `worker start · provider/model · order summary`,而不是 `worker ·"
" provider/model · order summary`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:380
msgid ""
"`/status` is back to markdown table rendering: the common "
"workspace/session/goal/runtime rows lead with no `Common` heading, then "
"the `### Parent` and `### Worker` headings introduce the two sections. "
"The dense borderless-rendering experiment is removed."
msgstr ""
"`/status` 恢复为 markdown 表格渲染:公共的 workspace/session/goal/runtime 行不再带 "
"`Common` 标题,然后由 `### Parent` 和 `### Worker` 标题引出两个分区。密集的无边框渲染实验已移除。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:383
msgid ""
"`/status` renders compact: the command path passes a new `compact` flag "
"to `emit_answer` that drops every invisible line — the blank line rich "
"markdown pads after each heading plus the whitespace rows above and below"
" each table box — so each heading sits tight against its table."
msgstr ""
"`/status` 紧凑渲染:命令路径给 `emit_answer` 传一个新的 `compact` 标志,去掉所有不可见行——rich "
"markdown 在每个标题后垫的空行,以及每个表格框上下方的空白行——所以每个标题紧贴其表格。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:386
msgid ""
"`Delegate` reset is no longer a full-width `worker reset · context "
"cleared` rule. It is a one-shot tool call, so it keeps its ordinary tool "
"root and a plain `done` child stating what it cleared and what survives; "
"the delegation bracket (start + done dividers) applies only to sends."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` reset 不再是全宽的 `worker reset · context cleared` "
"规则。它是一次性工具调用,因此保留普通工具根行和一个说明清除了什么、什么得以保留的普通 `done` 子行;委派括号(开始 + "
"结束分隔线)只适用于 send。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:389
msgid ""
"The `Delegate` start and done dividers now show a human-readable title: "
"`send` accepts an optional `title` parameter, and when given it replaces "
"the order-first-line summary on the start divider and leads the `worker "
"done · steps · …` label; without one the dividers fall back to the "
"order's first line as before."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` 开始与结束分隔线现在显示人类可读的标题:`send` 接受可选 `title` 参数,给出后它取代开始分隔线上的 order"
" 首行摘要,并引领 `worker done · steps · …` 标签;未给出时分隔线照旧回退到 order 的首行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:395
msgid ""
"New `[worker]` config section and the `Delegate` tool: the model can hand"
" a bounded task to a second in-process minacode session (the worker) that"
" runs on its own configured provider, with its own system prompt and a "
"reduced tool set, keeping context across delegations until reset. Enable "
"with `[worker] provider = \"...\"` plus `runtime.worker = true` (or "
"`/worker on`); `[worker] provider` defaults to disabled, and the spec "
"suggests a different vendor than `provider.active` so the worker's "
"reviews cross-validate the parent's. `Delegate` actions: `send` (with a "
"free-text order and optional `max_steps`), `reset`, `status`. "
"`runtime.worker` gates the tool block and thus the prompt-cache scope; "
"turning it off does not clear the worker's context. `/worker` shows "
"status and `/worker reset` clears the worker and tells the parent model "
"via a session event."
msgstr ""
"新增 `[worker]` 配置节与 `Delegate` 工具：模型可以把有限的任务交给同一进程内的第二个 minacode "
"会话（worker），它使用自己配置的 provider、自己的系统提示和精简的工具集，并在各次委派之间保留上下文，直到被重置。启用方式：设置 "
"`[worker] provider = \"...\"` 并打开 `runtime.worker = true`（或 `/worker "
"on`）；`[worker] provider` 默认禁用，建议使用与 `provider.active` 不同的厂商，以便 worker "
"的审查与父会话互相验证。`Delegate` 动作：`send`（自由文本工单，可选 "
"`max_steps`）、`reset`、`status`。`runtime.worker` 控制工具块，从而影响 prompt-cache "
"作用域；关闭它不会清除 worker 的上下文。`/worker` 显示状态，`/worker reset` 清除 worker，并通过一条 "
"session 事件告知父模型。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:404
msgid ""
"`/worker` now switches the worker's provider, model, and reasoning effort"
" at runtime, mirroring the parent's `/provider` `/model` `/reason` "
"temporary switches: `/worker provider NAME` re-targets the worker "
"(`/worker provider off` clears the entry), `/worker model MODEL` and "
"`/worker reason EFFORT` override the entry's model and reasoning effort, "
"and `default` clears a model/reasoning override back to inheriting the "
"entry's value. A change applies to a live worker immediately and to "
"future spawns, and is session-scoped like `/provider`; the same defaults "
"can be set persistently with the new `[worker] model` and `[worker] "
"reasoning` keys. The `Delegate` tool block is fixed at session start, so "
"a runtime switch tunes an already-enabled delegation but never flips the "
"tool block mid-session, and enabling delegation from scratch (no "
"`[worker] provider` at start) takes effect after a restart. The worker's "
"active provider entry is now always a detached copy, so a switch can "
"never leak into the parent's provider."
msgstr ""
"`/worker` 现在可在运行时切换 worker 的 provider、模型与推理强度,与父级 `/provider` `/model` "
"`/reason` 的临时切换保持一致:`/worker provider NAME` 重新指定 worker(`/worker provider"
" off` 清除条目),`/worker model MODEL` 与 `/worker reason EFFORT` "
"覆盖条目的模型与推理强度,`default` 清除 model/reasoning 覆盖、回到继承条目的值。修改立即作用于实时 "
"worker,也对未来的生成生效,并且与 `/provider` 一样是 session 级的;同样的默认值可用新增的 `[worker] "
"model` 和 `[worker] reasoning` 键持久化设置。`Delegate` "
"工具块在会话启动时固定,因此运行时切换只能调优已启用的委派,绝不会在会话中途翻转工具块;从头启用委派(启动时没有 `[worker] "
"provider`)需要重启后生效。worker 的活动 provider 条目现在始终是分离副本,所以切换绝不会泄漏到父级的 provider。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:415
msgid ""
"A finished `Delegate send` now renders as a proper log block: the root "
"line reads `Delegate send` (no argument blob), a summary line reports "
"steps, elapsed, files, and a stopped-at-max-steps flag, and the worker's "
"answer is previewed below like a Bash transcript — the raw envelope tags "
"stay out of the log."
msgstr ""
"完成的 `Delegate send` 现在渲染为正常的日志块:根行读作 `Delegate send`(没有参数 blob),摘要行报告 "
"steps、elapsed、files 和 stopped-at-max-steps 标志,worker 的答案像 Bash "
"记录一样在下方预览——原始 envelope 标签不进入日志。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:419
msgid ""
"The log now marks where a delegation starts: a yellow `[worker] ▶ "
"provider/model · order` line is emitted just before the worker runs (the "
"order collapsed to one line, 200 chars), so the scrollback has a boundary"
" until the finish block closes it."
msgstr ""
"日志现在标记委派开始的位置:worker 运行前立即输出一行黄色 `[worker] ▶ provider/model · "
"order`(order 折叠为一行,200 字符),因此滚动区在结束块闭合前有明确边界。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:422
msgid ""
"`/worker` (no arguments) now answers in readable lines instead of the raw"
" `Delegate` status envelope the model sees: one line per fact "
"(provider/model, reasoning, state, rounds, context percent), or `worker: "
"no active session` plus the configured `[worker] provider` when no worker"
" exists. The model-facing `Delegate status` envelope is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"`/worker`(无参数)现在用可读的行回答,而不是模型看到的原始 `Delegate` status "
"envelope:每行一个事实(provider/model、推理、状态、轮数、上下文百分比),没有 worker 时显示 `worker: no"
" active session` 加配置的 `[worker] provider`。面向模型的 `Delegate status` "
"envelope 不变。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:426
msgid ""
"`/worker provider`, `/worker model`, and `/worker reason` without an "
"argument now open the same pickers as `/provider` `/model` `/reason` "
"(provider entries plus `off`, the worker entry's models plus `default`, "
"reasoning efforts plus `default`), and `/worker` tab-completes its "
"subcommands and their values."
msgstr ""
"`/worker provider`、`/worker model` 与 `/worker reason` 不带参数时,现在打开与 "
"`/provider` `/model` `/reason` 相同的选择器(provider 条目加 `off`,worker 条目的模型加 "
"`default`,推理强度加 `default`),`/worker` 会 Tab 补全子命令及其取值。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:430
msgid ""
"`/worker provider` without an argument now flows on into the worker model"
" and then the reasoning pickers after the provider is set, mirroring the "
"parent's `/provider` chain, so a fresh worker setup is one selection flow"
" instead of three commands; backing out of any stage keeps the stages "
"already set and the returned message says what landed. The typed "
"`provider NAME` still sets only the provider, and the worker keeps the "
"provider entry's `api` — there is no `/worker api`."
msgstr ""
"`/worker provider` 不带参数时,现在会在设置 provider 后接着进入 worker model、再进入推理选择器,与父级 "
"`/provider` 链路一致,因此全新 worker "
"的配置是一次选择流程而不是三条命令;在任一步退出会保留前面已设置的阶段,返回的消息说明落定了什么。键入的 `provider NAME` 仍只设置"
" provider,worker 保留 provider 条目的 `api`——没有 `/worker api`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:436
msgid ""
"`Delegate` send accepts an optional `language`: the user watches the "
"worker's live stream and reads its report, so the tool appends an "
"explicit reply-language directive to the order covering everything the "
"worker outputs, not just the final answer. The tool description tells the"
" parent to pass the user's language unless the user works in English."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` send 接受可选 `language`:用户观看 worker 的实时流并阅读其报告,因此工具会在 order "
"中追加一条显式的回复语言指令,覆盖 worker 输出的所有内容,而不只是最终答案。工具描述告诉父级传入用户的语言,除非用户用英语工作。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:441
msgid ""
"`/status` is now one flat table instead of three stacked ones. The `### "
"Parent` / `### Worker` headings and the two repeated header rows are "
"gone; the worker's facts join the same table under `worker`, `worker "
"ctx`, and `worker cache` labels, collapsing to a single `worker` row "
"naming the configured `[worker] provider` when no worker session exists. "
"The header column is `field` rather than `status`, and the `cache` row "
"reports read ratios (`last 99.9% (w 1.2K); session 83.4%`) instead of the"
" raw token pairs that made it the one row long enough to wrap."
msgstr ""
"`/status` 现在是一张扁平表格,而不是三张堆叠的。`### Parent` / `### Worker` "
"标题与两个重复的表头行都消失了;worker 的事实以 `worker`、`worker ctx`、`worker cache` "
"标签加入同一张表,没有 worker 会话时收拢为一行 `worker` 行,说明配置的 `[worker] provider`。表头列是 "
"`field` 而非 `status`,`cache` 行报告读取比率(`last 99.9% (w 1.2K); session "
"83.4%`),取代了让它成为唯一会换行的长行的原始 token 对。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:449
msgid ""
"Fix `chat_reasoning = \"enable_thinking\"` sending a `thinking_budget` "
"that a configured `provider.max_tokens` cannot cover: these hosts fold "
"`max_tokens` into `max_completion_tokens` and reject a budget that is not"
" strictly below it (`max_completion_tokens [16384] must be greater than "
"thinking_budget [16384]`), so `max_tokens = 16384` with `reasoning = "
"\"xhigh\"` or `\"max\"` failed every request. The budget now stays under "
"the cap, the same clamp the Anthropic wire already applied; an unset "
"`max_tokens` still leaves the budget to the host."
msgstr ""
"修复 `chat_reasoning = \"enable_thinking\"` 发送的 `thinking_budget` 超出所配置 "
"`provider.max_tokens` 的问题：这些主机把 `max_tokens` 并入 "
"`max_completion_tokens`，并拒绝任何未严格小于它的预算（`max_completion_tokens [16384] "
"must be greater than thinking_budget [16384]`），因此 `max_tokens = 16384` 配合"
" `reasoning = \"xhigh\"` 或 `\"max\"` 会让每次请求都失败。预算现在始终低于上限，与 Anthropic "
"线上已有的钳制一致；未设置 `max_tokens` 时仍把预算留给主机。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:455
msgid ""
"Fix running-mode Ctrl-P/Up being a no-op while the input box holds text: "
"the old handler returned after `cursor_up()`, which does nothing on a "
"single-line buffer, so history recall and queued follow-up recall both "
"silently failed whenever the draft was non-empty. The key now behaves "
"like it does with an empty box: recall the latest queued follow-up first,"
" otherwise walk history."
msgstr ""
"修复运行模式下输入框有文本时 Ctrl-P/Up 是空操作的问题:旧处理器在 `cursor_up()` "
"后直接返回,而它对单行缓冲区什么都不做,所以只要草稿非空,历史召回和排队的跟进召回都会静默失败。该键现在与空输入框时行为一致:先召回最新的排队跟进,否则在历史中回退。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:460
msgid ""
"Fix a worker crash when the worker model emitted text beside a tool call:"
" the worker's output wrapper assumed every Agent emission was a LogLine "
"and built `LogBlock([str])`, which `LogBlock.walk` rejects with `'str' "
"object has no attribute 'walk'` at render time. Bare strings are now "
"wrapped into LogLine items before reaching the parent's log stream."
msgstr ""
"修复 worker 模型在工具调用旁输出文本时 worker 崩溃的问题:worker 的输出包装器假定 Agent 的每次输出都是 "
"LogLine,并构造 `LogBlock([str])`,渲染时 `LogBlock.walk` 会以 `'str' object has no"
" attribute 'walk'` 拒绝。裸字符串现在在到达父级日志流前被包装为 LogLine 项。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:464
msgid ""
"Wire the worker's model stream into the parent's live display: "
"`ModelClient` only streams when `on_stream` is set, so the worker ran "
"unstreamed and its reasoning and response progress never reached the CLI."
" Delegations now reuse the parent's stream preview."
msgstr ""
"把 worker 的模型流接入父级的实时显示:`ModelClient` 只在设置了 `on_stream` 时才流式输出,因此此前 worker"
" 无流运行,其推理与响应进度从未到达 CLI。委派现在复用父级的流预览。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:467
msgid ""
"Make `/worker reset` finish the worker runtime it discards: stop and "
"clean up its background jobs, remove a disk-only worker after the parent "
"is resumed, and keep the live worker reachable with an actionable error "
"if its snapshot cannot be deleted. This prevents orphaned processes and "
"prevents a reported reset from silently restoring the old context on the "
"next delegation."
msgstr ""
"让 `/worker reset` 结束它丢弃的 worker 运行时:停止并清理其后台任务,父级恢复后移除仅磁盘上的 "
"worker,若其快照无法删除则让实时 worker 保持可达并给出可操作的错误。这防止了孤儿进程,也防止一次报告的 reset "
"在下次委派时静默恢复旧上下文。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:471
msgid ""
"Ignore `/resend` during an automatic retry countdown, when no model "
"request is in flight, and preserve a resend that races the start of that "
"wait as a retry instead of cancelling the turn."
msgstr "在自动重试倒计时期间忽略 `/resend`,没有模型请求在途时也忽略,并保留与等待开始竞态的 resend 作为一次重试,而不是取消该回合。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:473
msgid ""
"Expire a worker in the same retention sweep as its expired parent "
"regardless of directory scan order, so a fresh subordinate snapshot "
"cannot survive as a hidden orphan."
msgstr "worker 与其过期的父级在同一保留清扫中过期,与目录扫描顺序无关,因此新建的子级快照不能作为隐藏孤儿存活。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:475
msgid ""
"Reject non-integer or non-positive `Delegate.max_steps` values at the "
"tool boundary instead of running an empty worker turn with an invalid "
"budget."
msgstr "在工具边界拒绝非整数或非正数的 `Delegate.max_steps` 值,而不是带着无效预算运行一个空 worker 回合。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:477
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Estimate request tokens from UTF-8 bytes instead of characters (4 "
"bytes/token), so CJK-heavy sessions are no longer undercounted about 3x: "
"the status bar could show 100% while the next request was still estimated"
" under budget and auto-compaction never fired. ASCII payloads estimate "
"exactly as before. The tool-output trimmer keeps its chars/4 measure, and"
" a last line of defense forces compaction when the previous request "
"filled >=99% of its budget even if the estimate still fits. Compaction "
"clears the recorded last-* usage (the compaction request's own fill would"
" otherwise be mistaken for a full ordinary context and double-compact the"
" just-shrunk history); the status bar falls back to the local estimate "
"until the next ordinary request reports real usage."
msgstr ""
"请求 token 估算从字符改为 UTF-8 字节(4 字节/token),因此 CJK 密集的会话不再约 3 倍低估:状态栏可能显示 "
"100%,而下一个请求仍被估算为低于预算,自动压缩从不触发。ASCII 负载的估算与之前完全相同。工具输出裁剪保持 chars/4 "
"度量;最后一道防线是当上一个请求填满其预算 >=99% 时强制压缩,即使估算仍放得下。压缩会清除记录的 last-* "
"用量(否则压缩请求自身的填充会被误认为完整的普通上下文,从而对刚缩小的历史二次压缩);状态栏回退到本地估算,直到下一个普通请求报告真实用量。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:485
msgid ""
"The delegation finish block's root line is now a pure closing divider "
"`[worker] ◀` for both `Delegate` send and reset: the action name no "
"longer crowds the boundary, and the details — the steps/elapsed/files "
"summary or the reset notice — live in the child lines."
msgstr ""
"委派结束块的根行现在对 `Delegate` send 和 reset 都是纯闭合分隔线 `[worker] "
"◀`:动作名不再挤占边界,细节——steps/elapsed/files 摘要或 reset 通知——位于子行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:488
msgid ""
"Worker mid-turn text no longer repeats in the TUI: the worker's model "
"stream now forwards to the parent's live display with `output_done` "
"downgraded to a preview clear, because the worker's own output already "
"lands in the parent scrollback and the parent loop's promote would write "
"it a second time (the promoted-text marker is consumed only by the "
"parent's own agent output path). Final reports and non-TUI output are "
"untouched."
msgstr ""
"worker 回合中途的文本不再在 TUI 中重复:worker 的模型流现在转发到父级的实时显示,`output_done` "
"降级为预览清除,因为 worker 自己的输出已落入父级滚动区,父级循环的 promote 会把它写第二遍(已提升文本标记只由父级自己的 "
"agent 输出路径消费)。最终报告与非 TUI 输出不受影响。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:496
msgid "0.20.0 - 2026-08-03"
msgstr "0.20.0 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:499
msgid ""
"Show the thinking preview on Responses hosts that stream the raw "
"reasoning chain rather than a summary. Only "
"`response.reasoning_summary_text.delta` was recognized, so a provider "
"that emits `response.reasoning_text.delta` — DeepSeek documents that it "
"generates no summary at all — ran a high-effort step with nothing on "
"screen until the answer arrived. Stored history was already complete; "
"only the live preview was missing."
msgstr ""
"在只发送原始推理链而非摘要的 Responses 主机上展示思考预览。此前只识别 "
"`response.reasoning_summary_text.delta`,因此只发 "
"`response.reasoning_text.delta` 的 provider(DeepSeek "
"文档说明它完全不生成摘要)会以高强度步骤运行,而屏幕上直到答案到达都一片空白。存储的历史始终完整,缺失的只是实时预览。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:504
msgid ""
"Report a generation the provider cut off at the output cap instead of "
"failing the turn with `empty final response`. Reasoning counts against "
"`provider.max_tokens` on the Responses and Anthropic wires, so a high-"
"effort step could spend the whole budget and return neither text nor a "
"tool call; the error now names the cap, the tokens spent, and how much of"
" that was reasoning. A truncation that still produced text keeps its "
"partial answer. The failure is deterministic and no longer consumes a "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"当 provider 在输出上限处截断生成时如实报告，不再以 `empty final response` 结束回合。在 Responses 与 "
"Anthropic 协议上，推理 token 同样计入 "
"`provider.max_tokens`，因此一次高强度推理可能耗尽整个预算，既不返回文本也不返回工具调用；现在的错误会点明该上限、已消耗的 "
"token，以及其中有多少属于推理。仍然产出了文本的截断会保留它的部分回答。该失败是确定性的，不再消耗重试次数。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:510
msgid ""
"Treat `finish_reason=length` on the Chat wire as output truncation only "
"when the reported output tokens actually reached the configured cap. "
"OpenAI-compatible providers also return `length` when the input exceeds "
"the model's context window; the error now names both "
"`provider.max_tokens` and `runtime.max_context_tokens` instead of pushing"
" the output cap blindly."
msgstr ""
"在 Chat 线上，仅当上报的输出 token 确实达到配置的上限时，才把 `finish_reason=length` "
"当作输出截断。OpenAI 兼容 provider 在输入超过模型上下文窗口时也会返回 `length`；现在的错误会同时点名 "
"`provider.max_tokens` 与 `runtime.max_context_tokens`，而不是盲目建议调高输出上限。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:516
msgid ""
"Default `provider.max_tokens` back to `0`, so Chat and Responses omit the"
" cap and let the provider apply its own default instead of sending a "
"hard-coded 16K that some models reject (Claude 3.5 Haiku on Bedrock, for "
"one, caps at 8K). The Anthropic wire still requires the parameter and "
"sends a conservative 8K when unset. The 16K output reserve taken out of "
"the input budget is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"将 `provider.max_tokens` 默认值改回 `0`：Chat 与 Responses 不再发送写死的 16K，而是交给 "
"provider 使用自己的默认值——写死的 16K 会被部分模型拒绝（例如 Bedrock 上的 Claude 3.5 Haiku 上限为 "
"8K）。Anthropic 线仍必须携带该参数，未配置时发送保守的 8K。从输入预算中预留的 16K 输出空间不变。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:520
msgid ""
"Raise the default `runtime.max_context_tokens` from 240K to 256K. Both "
"defaults appear in the generated config with a note that they trade "
"against each other and that the context budget is how much of a model's "
"window to use, not the window's size."
msgstr ""
"将默认的 `runtime.max_context_tokens` 从 240K 提高到 "
"256K。两个默认值都会出现在生成的配置文件中，并注明它们之间此消彼长，以及上下文预算表示打算使用模型窗口的多少，而不是窗口本身的大小。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:523
msgid ""
"Show the context fill in the status bar and `/status` from the provider-"
"reported prompt tokens of the last request instead of the local estimate."
" The estimate still triggers compaction, which decides for a request that"
" has not been sent yet; the reported usage describes the one that was."
msgstr ""
"状态栏与 `/status` 的上下文占用改为显示最近一次请求的 provider 上报 prompt "
"token，而不是本地估算。压缩仍按估算触发——估算为尚未发出的请求做决定，上报用量描述的是已经发生的那次。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:526
msgid ""
"Show that fill against the budget the last request was prepared against "
"(`session.usage.last_prompt_budget`) instead of recomputing the "
"denominator from the current configuration, so `/set "
"provider.max_tokens`, `/set runtime.max_context_tokens`, or a provider "
"switch no longer moves the recorded percentage before the next request."
msgstr ""
"上下文占用改用上一次请求所对应的预算（`session.usage.last_prompt_budget`）作为分母，而不是用当前配置重新计算，因此"
" `/set provider.max_tokens`、`/set runtime.max_context_tokens` 或切换 "
"provider 都不会在发出下一次请求前改变已记录的百分比。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:532
msgid "0.19.1 - 2026-08-03"
msgstr "0.19.1 - 2026-08-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:535
msgid ""
"Never empty the tool list to force a live-follow-up acknowledgement. The "
"extra request that carried `tools=[]` discarded the cached prefix and "
"moved the request into another cache scope, and the model read the "
"missing schemas as a broken tool set: it reported Bash, Edit, Search, and"
" MCP as unavailable, pasted patches instead of editing files, and asked "
"the user to restore them. The follow-up marker now just asks for a text "
"acknowledgement in the same message as the next tool calls, and a tools-"
"only response continues the turn as usual."
msgstr ""
"绝不为强制一次实时跟进确认而清空工具列表。携带 `tools=[]` 的额外请求丢弃了缓存前缀,把请求移入另一个缓存作用域,模型把缺失的 "
"schema 读成损坏的工具集:它报告 Bash、Edit、Search 与 MCP "
"不可用,粘贴补丁而不是编辑文件,并让用户恢复它们。跟进标记现在只要求在同一消息中随下一次工具调用给出文本确认,仅含工具的响应照常继续该回合。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:541
msgid ""
"Commit a live follow-up with the marker it was sent with. History stored "
"the bare text while the request carried `[Live follow-up received while "
"you were working]`, so the next request replayed different bytes at that "
"position and ended the shared cache prefix there. The restored transcript"
" hides the marker, so the scrollback still shows what the user typed."
msgstr ""
"按发送时携带的标记提交实时跟进。历史存储的是裸文本,而请求携带 `[Live follow-up received while you were "
"working]`,因此下一个请求在该位置重放了不同的字节,共享缓存前缀在那里终结。恢复的记录隐藏该标记,所以滚动区仍显示用户键入的内容。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:545
msgid ""
"Commit textual tool-call corrections to history instead of sending them "
"request-locally. What reached the provider is now what the next request "
"replays, corrections stack rather than replace each other, and an aborted"
" turn keeps the ones it already sent."
msgstr ""
"把文本形式的工具调用纠正提交到历史,而不是在请求本地发送。现在到达 provider "
"的内容就是下一个请求重放的内容,纠正会堆叠而不是互相替换,中止的回合保留它已发送的部分。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:550
msgid ""
"Write output for the terminal instead of a markdown renderer: reference "
"local files as bare `path:line` rather than as markdown links, and drop "
"banner headings, tables for short answers, and paste-back of file "
"contents or command output the user already saw."
msgstr ""
"为终端而非 markdown 渲染器写输出:本地文件以裸 `path:line` 引用,而不是 markdown "
"链接;去掉横幅标题、短答案的表格,以及用户已经看过的文件内容或命令输出的回贴。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:555
msgid "0.19.0 - 2026-08-02"
msgstr "0.19.0 - 2026-08-02"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:558
msgid ""
"Ship a builtin `minacode-help` skill with an offline manual, "
"troubleshooting guidance, a matching-version source inspection fallback, "
"and an idle hint inviting minacode questions. Builtin skills use the same"
" discovery and loading path as ordinary skills; user and project skills "
"can override them by name."
msgstr ""
"内置 `minacode-help` skill，提供离线手册、故障排查指引、按匹配版本检查源码的后备流程，并通过 idle hint "
"提醒用户可以直接询问 minacode 问题。内置 skill 与普通 skill 使用相同的发现和加载路径；用户和项目 skill "
"可以按名称覆盖它们。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:562
msgid ""
"Add `max` reasoning effort and map normalized effort levels to each "
"documented provider/model family, including OpenAI GPT-5 and o-series "
"generations, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi, Z.AI, OpenRouter, and "
"OpenCode Zen. Unknown providers and future model names retain generic "
"pass-through behavior, and `/config` now shows the resolved effort sent "
"to the active model."
msgstr ""
"新增 `max` reasoning effort，并按各个有文档依据的 provider/model family 映射标准化的 effort "
"级别，覆盖 OpenAI GPT-5 与 o-series "
"各代、Anthropic、DeepSeek、Qwen、Kimi、Z.AI、OpenRouter 和 OpenCode Zen。未知 "
"provider 与未来模型名仍保留通用透传行为；`/config` 现在会显示发送给当前模型的解析后 effort。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:566
msgid ""
"Add a `provider.builtin_tools` option (a list of tables, default empty) "
"appended verbatim to the `tools` array of whichever protocol the provider"
" speaks, so a provider's own server-side tools can be offered to the "
"model. This is how provider web search is enabled: `{ type = "
"\"web_search\" }` for OpenAI and Qwen on the Responses API, `{ type = "
"\"web_search_20250305\", name = \"web_search\" }` for Anthropic, `{ type "
"= \"web_search\", web_search = { enable = \"True\" } }` for Z.AI, and `{ "
"type = \"openrouter:web_search\" }` for OpenRouter. Entries are passed "
"through unchanged after a check for a non-empty `type` and against the "
"provider's documented wire. Enabling an active entry changes the prompt "
"cache key, and `/config` distinguishes configured entries from the active"
" projection. One provider configures search through the request body "
"instead — Qwen Chat's `enable_search` — and continues to use "
"`provider.extra_body`."
msgstr ""
"新增 `provider.builtin_tools` 选项（table 列表，默认为空），将其原样追加到 Provider 所用协议的 "
"`tools` 数组，使模型可使用 Provider 自己的服务端工具。Provider 联网搜索的配置方式包括：OpenAI 和 Qwen "
"Responses API 使用 `{ type = \"web_search\" }`，Anthropic 使用 `{ type = "
"\"web_search_20250305\", name = \"web_search\" }`，Z.AI 使用 `{ type = "
"\"web_search\", web_search = { enable = \"True\" } }`，OpenRouter 使用 `{ "
"type = \"openrouter:web_search\" }`。条目会在检查非空 `type` 和 Provider 文档规定的 wire"
" 后原样透传。启用且实际生效的工具会改变 prompt cache key，`/config` 会区分已配置条目和当前生效的投影。Qwen "
"Chat 的搜索通过请求体中的 `enable_search` 配置，继续使用 `provider.extra_body`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:576
msgid ""
"Scope known `provider.builtin_tools` entries to their documented request "
"wire. Responses-only entries (OpenAI, Qwen) are omitted on Chat or "
"Anthropic, Anthropic server tools only travel over Messages, and "
"Z.AI/Kimi Chat entries only over Chat. Incompatible entries remain "
"configured and become active again after switching back, so a shared "
"provider configuration works across models without destructive edits; "
"`/api` and `/config` report when they are inactive. On an active wire, "
"known providers still reject unsupported entries (for example Qwen "
"`code_interpreter` or Anthropic `web_fetch_*`) before SDK I/O, so "
"approval, file, container, and client-callback lifecycles cannot leak "
"through. OpenRouter server tools (`openrouter:web_search`, "
"`openrouter:web_fetch`, `openrouter:datetime`) are supported; DeepSeek, "
"Kimi Code, and OpenCode activate none. Unknown hosts and future tool "
"shapes on unknown hosts keep generic pass-through."
msgstr ""
"将已知 `provider.builtin_tools` 条目限定在其文档规定的请求 wire。OpenAI、Qwen 的 Responses "
"条目不会发往 Chat 或 Anthropic；Anthropic 服务端工具只发往 Messages；Z.AI/Kimi Chat 条目只发往 "
"Chat。不兼容的条目仍保留在配置中，切换回来后会重新生效，因此同一 Provider 配置可服务使用不同 wire "
"的模型，无须删除设置；`/api` 和 `/config` 会报告条目处于 inactive 状态。在正确 wire 上，已知 Provider "
"仍会在 SDK I/O 前拒绝不支持的条目，例如 Qwen `code_interpreter` 或 Anthropic "
"`web_fetch_*`，避免批准、文件、容器和客户端回调生命周期泄漏。已支持 OpenRouter 的 "
"`openrouter:web_search`、`openrouter:web_fetch` 和 "
"`openrouter:datetime`；DeepSeek、Kimi Code 与 OpenCode 不会激活任何此类条目。未知 host "
"及其未来工具结构仍走通用透传。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:586
msgid ""
"Log each provider-side tool call the provider reports line, and show it "
"as a running status phase while it happens. The line is written from the "
"parsed response, so it appears with streaming on or off."
msgstr "记录 provider 报告的每个 provider 侧工具调用行,并在其进行时显示为运行状态阶段。该行从解析后的响应写出,因此流式开或关都会出现。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:589
msgid ""
"Answer a provider's own builtin function calls, so Kimi's `$web_search` "
"(declared as `{ type = \"builtin_function\", function = { name = "
"\"$web_search\" } }`) completes instead of failing as an unknown tool. "
"The declared call is answered with its arguments verbatim, as that "
"provider's protocol requires, without confirmation or result storage."
msgstr ""
"应答 provider 自己的内置函数调用，让 Kimi 的 `$web_search`（声明为 `{ type = "
"\"builtin_function\", function = { name = \"$web_search\" } "
"}`）能完成而不是作为未知工具失败。声明式调用按其参数原样应答，符合该 provider 协议的要求，无需确认，也不存储结果。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:593
msgid ""
"Resume an Anthropic turn the provider paused mid-search (`stop_reason: "
"\"pause_turn\"`) by sending the message back unchanged, instead of ending"
" the turn on what looks like a complete answer. Each resumption counts as"
" one agent step, so it stays bounded by `max_agent_steps`."
msgstr ""
"把 provider 在搜索中途暂停（`stop_reason: \"pause_turn\"`）的 Anthropic "
"回合原样发回继续，而不是在看似完整的答案处结束回合。每次恢复计作一个 agent 步骤，因此始终受 `max_agent_steps` 约束。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:596
msgid ""
"List the sources a provider-side search reported under the answer. "
"Sources are display only: the stored answer stays exactly what the model "
"wrote, and nothing extra replays to the provider."
msgstr "在答案下列出 provider 侧搜索报告的来源。来源仅作展示:存储的答案保持模型写的内容原样,不会有额外内容重放给 provider。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:600
msgid ""
"Prevent a forced live-follow-up acknowledgement from retaining local tool"
" calls returned despite tools being disabled, which could leave invalid "
"history and make the next answer look duplicated. Provider builtin "
"functions that were still offered remain available."
msgstr ""
"修复强制 live follow-up 确认在禁用本地工具时仍保留 Provider "
"返回的本地工具调用，导致历史无效、下一条回答看似重复的问题。请求中仍有提供的 Provider builtin function 不受影响。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:603
msgid ""
"Promote completed streamed text before provider-side tool output, so "
"Responses web search and Anthropic server-tool activity no longer make "
"the answer preview disappear before final output."
msgstr ""
"在 Provider 端工具输出前提升已经完成的流式文本，避免 Responses 联网搜索和 Anthropic "
"服务端工具活动使回答预览在最终输出前消失。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:605
msgid ""
"Publish only the text written after a provider-side tool instead of "
"repeating the promoted opening: a search runs inside one response, so the"
" model keeps writing after it and the answer previously appeared twice in"
" the transcript."
msgstr "Provider 端工具之后只输出新写出的文本，不再重复已提升的开头：搜索发生在同一次响应内部，模型在其后继续书写，此前会导致回答在记录中出现两次。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:608
msgid ""
"Keep token estimation working when a configured `provider.builtin_tools` "
"entry is unsupported on the active wire. `/status`, the status bar, and "
"resuming a session only measure the payload, and raising there took down "
"the frontend over config no request had tried to send; the request that "
"would send it still fails with the same error."
msgstr ""
"当配置的 `provider.builtin_tools` 条目在当前协议上不受支持时，token "
"估算仍可工作。`/status`、状态栏与会话恢复只是测量请求体，在那里抛错会因尚未真正发送的配置而使前端崩溃；真正发送该条目的请求仍然以同样的错误失败。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:612
msgid ""
"Keep the Anthropic extended-thinking budget under the request's own "
"`max_tokens`, which the API requires. With the default `max_tokens = "
"8192`, `/reason high` and above sent a budget the model could not accept,"
" so every request to a pre-4.6 Claude model failed until `max_tokens` was"
" raised."
msgstr ""
"将 Anthropic 扩展思考预算限制在该请求自身的 `max_tokens` 之内（API 的硬性要求）。在默认 `max_tokens = "
"8192` 下，`/reason high` 及以上会发送模型无法接受的预算，导致对 4.6 之前的 Claude "
"模型的每次请求都失败，除非手动调大 `max_tokens`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:615
msgid ""
"Send the resolved reasoning effort on OpenRouter's top-level `reasoning` "
"object, like every other reasoning control, so a documented per-model "
"effort scale applies there too."
msgstr ""
"OpenRouter 顶层 `reasoning` 对象也发送解析后的 reasoning effort，与其他推理控制保持一致，使按模型记录的 "
"effort 档位在该路径同样生效。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:619
msgid "0.18.1 - 2026-07-31"
msgstr "0.18.1 - 2026-07-31"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:622
msgid ""
"Close each turn with a single full-width gray rule carrying its duration "
"(`done in 1m05s ─────…`) instead of the plain `[done in 1m5s]` line. The "
"label sits at the left of the rule rather than centered, and a blank line"
" lifts the rule off the answer. It is the turn's only horizontal rule: "
"the full-width rule that used to open the answer is gone, so a turn no "
"longer shows two rules. The duration reuses the working divider's "
"`elapsed_since` format, so the rule reads like the divider's final frame "
"(`5s`, `1m05s`) instead of `0m5s` / `1m5s`."
msgstr ""
"每个回合以一条全宽灰色规则收尾,携带时长(`done in 1m05s ─────…`),取代原来的普通 `[done in 1m5s]` "
"行。标签位于规则左侧而非居中,一条空行把规则与答案隔开。它是该回合唯一的水平规则:过去用来打开答案的全宽规则已移除,所以一个回合不再显示两条规则。时长复用"
" working 分隔线的 `elapsed_since` 格式,因此规则读起来像分隔线的最后一帧(`5s`、`1m05s`),而不是 "
"`0m5s` / `1m5s`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:631
msgid "0.18.0 - 2026-07-31"
msgstr "0.18.0 - 2026-07-31"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:634
msgid ""
"Add test-only OpenAI behavior emulation for Chat Completions and "
"Responses, including implicit user/tool breakpoints, exact-prefix cache "
"reads, and cache-write accounting."
msgstr ""
"新增仅用于测试的 OpenAI 行为模拟，覆盖 Chat Completions 和 Responses，包括隐式 user/tool "
"breakpoint、精确前缀 cache read 和 cache write 统计。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:636
msgid ""
"Let `Note` view selected working-state fields, and let `RecallContext` "
"list compacted history segments with pagination in addition to retrieving"
" and searching them."
msgstr ""
"`Note` 新增查看指定工作状态字段；`RecallContext` 除取回和搜索外，还可分页列出 compacted history "
"segment。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:638
msgid ""
"Gate idle input tips on feature availability (`$skill` only with skills "
"installed, `@server.tool` only with an MCP server connected), add `Paste "
"an image path to attach it` and a `/ps lists background jobs` tip that "
"appears while a job runs, and re-roll the tip each turn instead of "
"pinning one for the whole session."
msgstr ""
"空闲输入提示按功能可用性过滤（`$skill` 仅在安装了 skill 时出现，`@server.tool` 仅在连接了 MCP "
"服务器时出现），新增 `Paste an image path to attach it` 以及后台任务运行时出现的 `/ps lists "
"background jobs` 提示，并改为每轮重新随机抽取提示，而非整个 session 固定一个。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:642
msgid ""
"Let `Shift-Tab` reverse-cycle the offered next-step chips at the idle "
"prompt, mirroring `Tab`."
msgstr "在空闲提示处用 `Shift-Tab` 反向循环切换建议的下一步 chip，与 `Tab` 对称。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:645
msgid ""
"Make model context append-only between compactions: remove the rebuilt "
"per-request Memory and history-index blocks, retain Note changes as tool "
"history, and emit one complete working-state checkpoint when compaction "
"starts a new cache epoch."
msgstr ""
"Compaction 之间的模型 context 改为 append-only：移除每次请求重建的 Memory 和 history-index "
"块，将 Note 变更保留为工具历史，并在 compaction 开启新 cache epoch 时输出一个完整工作状态 checkpoint。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:648
msgid ""
"Record session start and resume times in the user's local time with an "
"explicit numeric timezone offset. Resume is now a durable user-role "
"lifecycle event shared by Chat Completions and Responses; old snapshots "
"migrate through one complete state checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"使用带明确数字时区偏移的用户本地时间记录 session 开始和 resume 时间。Resume 现在是 Chat Completions 与 "
"Responses 共用的持久 user-role 生命周期事件；旧快照通过一次完整状态 checkpoint 迁移。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:651
msgid ""
"Show provider-reported cache-write tokens alongside cache reads in "
"`/status`."
msgstr "在 `/status` 中同时显示 provider 报告的 cache-write token 与 cache read。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:654
msgid ""
"Keep Ctrl-C silent at an idle prompt: it clears a draft when present and "
"otherwise does nothing, while an actual in-flight request interruption "
"still reports `Cancelled`."
msgstr "让空闲提示符下的 Ctrl-C 保持安静:有草稿时清除草稿,否则什么都不做;真正在途的请求中断仍会报告 `Cancelled`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:656
msgid ""
"Keep compaction, migrated-state, and resume lifecycle checkpoints out of "
"resumed transcripts; they remain available to the model without exposing "
"internal context bookkeeping in the CLI, and a checkpoint-only resume "
"still confirms which session was restored."
msgstr ""
"让压缩、迁移状态和恢复的生命周期检查点不出现在恢复的记录中;它们仍对模型可用,但不会在 CLI "
"中暴露内部上下文记账,仅含检查点的恢复仍会确认恢复了哪个会话。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:659
msgid ""
"Treat strict-schema nulls, empty selector arrays, and irrelevant default "
"arguments as omitted in `Note` and `RecallContext`, including `Note`'s "
"user-facing call summary."
msgstr ""
"在 `Note` 和 `RecallContext` 中,把严格 schema 的 null、空选择器数组和不相关的默认参数视为省略,包括 "
"`Note` 面向用户的调用摘要。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:661
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Show empty `Note` goal and check updates as explicit clears instead of "
"rendering them as `{}`."
msgstr "把空的 `Note` goal 和 check 更新显示为显式清除,而不是渲染为 `{}`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:662
msgid ""
"Keep exactly one blank line between assistant progress and tool calls, "
"and between consecutive tool calls, without splitting a tool's header "
"from its result."
msgstr "在 assistant 进度与工具调用之间、连续的工具调用之间都恰好保留一个空行,不把工具的头与其结果拆开。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:664
msgid ""
"Keep large stale code indexes off the interactive startup path, so "
"repository scanning and re-parsing cannot delay the first text a user "
"types. Existing availability is read cheaply at startup; bounded "
"freshness checks continue after turns, and large syncs remain explicit."
msgstr "让大型过期的代码索引不进入交互式启动路径,这样仓库扫描和重新解析不会延迟用户键入的第一段文本。启动时廉价读取已有可用性;有界的时效检查在回合后继续,大型同步保持显式。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:667
msgid ""
"Keep a session's name once it is latched from a goal: revising the goal "
"no longer overwrites the name, matching how user-set names already "
"behave."
msgstr "session 名称一旦由 goal 确定便固定下来：修改 goal 不再覆盖名称，与用户手动设置的名称行为一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:671
msgid "0.17.0 - 2026-07-29"
msgstr "0.17.0 - 2026-07-29"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:674
msgid ""
"Name sessions and find them again. Every session takes a name from its "
"opening message, then from the agent's goal once there is one, and `/name"
" TEXT` sets your own that nothing overwrites."
msgstr ""
"为 session 命名并能再次找到它们。每个 session 先从开场消息取名，在 agent 有了目标之后改用该目标，而 `/name "
"TEXT` 设置的名称不会被任何规则覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:676
msgid ""
"`/sessions` browses saved sessions and re-enters one, with search, ages, "
"and turn counts; `/sessions all` widens past the current project. "
"Choosing a session ends the current run and starts the next one on it."
msgstr ""
"`/sessions` 浏览已保存的 session 并进入其中一个，带搜索、最后活动时间与轮数；`/sessions all` "
"会扩大到当前项目之外。选择一个 session 会结束当前运行，并以它开始下一次运行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:679
msgid ""
"`--resume` accepts a name or a uid prefix, not just a full uid. An "
"ambiguous query lists the sessions it matched instead of guessing between"
" them."
msgstr "`--resume` 现在接受名称或 uid 前缀，而不只是完整 uid。当查询有歧义时，会列出匹配到的 session，而不是替你猜一个。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:681
msgid ""
"The model can offer 2–3 short next-step prompts after its answer with "
"`NextHints`; they show as selectable chips at the idle prompt (Tab "
"cycles, Enter submits), `/hints` toggles them off, and an all-`NextHints`"
" batch ends the turn in a single model call so the answer appears once."
msgstr ""
"模型可在回答后通过 `NextHints` 提供 2–3 个简短的下一步提示；它们会以可选择的 chip 形式显示在 idle 提示符处（Tab "
"循环、Enter 提交），`/hints` 可将其关闭；纯 `NextHints` 工具批会在一次模型调用内结束本轮，使答案只显示一次。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:686
msgid ""
"Cap model output at 8,192 tokens per request by default instead of "
"leaving compatible providers unbounded; set `provider.max_tokens = 0` to "
"use the provider default."
msgstr ""
"默认将每次请求的模型输出限制为 8,192 tokens，而不是让兼容 provider 无上限生成；设置 "
"`provider.max_tokens = 0` 可使用 provider 默认值。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:688
msgid ""
"A successful `NextHints` call prints no call/result log line: its effect "
"shows as chips at the idle prompt, so the line was noise. Failed calls "
"still surface their error."
msgstr ""
"成功调用 `NextHints` 时不打印调用/结果日志行：其效果已显示为 idle 提示符处的 "
"chip，因此该日志只是噪声。失败的调用仍会显示错误。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:692
msgid ""
"Keep terminal `NextHints` turns from replaying the same provider response"
" twice, which made the next Responses API request fail with a duplicate "
"message ID."
msgstr ""
"避免终止型 `NextHints` 回合重复回放同一 provider response；此前会导致下一次 Responses API 请求因 "
"message ID 重复而失败。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:694
msgid ""
"Stop replaying a streamed answer at the end of a terminal `NextHints` "
"turn. The batch promotes its answer into scrollback like any tool batch, "
"but the post-turn emit then printed the same text again."
msgstr ""
"终止型 `NextHints` 回合结束时不再重复显示已流式输出的答案。该工具批会像其他工具批一样将答案提升到 "
"scrollback，但回合结束后的输出此前又打印了一次相同文本。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:698
msgid "0.16.0 - 2026-07-29"
msgstr "0.16.0 - 2026-07-29"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:701
msgid ""
"Show the latest request's prompt-cache hit ratio live in the status bar, "
"beside the context fill as `ctx 23% · cache 98%`, refreshing with each "
"model response so a drop in prefix reuse is visible without running "
"`/status`. The ratio stays hidden until the first request."
msgstr ""
"在状态栏实时显示最近一次请求的提示缓存命中率，紧跟上下文占用显示为 `ctx 23% · cache 98%`，并随每次模型响应刷新，无需运行 "
"`/status` 即可看到前缀复用的下降。该比率在首次请求前保持隐藏。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:706
msgid ""
"Declutter the status bar. The cache ratio folds into the context segment "
"instead of taking its own field, and the `step N/M` counter now appears "
"only once the turn reaches the final fifth of `max_agent_steps`, since a "
"count like `step 1/200` carries no information far from the cap and only "
"matters as the turn approaches the cutoff that ends it."
msgstr ""
"精简状态栏。缓存命中率并入上下文段，不再单独占用一个字段；`step N/M` 计数现在只在本轮步数进入 `max_agent_steps` "
"的最后五分之一时才出现，因为像 `step 1/200` 这样的计数在远离上限时没有信息量，只有在本轮接近使其结束的上限时才有意义。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:710
msgid ""
"Smooth and lighten the working divider. Its comet head advanced 6.8 cells"
" between redraws, more than the width of its own glow, so the motion read"
" as a dash blinking at scattered positions; the animation now runs on a "
"30fps ticker while the running region is up, at one cell per frame, and "
"fades between cells so a late frame does not snap. The head is a softer "
"cyan fading into a muted rule instead of bold bright cyan over the "
"terminal's default gray."
msgstr ""
"让工作分隔线更平滑、更轻。彗星头部在两次重绘之间前进 6.8 "
"格，超过自身辉光的宽度，动效因此看起来像是短横线在随机位置闪烁；现在只要运行区域可见，动画就由 30fps "
"的节拍驱动，每帧前进一格，并在相邻格之间渐隐，某一帧迟到也不会跳变。头部改为更柔和的青色，向低饱和的分隔线渐隐，不再是压在终端默认灰色之上的加粗亮青色。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:715
msgid ""
"Lighten the status bar. Its working sweep is a softer crest over a "
"quieter gradient, quantized into bands so neighbouring cells share a "
"color: the terminal receives about a third of the escape sequences per "
"frame and the set of styles stays bounded instead of growing for the life"
" of the process. The sweep now follows the theme, so a light terminal "
"gets a dark crest rather than a washed-out bright one, and the idle line "
"sits a shade below full white."
msgstr "让状态栏更轻。工作态的扫光是更柔和的波峰掠过更安静的渐变，并按色带量化，使相邻单元共用同一种颜色：终端每帧收到的转义序列约为原来的三分之一，样式集合也保持有界，不再随进程运行不断增长。扫光现在跟随主题，浅色终端得到深色波峰，而不是被冲淡的亮色；闲置状态的行也比纯白低一档。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:722
msgid ""
"Keep a streamed response's promotion below the live follow-up it answers."
" Follow-ups reach scrollback only once the request that carried them "
"returns, so promoting mid-stream printed the answer above the message "
"that prompted it."
msgstr "流式回复的提前落盘不再排在它所回答的追加消息之前。追加消息要等携带它的那次请求返回后才进入终端回滚区，因此在流式过程中提前落盘，会把回答打印在引出它的那条消息上方。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:725
msgid ""
"Count Anthropic's cache tokens in the prompt total. `input_tokens` "
"excludes what was read from or written to the cache, so a warm request "
"reported a cache ratio far above 100% and a token total covering only the"
" uncached remainder."
msgstr ""
"将 Anthropic 的缓存 token 计入提示词总量。`input_tokens` "
"不包含从缓存读取或写入缓存的部分，因此命中缓存的请求会报出远超 100% 的缓存命中率，token 总量也只覆盖未命中的那部分。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:728
msgid ""
"Promote completed streamed response text from the dim `responding` "
"preview into terminal scrollback before tool output begins. Responses and"
" Anthropic use their explicit text/tool block boundaries without assuming"
" which arrives first; Chat Completions promotes at its tool-call finish "
"boundary."
msgstr ""
"在工具输出开始之前，把已完成的流式回复文本从暗色的 `responding` 预览提升到终端回滚区。Responses 与 Anthropic "
"使用各自显式的文本/工具块边界，不假设两者的先后顺序；Chat Completions 则在工具调用结束的边界提升。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:732
msgid ""
"Label the working divider `compacting context` during automatic context "
"compaction, then restore `working` before the normal model request, "
"instead of presenting a long compaction call as generic work while the "
"context meter remains full."
msgstr ""
"自动压缩上下文期间，把工作分隔线标记为 `compacting context`，并在恢复正常模型请求前改回 "
"`working`，不再把耗时很长的压缩调用显示为普通工作，而上下文占用却始终满格。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:737
msgid "0.15.0 - 2026-07-28"
msgstr "0.15.0 - 2026-07-28"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:740
msgid ""
"Report when retention deletes saved sessions, naming the count, the "
"inactivity window, and the setting that governs it, instead of removing "
"unrecoverable work silently."
msgstr "清理过期 session 时给出提示，说明删除的数量、判定所用的闲置天数，以及控制该行为的配置项，不再静默删除无法恢复的记录。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:744
msgid ""
"Start roughly four times faster, so a fresh prompt accepts and echoes "
"input immediately instead of lagging behind the first characters typed. "
"The Anthropic and OpenAI SDKs cost about 0.8s to import and are not "
"needed until the first request; they now load lazily and are warmed in "
"the background while the prompt is already accepting input."
msgstr ""
"启动速度约提升四倍：新的提示符会立即接受并回显输入，不再落后于最先键入的字符。Anthropic 与 OpenAI SDK 的导入约需 0.8 "
"秒，且在首次请求前并不需要；现在改为惰性导入，并在提示符已可输入时于后台预热。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:748
msgid ""
"Sweep expired sessions on a background thread. The scan reads every "
"session file's timestamp, which is negligible on a local disk but can "
"take seconds on a network-mounted home directory, where it previously "
"delayed the prompt."
msgstr ""
"过期 session 的清理改在后台线程进行。该扫描会读取每个 session 文件的时间戳，在本地磁盘上开销可忽略，但在网络挂载的 home "
"目录下可能耗时数秒，此前会因此拖慢提示符。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:753
msgid ""
"Cap the input history file at 512 KB instead of letting it grow for the "
"life of the install. prompt-toolkit only appends to it, so every line "
"ever typed was kept. The newest entries are retained and older ones "
"dropped at an entry boundary, so recall keeps working and the file stays "
"loadable."
msgstr ""
"将输入历史文件上限设为 512 KB，不再随安装的整个生命周期无限增长。prompt-toolkit "
"只会向其追加，因此此前键入过的每一行都会保留。现在保留最近的条目，并在条目边界处丢弃较早的内容，既不影响历史调取，也保证文件仍可正常加载。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:759
msgid "0.14.1 - 2026-07-28"
msgstr "0.14.1 - 2026-07-28"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:762
msgid ""
"Add a `ViewImage` tool that lets the agent proactively inspect local PNG,"
" JPEG, WebP, and single-frame GIF files through the active model's image "
"input, with confirmation for paths outside the workspace and durable "
"provider-neutral replay across Chat Completions, Responses, and Anthropic"
" Messages."
msgstr ""
"新增 `ViewImage` 工具，使 agent 可通过当前模型的图片输入主动查看本地 PNG、JPEG、WebP 和单帧 GIF 文件；查看 "
"workspace 外的路径需要确认，并可在 Chat Completions、Responses 和 Anthropic Messages 间以"
" provider-neutral 形式持久回放。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:765
msgid ""
"Drop the per-request response-language reminder added in 0.14.0 and state"
" the contract once, in the system prompt. The reminder sat immediately "
"before the user's request as a block of English prose, which reinforced "
"the English drift it was meant to prevent; every visible message and "
"reasoning step must use the dominant language of the user's recent "
"substantive messages from its first token, without translating at the end"
" or switching after tool results."
msgstr ""
"移除 0.14.0 "
"加入的逐请求回复语言提醒,把该契约在系统提示词中陈述一次。该提醒以一段英文散文的形式紧贴在用户请求之前,反而强化了它本要防止的英文漂移;每一条可见消息和推理步骤都必须从第一个"
" token 起使用用户近期实质性消息的主导语言,不在结尾翻译,也不在工具结果之后切换。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:766
msgid ""
"Reduce fixed model-context overhead by consolidating repeated system "
"instructions and removing tool signatures and redundant examples already "
"expressed by each tool's JSON Schema, while retaining concise system "
"guidance for tool selection and lifecycle. Tool names, parameters, and "
"execution behavior remain unchanged. Keep visible model output concise by"
" default without limiting detail when requested or necessary."
msgstr ""
"通过合并重复的系统指令、移除已被每个工具 JSON Schema "
"表达的签名和冗余示例,降低固定的模型上下文开销,同时保留工具选择与生命周期的简洁系统指引。工具名、参数和执行行为不变。默认保持可见的模型输出简洁,但在要求或必要时不限制细节。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:769
msgid ""
"Recover up to five times when a model prints a known tool's `<invoke>` "
"markup as final text: discard each malformed response, clear its live "
"preview, and retry with a request-local native-call correction. A sixth "
"textual call stops without execution, session-history pollution, or a "
"misleading done marker."
msgstr ""
"当模型把已知工具的 `<invoke>` "
"标记作为最终文本输出时,最多恢复五次:丢弃每个畸形响应,清除其实时预览,并用请求本地的原生调用纠正重试。第六次文本调用会停止,不执行、不污染会话历史,也不留下误导性的"
" done 标记。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:770
msgid ""
"Let Edit safely relocate a stale anchor when the same line hash is unique"
" across the file and moved by at most 50 lines; ambiguous, distant, and "
"content-changing edits remain rejected."
msgstr "当同一行哈希在整个文件中唯一且最多移动 50 行时,允许 Edit 安全地重定位过期锚点;歧义、过远和改变内容的编辑仍被拒绝。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:771
msgid ""
"Accept a model's harmless duplicate of Edit's top-level path inside an "
"operation while continuing to reject conflicting nested paths and other "
"unexpected fields."
msgstr "接受模型在操作内无害地重复 Edit 的顶层路径,同时继续拒绝冲突的嵌套路径和其他意外字段。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:774
msgid "0.14.0 - 2026-07-27"
msgstr "0.14.0 - 2026-07-27"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:777
msgid ""
"Keep agent action within the phase the user actually requested: "
"preparation, investigation, and plans no longer imply permission to "
"implement, and live follow-ups can pause or narrow work immediately. "
"Calibrate reasoning depth to task risk so routine, reversible work "
"proceeds once the next step is clear while ambiguous or high-risk "
"decisions retain deeper analysis."
msgstr ""
"将 agent "
"的行动限制在用户实际要求的阶段内：准备、调查和计划不再隐含实施权限，实时追加指令可以立即暂停或收窄工作。根据任务风险校准推理深度，使常规、可逆的工作在下一步明确后立即推进，同时为模糊或高风险决策保留更深入的分析。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:778
msgid ""
"Preserve Chat reasoning in session history while replaying only the "
"history each provider documents: full preserved thinking where required "
"or explicitly enabled, tool-call reasoning within active tool loops for "
"providers that clear older thinking, and DeepSeek tool-call reasoning "
"across later requests. Context and compaction estimates now follow the "
"effective Chat, Responses, or Anthropic wire payload instead of counting "
"normalized fields that will not be sent."
msgstr ""
"在 session history 中保留 Chat reasoning，同时只按各 provider 的文档要求回放：在强制或显式启用 "
"preserved thinking 时完整保留；对会清理旧思考的 provider，仅在当前工具调用链内保留 "
"reasoning；DeepSeek 的工具调用 reasoning 则继续随之后的请求回传。Context 与 compaction "
"估算现在基于实际的 Chat、Responses 或 Anthropic wire payload，不再计算最终不会发送的标准化字段。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:779
msgid ""
"Add a generic 10-minute `provider.response_timeout` hard limit across "
"streaming and non-streaming model calls, separate from the 120-second "
"transport inactivity timeout. The hard limit closes the active request "
"without automatic retries; set it to `0` to disable it."
msgstr ""
"为流式和非流式模型调用新增通用的 10 分钟 `provider.response_timeout` 硬时限，与 120 "
"秒传输无数据超时相互独立。达到硬时限后会关闭当前请求且不自动重试；设为 `0` 可禁用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:782
msgid ""
"Reinforce the user's response language at the latest-user request "
"boundary on every model step, including visible reasoning and progress, "
"without rewriting stored session history."
msgstr "在每次模型调用的最新用户请求边界强化回复语言约束，包括可见 reasoning 和进度信息，同时不改写已存储的 session history。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:783
msgid ""
"Preserve OpenRouter's `reasoning`, `reasoning_content`, and structured "
"`reasoning_details` in both streaming and non-streaming Chat responses, "
"and retain nested `thinking.keep` or `thinking.clear_thinking` settings "
"when minacode adds its managed thinking mode."
msgstr ""
"在流式和非流式 Chat 响应中保留 OpenRouter 的 `reasoning`、`reasoning_content` 与结构化 "
"`reasoning_details`；minacode 添加其管理的 thinking mode 时，也保留嵌套的 "
"`thinking.keep` 或 `thinking.clear_thinking` 配置。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:784
msgid ""
"Allow `Edit create` in an existing directory outside the workspace while "
"still refusing to create missing external parent directories implicitly. "
"The error now tells the agent to create such a directory with an approved"
" `Bash mkdir`, and Bash's tool description clarifies that commands start "
"in the workspace rather than being confined to it."
msgstr ""
"允许 `Edit create` 在 workspace 外已存在的目录中创建文件，同时仍拒绝隐式创建缺失的外部父目录。错误信息现在会提示 "
"agent 通过经确认的 `Bash mkdir` 创建此类目录；Bash 的工具说明也明确命令从 workspace 启动，而非被限制在其中。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:785
msgid ""
"Move follow-ups already sent in the active request above the working "
"divider while retaining them internally for safe retry, keep only unsent "
"input in the queue region, and let recalled-input retries return to the "
"normal `retrying`, `thinking`, and `responding` states instead of leaving"
" a stale `revising queued input` label."
msgstr ""
"将已随当前请求发送的追加指令移到 working 分隔线上方，同时在内部保留以供安全重试；排队区只显示尚未发送的输入；召回输入触发重试后恢复正常的"
" `retrying`、`thinking` 和 `responding` 状态，不再残留 `revising queued input` 标签。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:788
msgid "0.13.0 - 2026-07-26"
msgstr "0.13.0 - 2026-07-26"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:791
msgid ""
"Add top-level `minacode update` and `minacode upgrade` commands that "
"check PyPI and use the detected installer (`uv tool`, `pipx`, or `pip`) "
"when an upgrade is available; startup hints now show the same command."
msgstr ""
"新增顶层 `minacode update` 与 `minacode upgrade` 命令,检查 PyPI "
"并在有升级时使用检测到的安装器(`uv tool`、`pipx` 或 `pip`);启动提示现在显示相同的命令。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:792
msgid ""
"Stream reasoning and answer text by default over OpenAI-compatible Chat "
"Completions, OpenAI Responses, and Anthropic Messages. The running TUI "
"now distinguishes `thinking` from `responding` while preserving the "
"completed Rich transcript, tool-call replay, usage accounting, "
"cancellation, and retry behavior."
msgstr ""
"默认通过 OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions、OpenAI Responses 和 Anthropic "
"Messages 流式展示推理与回答文本。运行中的 TUI 现在会区分 `thinking` 和 `responding`，同时保留完整的 "
"Rich transcript、工具调用回放、用量统计、中断和重试行为。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:793
msgid ""
"Add the generic `provider.stream` setting, enabled by default and "
"switchable for the current session with `/set provider.stream on|off`, so"
" compatible endpoints that reject streaming or Chat `stream_options` "
"retain a non-streaming path without provider specialization."
msgstr ""
"新增通用的 `provider.stream` 配置，默认启用，并可通过 `/set provider.stream on|off` 在当前 "
"session 中切换，使拒绝流式请求或 Chat `stream_options` 的兼容 endpoint 无需 provider "
"特化也能保留非流式路径。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:794
msgid ""
"Accept local image paths directly in the interactive prompt, render "
"recognized files as editable inline labels, preserve them across queued "
"follow-ups and resumed sessions, and send the corresponding standard "
"image content through OpenAI-compatible Chat, OpenAI Responses, and "
"Anthropic Messages without provider- or model-name specialization."
msgstr ""
"可直接在交互式 prompt 中输入本地图片路径，将识别到的文件显示为可编辑的内联标签，并在排队的追加指令和恢复后的 session "
"中保留图片；无需按 provider 或模型名称特化，即可通过 OpenAI-compatible Chat、OpenAI Responses 和"
" Anthropic Messages 发送对应的标准图片内容。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:795
msgid ""
"Allow the generic `provider.image_input` setting to force or disable "
"image input, and learn support conservatively from successful requests or"
" explicit modality errors so later known-unsupported submissions keep "
"their draft."
msgstr ""
"可通过通用的 `provider.image_input` "
"配置强制开启或禁用图片输入，并仅根据成功请求或明确的模态错误谨慎学习支持状态，使后续已知不受支持的提交保留原草稿。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:796
msgid ""
"Add `/api` to select or set the request protocol during a session, and "
"confirm it as a step in the `/provider` and `/model` selection chains. An"
" endpoint serving several model families rarely serves them all over one "
"protocol, and an OpenAI-compatible `/models` listing does not say which "
"serves what, so a discovered model could be selected and then rejected as"
" unsupported with no in-session way to change the wire. The reply names "
"the protocol that took effect rather than echoing `auto` back."
msgstr ""
"新增 `/api`,用于在会话中选择或设置请求协议,并在 `/provider` 和 `/model` "
"的选择链路中作为一步确认。一个服务多个模型家族的端点很少用一个协议服务全部,OpenAI 兼容的 `/models` "
"列表也不会说明哪个协议服务哪个模型,因此发现的模型可能被选中,随后以不受支持为由被拒绝,而会话内没有改 wire "
"的办法。回复指明生效的协议,而不是回显 `auto`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:797
msgid ""
"Support OpenAI's Responses protocol with `provider.api = \"responses\"` "
"(also inferred from a `/responses` URL), including standardized reasoning"
" effort, flattened function tools, tool-result round trips, cached-token "
"usage, stateless requests, and replay of opaque reasoning items across "
"turns."
msgstr ""
"支持 OpenAI Responses 协议：可设置 `provider.api = \"responses\"`，也可从 "
"`/responses` URL 推断；包括标准 reasoning effort、扁平 function tool、tool result "
"往返、缓存 token 用量、无状态请求，以及跨轮回放不透明 reasoning item。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:798
msgid ""
"Document provider setup alongside the rest of the configuration, keeping "
"the user-facing guide focused on settings rather than internal "
"compatibility profiles."
msgstr "将 provider 设置并入配置文档，让面向用户的指南聚焦配置项，而不是内部兼容性 profile。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:801
msgid ""
"Render `/help` as structured Rich Markdown in interactive terminals while"
" retaining a clean plain-text fallback for redirected and non-TTY output."
msgstr "在交互终端把 `/help` 渲染为结构化的 Rich Markdown,同时为重定向和非 TTY 输出保留干净的纯文本回退。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:802
msgid ""
"Keep long-running model requests visually neutral instead of turning the "
"status bar red or prompting `/resend` based only on elapsed time; real "
"retries and their causes remain visible."
msgstr "让长时间运行的模型请求在视觉上保持中性,而不是仅根据耗时把状态栏变红或提示 `/resend`;真实的重试及其原因仍然可见。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:803
msgid ""
"Require exposed reasoning and thinking summaries to follow the user's "
"current language, alongside progress updates and final answers."
msgstr "要求公开显示的 reasoning 和 thinking 摘要与进度更新及最终回答一样，遵循用户当前使用的语言。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:804
msgid ""
"Consolidate image recognition, asset storage, protocol payloads, token "
"estimates, and learned capability into one session-owned `ImageInputs` "
"component instead of module-level helpers and Session forwarding methods."
msgstr ""
"将图片识别、asset 存储、协议 payload、token 估算和能力学习统一收敛到 session 持有的 `ImageInputs` "
"组件，替代模块级 helper 和 Session 转发方法。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:805
msgid ""
"Expand CLI and command validation coverage, remove an import-order "
"dependency from resume tests, and replace fixed integration-test waits "
"with event-driven synchronization; the full suite now finishes "
"substantially faster while retaining real tmux, subprocess, and signal "
"coverage."
msgstr ""
"扩展 CLI 和命令校验的覆盖,移除恢复测试中的导入顺序依赖,把固定的集成测试等待换成事件驱动同步;全套测试现在明显更快,同时保留真实的 "
"tmux、子进程和信号覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:806
msgid ""
"Split the oversized tool test module into focused core, edit, and "
"Bash/Job suites, and expand shared validation, strict-schema, optional-"
"capability, and background-job coverage."
msgstr "把过大的工具测试模块拆成聚焦的 core、edit 与 Bash/Job 套件,并扩展共享校验、严格 schema、可选能力与后台任务覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:807
msgid ""
"Add Pyright to CI and tighten internal annotations around tool arguments,"
" lifecycle resources, MCP operations, and validated dynamic input while "
"preserving `Any` at JSON and third-party SDK boundaries where the value "
"is intentionally open-ended."
msgstr ""
"在 CI 中加入 Pyright,收紧工具参数、生命周期资源、MCP 操作与校验过的动态输入周围的内部注解,同时在 JSON 与第三方 SDK "
"边界处保留 `Any`,那里取值是刻意开放的。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:808
msgid ""
"Consolidate the small protocol-adaptation helpers into `provider_compat`,"
" removing a thin module boundary while keeping provider-specific behavior"
" isolated."
msgstr "将少量协议适配 helper 合并到 `provider_compat`，移除过薄的模块边界，同时继续隔离 provider 特有行为。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:809
msgid ""
"Split the terminal frontend into focused `loop`, `tui`, and `render` "
"modules without adding forwarding layers or changing behavior."
msgstr "将终端前端拆分为职责清晰的 `loop`、`tui` 和 `render` 模块，不增加转发层，也不改变行为。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:810
msgid ""
"Keep up to three lines from each completed Bash output stream in the "
"transcript, with `Ctrl-O` offering a larger 24-line preview for recent "
"commands."
msgstr "在记录中保留每个已完成的 Bash 输出流最多三行,`Ctrl-O` 为最近的命令提供更大的 24 行预览。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:811
msgid ""
"Replace wildcard imports between minacode modules with explicit imports, "
"and have Ruff reject any future `import *` usage."
msgstr "把 minacode 模块之间的通配导入替换为显式导入,并让 Ruff 拒绝任何未来的 `import *` 用法。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:812
msgid ""
"Make `/status` context and prompt-cache usage immediately readable with "
"compact progress bars, token counts, and percentages, while retaining its"
" Rich table and hiding empty detail."
msgstr "让 `/status` 的上下文与 prompt 缓存用量立即可读:紧凑进度条、token 数与百分比,同时保留其 Rich 表格并隐藏空细节。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:813
msgid ""
"Lower the default provider request timeout from 180 seconds to 120 "
"seconds; explicitly configured values are unchanged."
msgstr "将 provider 请求的默认超时从 180 秒降至 120 秒；显式配置的值不受影响。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:814
msgid ""
"Increase transient model retries from two to five, and show attempts with"
" concise reasons in the running TUI, such as `retrying 2/6 · timeout`, "
"then keep `attempt 2/6` visible while the replacement request continues."
msgstr ""
"将模型瞬时错误重试次数从两次增加到五次，并在运行中的 TUI 里显示简短原因，例如 `retrying 2/6 · "
"timeout`；替代请求继续时保留 `attempt 2/6`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:815
msgid ""
"Resolve explicit settings and necessary provider compatibility overrides "
"once into a typed request policy, keeping the default OpenAI-compatible "
"path generic and protocol request builders independent from host-profile "
"storage. Domain overrides match real subdomains, and OpenCode routing "
"uses broad Claude, Qwen, and GPT families because its single base URL "
"multiplexes different wire protocols by model."
msgstr ""
"将显式设置和必要的 provider 兼容覆盖一次性解析为类型化请求策略，使默认 OpenAI-compatible "
"路径保持通用，并让协议请求构造与 host profile 存储相互独立。Domain 覆盖只匹配真实子域名；由于 OpenCode 的单一 "
"base URL 会按模型复用不同 wire protocol，其路由使用宽泛的 Claude、Qwen 和 GPT family。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:816
msgid ""
"Detect OpenAI reasoning through the `o` and `gpt-5` model families "
"instead of enumerating releases. Aliyun endpoints under `aliyuncs.com` "
"use `reasoning_effort` only for the documented Qwen3.8 family, including "
"`none` for `/reason off`, so existing `chat_reasoning = \"auto\"` "
"configurations work without per-model overrides."
msgstr ""
"通过 `o` 和 `gpt-5` model family 识别 OpenAI reasoning，不枚举具体版本。`aliyuncs.com` "
"下的阿里云 endpoint 只对有文档依据的 Qwen3.8 family 使用 `reasoning_effort`，其中 `/reason "
"off` 使用 `none`，因此现有 `chat_reasoning = \"auto\"` 配置无需逐模型覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:817
msgid ""
"Stop imposing the obsolete 32K output cap on DeepSeek; current models use"
" the server-side default unless `provider.max_tokens` is explicitly "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"不再对 DeepSeek 强加已过时的 32K 输出上限；除非显式设置 `provider.max_tokens`，当前模型使用 server "
"端默认值。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:818
msgid ""
"Raise the normalized `minimal` manual-thinking budget to the provider-"
"supported 1,024-token floor instead of sending an invalid 256-token "
"Anthropic budget."
msgstr ""
"将统一的 `minimal` manual-thinking budget 提高到 provider 支持的 1,024 token "
"下限，不再发送无效的 256 token Anthropic budget。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:819
msgid ""
"Add documented compatibility overrides for Kimi and Z.AI across their "
"international and China endpoints. Kimi Code remains distinct from the "
"open platform; both Z.AI regions share GLM-5.2+ `reasoning_effort`, Kimi "
"keeps its documented `prompt_cache_key`, and Z.AI relies on automatic "
"context caching."
msgstr ""
"为 Kimi 和 Z.AI 的国际版与中国版 endpoint 添加有文档依据的兼容覆盖。Kimi Code 与开放平台保持独立；Z.AI "
"两个区域共享 GLM-5.2+ `reasoning_effort`，Kimi 保留有文档支持的 `prompt_cache_key`，Z.AI "
"使用自动 context cache。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:822
msgid ""
"Prevent models from narrating assumed tool failures and issuing "
"speculative retries before minacode has executed their pending calls by "
"making the tool-result boundary explicit in the system prompt."
msgstr "通过在系统提示词中把工具结果边界说明显化,防止模型在 minacode 执行其挂起调用之前叙述假定的工具失败并发起投机性重试。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:823
msgid ""
"Clear the transient thinking preview before printing `Cancelled`, so "
"interrupted reasoning does not remain in terminal scrollback. Protocol-"
"required reasoning data is still retained in the session."
msgstr ""
"在打印 `Cancelled` 前清除临时 thinking 预览，避免被中断的推理残留在终端回滚历史中；协议要求的 reasoning "
"数据仍会保留在 session 内。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:824
msgid ""
"Preserve image references when the simple CLI combines resumed queued "
"inputs; joining their text previously left internal image markers without"
" attachments and crashed before dispatch."
msgstr "简单 CLI 合并恢复出的排队输入时保留图片引用；此前拼接文本会留下没有附件的内部图片标记，并在发送前崩溃。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:825
msgid ""
"Reject an ambiguous streamed Chat tool-call fragment when a compatibility"
" endpoint omits both `index` and `id`, instead of silently appending its "
"arguments to the wrong parallel tool call."
msgstr ""
"兼容 endpoint 同时省略 `index` 和 `id`、导致 Chat "
"流式工具调用片段无法判定归属时明确拒绝，不再静默把参数追加到错误的并行工具调用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:826
msgid ""
"Keep configured `temperature` on unversioned Anthropic aliases when no "
"thinking mode was inferred, and report a clean CLI error if "
"`update`/`upgrade` cannot launch its detected package manager."
msgstr ""
"未能为无版本 Anthropic 别名推断 thinking 模式时保留已配置的 `temperature`；`update`/`upgrade`"
" 无法启动检测到的包管理器时显示清晰的 CLI 错误。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:827
msgid ""
"Omit the optional Responses `reasoning` object for documented non-"
"reasoning models such as OpenAI GPT-4.1; it supports the Responses "
"endpoint but rejects reasoning controls, so both the default effort and "
"`/reason off` now produce a valid request."
msgstr ""
"对于 OpenAI GPT-4.1 等文档明确的非推理模型，省略可选的 Responses `reasoning` 对象；这些模型支持 "
"Responses endpoint，但会拒绝 reasoning 控制，因此默认 effort 和 `/reason off` "
"现在都能生成有效请求。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:828
msgid ""
"Keep streamed Chat tool calls distinct when a compatible endpoint omits "
"their indexes, and treat a repeated function name as the complete name "
"instead of concatenating it into an unknown tool."
msgstr "兼容 endpoint 省略 index 时仍保持各个 Chat 流式工具调用相互独立；重复出现的函数名按完整名称处理，不再拼接成未知工具。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:829
msgid ""
"Return partial Responses output when a streamed response ends as "
"`incomplete`, matching the non-streaming path, while rejecting genuinely "
"`failed` responses consistently on both paths."
msgstr ""
"流式 Responses 以 `incomplete` 结束时返回部分输出，与非流式路径保持一致；真正的 `failed` response "
"则在两条路径中统一拒绝。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:830
msgid ""
"Keep automatic and manual compaction output out of the live `responding` "
"preview; only the user-facing model request streams into the TUI."
msgstr "自动和手动 compaction 的输出不再进入实时 `responding` 预览；只有面向用户的模型请求会流式显示在 TUI 中。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:831
msgid ""
"Learn image support only from requests that actually transmit images and "
"resolve to an eligible 400, 415, or 422 response, preserving permission "
"and unrelated provider errors; omit image-tile estimates when historical "
"images are sent as labels."
msgstr ""
"仅从实际发送图片且解析为适用的 400、415 或 422 响应的请求中学习识图支持状态，保留权限错误及其他无关 provider "
"错误；历史图片以标签发送时，不再计入图片 tile 估算。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:832
msgid ""
"Keep internal image-capability state out of the prompt, and render "
"actionable image-input errors in their own TUI row instead of exposing "
"the newline as `^J` inside the editable input. Text-only schema "
"rejections such as `unknown variant image_url, expected text` are "
"recognized explicitly and name the active provider/model."
msgstr ""
"把内部的图像能力状态排除在提示之外，并在独立的 TUI 行中呈现可操作的图像输入错误，而不是把换行符暴露为可编辑输入中的 `^J`。纯文本 "
"schema 拒绝（如 `unknown variant image_url, expected text`）会被明确识别，并点名当前 "
"provider/model。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:833
msgid ""
"Render Edit diff previews as solid red and green bands across every "
"visual row, including line-number gutters and wrapped continuations, "
"instead of dropping all padding whenever one changed line exceeded the "
"terminal width."
msgstr "把 Edit diff 预览渲染为每个可见行上的实心红绿条,包括行号沟槽和换行的延续行,而不是在某条变更行超过终端宽度时丢弃所有内边距。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:834
msgid ""
"Send each known Claude generation the thinking configuration it accepts. "
"Extended thinking (`thinking.type = \"enabled\"` with `budget_tokens`) is"
" rejected with a 400 from Claude 4.7 onward, so those models and the 4.6 "
"generation now use adaptive thinking with `output_config.effort`, while "
"Claude 4.5 and earlier keep their token budget; Opus 4.5 also receives "
"its documented effort field. Unversioned gateway aliases remain "
"unconfigured rather than being guessed as current-generation models. "
"`/reason off` disables thinking where that is allowed and is omitted on "
"the always-thinking families, which reject it."
msgstr ""
"为每个已知 Claude generation 发送其接受的 thinking 配置。Claude 4.7 起会以 400 拒绝带 "
"`budget_tokens` 的 extended thinking（`thinking.type = "
"\"enabled\"`），因此这些模型和 4.6 generation 现在使用带 `output_config.effort` 的 "
"adaptive thinking；Claude 4.5 及更早版本保留 token budget，Opus 4.5 还会收到其有文档支持的 "
"effort 字段。无版本 gateway alias 保持不配置，不再猜测为当前 generation。`/reason off` "
"会在允许时关闭 thinking；对于会拒绝该设置的 always-thinking family 则省略。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:835
msgid ""
"Echo Anthropic assistant turns back verbatim, thinking blocks and "
"signatures included, as the Messages API requires for multi-turn and "
"tool-use conversations; they were previously rebuilt from text and tool "
"calls."
msgstr ""
"按照 Messages API 对多轮和工具调用对话的要求，逐字回放 Anthropic assistant turn，包括 thinking "
"block 和 signature；此前这些内容由 text 和 tool call 重建。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:836
msgid ""
"Route OpenCode's GPT models to their documented Responses endpoint, "
"alongside the existing Claude and Qwen routing to Messages."
msgstr ""
"将 OpenCode 的 GPT 模型路由到有文档依据的 Responses endpoint，同时保留 Claude 和 Qwen 到 "
"Messages 的现有路由。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:837
msgid ""
"Apply the resolved provider policy to Responses requests too: reasoning "
"effort uses the active protocol's documented mapping, GPT-5.1+ Responses "
"models receive `none` for `/reason off`, unsupported off settings report "
"an error instead of silently using the model default, and `temperature` "
"is omitted for OpenAI reasoning models that reject it. Sibling chat "
"models such as `gpt-4o` keep their sampling control."
msgstr ""
"Responses 请求也使用解析后的 provider policy：reasoning effort "
"采用当前协议有文档依据的映射；GPT-5.1+ Responses 模型的 `/reason off` 收到 `none`；不支持的 off "
"设置会报错，不再静默使用模型默认值；对于会拒绝 `temperature` 的 OpenAI reasoning 模型则省略该字段。`gpt-"
"4o` 等同级 chat 模型仍保留 sampling control。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:838
msgid ""
"Accept every reasoning wire format `auto` can select as an explicit "
"`chat_reasoning` value, so gateways and unrecognized model names keep a "
"manual override; `thinking_toggle`, `thinking_effort`, and "
"`mandatory_thinking` were previously resolvable but rejected by config "
"validation."
msgstr ""
"允许将 `auto` 能选择的每种 reasoning wire format 显式设为 `chat_reasoning`，使 gateway "
"和未识别的 model name 保留手动覆盖能力；此前 `thinking_toggle`、`thinking_effort` 和 "
"`mandatory_thinking` 虽可被解析，却会被配置校验拒绝。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:839
msgid ""
"Avoid double-counting visible assistant text and raw ciphertext/signature"
" bytes in replayed provider items, while retaining readable Responses "
"summaries and Anthropic thinking in the context estimate."
msgstr ""
"避免在回放的 provider item 中重复计算可见 assistant text 和原始 ciphertext/signature "
"byte，同时在 context 估算中保留可读的 Responses summary 和 Anthropic thinking。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:840
msgid ""
"Drop saved reasoning items that carry no encrypted payload or readable "
"summary instead of replaying an empty shell that a stateless request "
"cannot resolve."
msgstr "丢弃既无 encrypted payload、也无可读 summary 的已保存 reasoning item，不再回放无状态请求无法解析的空壳。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:841
msgid ""
"Omit `temperature` from Anthropic requests while thinking is enabled, "
"which the Messages API rejects."
msgstr "Anthropic 请求启用 thinking 时省略 Messages API 会拒绝的 `temperature`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:842
msgid ""
"Preserve the CLI transcript after closing `/diff` by using the terminal's"
" alternate screen; when tmux has alternate-screen support disabled, "
"render the diff inline instead. The probe now reads the resolved window "
"option, so the usual global `set -wg alternate-screen off` is detected "
"and not just a per-window override."
msgstr ""
"通过使用终端备用屏幕,在关闭 `/diff` 后保留 CLI 记录;当 tmux 禁用了备用屏幕支持时,改为内联渲染 "
"diff。探测现在读取解析后的窗口选项,因此常见的全局 `set -wg alternate-screen off` "
"会被检测到,而不只是一个窗口级覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:843
msgid ""
"Restore both cache scopes in `/status`: the visual bar is now explicitly "
"labeled `last`, while `last` and `session` each show cached tokens, "
"prompt tokens, and hit rate."
msgstr ""
"恢复 `/status` 中的两个缓存作用域:视觉条现在明确标记为 `last`,而 `last` 与 `session` 各自显示缓存 "
"token、prompt token 与命中率。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:845
msgid "0.12.0 - 2026-07-21"
msgstr "0.12.0 - 2026-07-21"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:848
msgid ""
"Ctrl-C while the agent runs now distinguishes a *retract* from an "
"*interrupt*. If the agent has not produced any output yet, the turn is "
"retracted — the message is discarded and leaves no trace in the model "
"context or the persisted session (the input history still recalls it via "
"Ctrl-P), as if it was never sent. Once the agent has spoken or called a "
"tool, the partial turn stands and an interrupt marker is appended (with a"
" cancelled result for any tool call the interrupt left unanswered), so "
"the context stays valid and the model knows the turn ended early."
msgstr ""
"agent 运行时按 Ctrl-C 现在区分*撤回*与*中断*。如果 agent "
"尚未产生任何输出,该回合被撤回——消息被丢弃,在模型上下文或持久化会话中不留下痕迹(输入历史仍可通过 Ctrl-P "
"召回),就像从未发送过一样。一旦 agent 说过话或调用过工具,部分回合成立,并追加一个中断标记(任何被中断留下的工具调用带 cancelled"
" 结果),因此上下文保持有效,模型也知道回合提前结束。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:849
msgid ""
"Fold completed Bash output into a quiet gray row instead of leaving its "
"live preview in scrollback. `Ctrl-O` opens a newest-first browser for the"
" ten most recent Bash previews, including persisted history after resume;"
" select with `j`/`k` or arrows, open with `Enter`, return with `Esc`, and"
" close with `Ctrl-O` or `q`. Blank rows separate live output from the "
"working divider and each viewer's subdued labeled rule from scrollback. "
"Full results remain stored under their `tr.N` keys."
msgstr ""
"完成的 Bash 输出会折叠为安静的灰色行，不再将实时预览留在终端回滚缓冲区中。`Ctrl-O` 会打开按从新到旧排列的最近十次 Bash "
"预览浏览器，其中也包含 resume 后恢复的历史记录；使用 `j`/`k` 或方向键选择，按 `Enter` 打开，按 `Esc` 返回，按 "
"`Ctrl-O` 或 `q` 关闭。空行会将实时输出与 working 分隔线隔开，也会将每个 viewer "
"的低调带标签分隔线与终端回滚内容隔开。完整结果仍保存在对应的 `tr.N` key 下。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:852
msgid ""
"Background jobs (`Job(start)`) now capture every stage of a compound "
"command such as `configure && make && pytest`; previously only the final "
"stage was logged and earlier output leaked to the terminal."
msgstr ""
"后台任务(`Job(start)`)现在捕获 `configure && make && pytest` "
"这类复合命令的每个阶段;此前只记录最终阶段,较早的输出泄漏到终端。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:853
msgid ""
"Opening the external editor no longer truncates a draft at a git-style "
"scissors line you typed yourself — only the reference context minacode "
"appends below its own marker is stripped."
msgstr "打开外部编辑器不再在你自己输入的 git 风格剪刀线处截断草稿——只有 minacode 在其自身标记下追加的参考上下文会被剥离。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:856
msgid "0.11.0 - 2026-07-20"
msgstr "0.11.0 - 2026-07-20"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:859
msgid ""
"Ctrl-X Ctrl-E (and Ctrl-G) now opens the external editor with the agent's"
" most recent reply appended below a git-style scissors line, so you can "
"read what you are answering while you compose; everything from the "
"scissors line down is stripped before the message is sent. Long replies "
"are capped to their most recent lines."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl-X Ctrl-E(以及 Ctrl-G)现在打开外部编辑器,并把 agent 最近的回复追加在 git "
"风格剪刀线下方,这样你可以在编辑时读到你要回答的内容;消息发送前,剪刀线以下的所有内容都会被剥离。长回复被限制为最近的行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:860
msgid ""
"Show a placeholder tip in the idle input while it is empty, picked at "
"random for the session from a few shortcuts (`Ctrl-X Ctrl-E opens "
"$EDITOR`, `Type / for commands`, `Ctrl-U clears the line`) so they stay "
"discoverable without cluttering the prompt; it disappears as soon as you "
"start typing and gives way to the queue hints while the agent runs."
msgstr ""
"空闲输入为空时显示占位提示,从几个快捷键中为会话随机选一个(`Ctrl-X Ctrl-E opens $EDITOR`、`Type / for "
"commands`、`Ctrl-U clears the line`),让它们保持可发现而不弄乱提示符;一旦开始输入它就消失,agent "
"运行时让位给队列提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:863
msgid ""
"Renamed the project from `nanocode` to `minacode`: the package and import"
" (`import minacode`), the `minacode` console script and `python -m "
"minacode`, and the PyPI distribution (`minacode`, formerly `nanocode-"
"cli`). The data dir moved from `~/.nanocode` to `~/.minacode`; when the "
"new directory is absent the old one is still read, so existing sessions, "
"skills, and config keep working without a migration step."
msgstr ""
"把项目从 `nanocode` 改名为 `minacode`:包与导入(`import minacode`)、`minacode` 控制台脚本与 "
"`python -m minacode`,以及 PyPI 发行版(`minacode`,原 `nanocode-cli`)。数据目录从 "
"`~/.nanocode` 移到 `~/.minacode`;新目录不存在时仍会读取旧目录,因此现有会话、skills "
"与配置无需迁移步骤即可继续工作。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:864
msgid ""
"Split the single `nanocode.py` module into a `minacode` package of "
"focused submodules — `base`, `session`, `skill`, `mcp`, `tools`, "
"`engine`, `tui` — plus a `__main__` entry module (so `python -m minacode`"
" now works alongside the `minacode` console script), all re-exported "
"through `minacode/__init__.py` so `import minacode` keeps exposing the "
"same namespace as before. Module-internal helpers (`_read_and_release`, "
"`_validate_edit_target`, `_resolved_tool_schemas`) are underscore-"
"prefixed and gathered at the bottom of `tools.py`. Behavior, the CLI "
"entry point, and the public API are otherwise unchanged; this reorganizes"
" the source so it is easier to navigate and to trim optional features "
"later."
msgstr ""
"把单个 `nanocode.py` 模块拆成由聚焦子模块组成的 `minacode` "
"包——`base`、`session`、`skill`、`mcp`、`tools`、`engine`、`tui`——外加一个 `__main__`"
" 入口模块(因此 `python -m minacode` 现在与 `minacode` 控制台脚本并存),全部通过 "
"`minacode/__init__.py` 再导出,`import minacode` "
"仍暴露与之前相同的命名空间。模块内部辅助(`_read_and_release`、`_validate_edit_target`、`_resolved_tool_schemas`)以下划线为前缀并集中在"
" `tools.py` 底部。行为、CLI 入口与公共 API 其余不变;这次重组源码以便日后更容易导航和裁剪可选功能。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:865
msgid ""
"Ask previews now ask for concrete graphic content (snippets, directory "
"trees, file shapes) instead of restating the choice label, with the "
"built-in example updated to match."
msgstr "Ask 预览现在要求具体的图形内容(片段、目录树、文件形状),而不是复述选择标签,内置示例也相应更新。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:868
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Run background job commands directly under `bash -lc` instead of `exec "
"{command}`. The `exec` prefix failed for shell builtins and compound "
"commands (`cd dir && cmd`) with `exec: cd: not found`; "
"`start_new_session` already makes the shell the process-group leader, so "
"`killpg` still reaches the command and its children."
msgstr ""
"后台任务命令直接在 `bash -lc` 下运行,而不是 `exec {command}`。`exec` 前缀对 shell "
"内建和复合命令(`cd dir && cmd`)会以 `exec: cd: not found` 失败;`start_new_session` "
"已让 shell 成为进程组组长,所以 `killpg` 仍能到达命令及其子进程。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:871
msgid "0.10.0 - 2026-07-19"
msgstr "0.10.0 - 2026-07-19"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:874
msgid ""
"Clear the whole input line with `Ctrl-U`, in the idle prompt, the follow-"
"up editor, and approval prompts alike. `Ctrl-C` keeps its existing "
"meanings, including interrupting a running turn, so clearing a draft "
"never competes with stopping the agent."
msgstr ""
"用 `Ctrl-U` 清除整行输入,在空闲提示符、跟进编辑器与审批提示中同样适用。`Ctrl-C` "
"保持其原有含义,包括中断正在运行的回合,因此清除草稿从不与停止 agent 竞争。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:875
msgid ""
"Replay the diff each `Edit` made when a session is resumed, instead of "
"only the call line. Long diffs are trimmed to a readable window with a "
"pointer to `/diff`."
msgstr "恢复会话时重放每个 `Edit` 做出的 diff,而不仅仅是调用行。长 diff 被裁剪为可读窗口,并附指向 `/diff` 的提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:876
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add a `provider.extra_body` option (a JSON object, default empty) merged "
"verbatim into the outgoing chat request's `extra_body`, so provider-"
"specific extensions reach the wire without nanocode knowing about them. "
"This is how a server-side built-in capability such as Qianwen/DashScope "
"web search is enabled (`{\"enable_search\": true, \"search_options\": "
"{...}}` against `https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1`). "
"nanocode's own reasoning fields are layered on top, so they stay "
"authoritative on key conflicts, and the configured value is surfaced in "
"`/config`."
msgstr ""
"新增 `provider.extra_body` 选项（JSON 对象，默认为空），原样合并到外发 chat 请求的 `extra_body` "
"中，让 provider 专属扩展直达线上而无需 nanocode 感知。这是启用服务端内置能力（如通义/DashScope 网页搜索）的方式（对"
" `https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1` 发送 "
"`{\"enable_search\": true, \"search_options\": {...}}`）。nanocode "
"自己的推理字段叠加在其上，因此在键冲突时保持权威，配置值会显示在 `/config` 中。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:879
msgid ""
"Let `Ctrl-C` discard a draft in the follow-up editor. It previously "
"interrupted the turn and left the draft in place, so there was no way to "
"clear a half-typed follow-up while the agent worked. With the editor "
"empty it still interrupts, which is exactly when the `Ctrl-C interrupts` "
"hint is shown."
msgstr ""
"让 `Ctrl-C` 在跟进编辑器中丢弃草稿。此前它会中断回合并保留草稿,所以 agent "
"工作时无法清除输了一半的跟进。编辑器为空时它仍然中断,这正是显示 `Ctrl-C interrupts` 提示的时候。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:880
msgid ""
"Apply the `/diff` snapshot size limit to each file snapshot rather than "
"to the before-and-after pair. Snapshots are stored once per unique "
"content, so the pair no longer costs twice a file's size, and the old "
"test held the ceiling at half the file size it could afford — files up to"
" roughly 1 MB are now tracked."
msgstr ""
"把 `/diff` "
"的快照大小上限应用于每个文件快照,而不是前后成对。快照按唯一内容各存一次,因此成对不再花费两倍文件大小;旧测试把上限卡在它承担得起的文件大小的一半——现在约"
" 1 MB 以内的文件都会被跟踪。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:881
msgid ""
"Store sessions per project under `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`, each "
"with its own `latest` pointer, instead of a single flat "
"`<data_dir>/sessions/` directory shared by every project. Resolving this "
"project's latest session is now a pointer read rather than a scan that "
"opens every stored session, and a project directory is pruned once its "
"last session expires."
msgstr ""
"按项目把会话存储在 `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/` 下,每个项目有自己的 `latest` "
"指针,取代所有项目共享的单一扁平 `<data_dir>/sessions/` "
"目录。解析本项目的最新会话现在是一次指针读取,而不是扫描并打开每个存储会话;项目的最后会话过期后,其目录会被剪除。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:882
msgid ""
"Scope `--resume latest` and `--resume last` to the current project. They "
"previously resolved a single global pointer and could resume a session "
"belonging to a different directory; they now behave like `-c`."
msgstr ""
"把 `--resume latest` 和 `--resume last` "
"限定到当前项目。此前它们解析一个全局指针,可能恢复属于另一目录的会话;现在它们的行为与 `-c` 一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:883
msgid ""
"Begin each session log with a header line recording the format version, "
"UID, working directory, and creation time. The version gate turns an "
"unreadable log into a clear error instead of a misparse, and the log "
"describes itself when read by hand."
msgstr "每个会话日志以一行头开始,记录格式版本、UID、工作目录和创建时间。版本门把不可读的日志变成清晰的错误而不是误解析,日志被人手阅读时也能自我描述。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:884
msgid ""
"Store the file snapshots behind `/diff` by content hash instead of inline"
" in every edit record. Editing one file repeatedly stored each version "
"twice, once as an edit's `after` and again as the next edit's `before`; "
"each version is now written to the log once. Past 100 edits, where every "
"save rewrites the whole retained window, a save rewrote every snapshot "
"again — it now rewrites only the references."
msgstr ""
"把 `/diff` 背后的文件快照按内容哈希存储,而不是内联在每条编辑记录中。反复编辑同一文件会每个版本存两次:一次作为某条编辑的 "
"`after`,再一次作为下一条编辑的 `before`;现在每个版本在日志中只写一次。超过 100 "
"次编辑后,每次保存都会重写整个保留窗口,此前一次保存会再次重写每个快照——现在只重写引用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:887
msgid ""
"Persist the session immediately after `/compact`. The compacted history "
"lived only in memory until the next turn, so leaving the session right "
"after compacting resumed from the pre-compaction log."
msgstr "在 `/compact` 之后立即持久化会话。压缩后的历史此前只存在于内存,直到下一个回合,因此压缩后立刻离开会话,会从压缩前的日志恢复。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:888
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Recompute the context percentage when a session is resumed. The value is "
"derived rather than persisted, so the status bar read `ctx 0%` on a "
"restored session until its first turn — a session actually sitting at "
"100% looked empty."
msgstr ""
"恢复会话时重新计算上下文百分比。该值是推导而非持久化的,所以此前恢复的会话在第一个回合前状态栏读作 `ctx 0%`——实际坐在 100% "
"的会话看起来是空的。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:889
msgid ""
"Summarize the work that followed the current request during `/compact`, "
"not just the conversation before it. One request can drive dozens of tool"
" calls, and keeping that tail whole left the context nearly as large as "
"it started — compacting a 93-message session summarized 47 messages "
"holding 101k characters while keeping 46 messages holding 209k, so the "
"context stayed at 43%."
msgstr ""
"在 `/compact` "
"期间也总结当前请求之后发生的工作,而不只是它之前的对话。一个请求可以驱动几十次工具调用,保留那条尾巴会让上下文几乎与开始时一样大——压缩一个 93"
" 条消息的会话,总结 47 条持有 101k 字符的消息,却保留 46 条持有 209k 字符的消息,上下文停留在 43%。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:890
msgid ""
"Show one diff per file in `/diff` when a file's edits are only partly "
"covered by stored snapshots, which happens once a file grows past the "
"snapshot size limit mid-session. The snapshot-derived diff and the "
"reconstructed one were both emitted, repeating the file's changes under "
"two headers."
msgstr ""
"当文件的编辑只有部分被存储快照覆盖时,`/diff` 中每个文件只显示一个 diff——这在文件在会话中途超过快照大小上限时发生。此前快照派生的 "
"diff 与重建的 diff 都会输出,在两个标题下重复文件的变化。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:891
msgid ""
"Isolate `HOME` in the test suite. Tests that built a config without an "
"explicit `paths.data_dir` and then saved a session wrote into the "
"developer's real `~/.nanocode`."
msgstr ""
"在测试套件中隔离 `HOME`。此前未显式 `paths.data_dir` 的测试构建配置并保存会话,会写进开发者真实的 "
"`~/.nanocode`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:892
msgid ""
"Describe `Ctrl-C` in the running follow-up hint as interrupting the turn "
"rather than \"sending immediately\". `Ctrl-C` interrupts the current task"
" and keeps any draft in the editor; it does not submit the draft, so the "
"previous hint advertised an action that does not exist."
msgstr ""
"把运行中跟进提示里的 `Ctrl-C` 描述为中断回合，而不是「立即发送」。`Ctrl-C` "
"中断当前任务并保留编辑器中的草稿；它不会提交草稿，因此之前的提示宣传了一个并不存在的操作。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:894 ../../../CHANGELOG.md:903
#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:925
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "移除"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:895
msgid ""
"Drop reading of pre-existing session files. Sessions written by earlier "
"versions are not migrated and are no longer loadable; "
"`<data_dir>/sessions/` can be deleted. This also removes the recovery of "
"edit diffs from legacy `Edit` tool records and the tolerance for retired "
"cache-prefix state keys."
msgstr ""
"放弃读取既有会话文件。旧版本写入的会话不会迁移,也不再可加载;`<data_dir>/sessions/` 可以删除。这也移除了从旧 `Edit`"
" 工具记录恢复编辑 diff,以及对退役缓存前缀状态键的容忍。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:898
msgid "0.9.11 - 2026-07-19"
msgstr "0.9.11 - 2026-07-19"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:901
msgid ""
"Discover `auto_connect` MCP servers in the background at startup, so an "
"unreachable server no longer holds up the prompt for the discovery "
"timeout."
msgstr "启动时在后台发现 `auto_connect` MCP 服务器,因此不可达的服务器不再让提示符等待整个发现超时。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:904
msgid ""
"Remove the undocumented `runtime.max_steps` configuration alias; set "
"`runtime.max_agent_steps` instead."
msgstr "移除未文档化的 `runtime.max_steps` 配置别名;请设置 `runtime.max_agent_steps`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:907
msgid "0.9.10 - 2026-07-18"
msgstr "0.9.10 - 2026-07-18"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:910
msgid ""
"Add `g`/`G` jumps to the top/bottom in the `/diff` viewer and interactive"
" selectors, matching the `less` pager convention."
msgstr "在 `/diff` 查看器和交互选择器中加入 `g`/`G` 跳到顶部/底部的快捷键,与 `less` 分页器惯例一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:911
msgid ""
"Add an interactive `/mcp` connection manager and per-server "
"`auto_connect` configuration for explicit startup connections."
msgstr "新增交互式 `/mcp` 连接管理器,以及用于显式启动连接的 per-server `auto_connect` 配置。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:914
msgid ""
"Replace the in-flight model retry keybinding with `/resend` in the "
"running follow-up input, and show a `/resend` hint during long requests."
msgstr "把在途模型重试的键绑定替换为运行中跟进输入里的 `/resend`,并在长请求期间显示 `/resend` 提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:915
msgid ""
"Open the current input in `$VISUAL`/`$EDITOR` with `Ctrl-X Ctrl-E` or "
"`Ctrl-G`; a lone `Ctrl-X` no longer opens the editor."
msgstr ""
"用 `Ctrl-X Ctrl-E` 或 `Ctrl-G` 在 `$VISUAL`/`$EDITOR` 中打开当前输入;单独的 `Ctrl-X` "
"不再打开编辑器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:916
msgid ""
"Make `Ctrl-P` mirror the Up arrow when recalling the latest queued "
"message for editing."
msgstr "让 `Ctrl-P` 在召回最新排队消息进行编辑时与 Up 箭头一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:917
msgid ""
"Connect MCP servers on demand through targeted mentions or `/mcp connect "
"NAME`, keeping disconnected servers entirely out of model context. "
"Connecting handles OAuth authorization when required; disconnecting "
"unloads the server and clears its saved OAuth authentication."
msgstr ""
"通过定向提及或 `/mcp connect NAME` 按需连接 MCP 服务器,让未连接的服务器完全不进入模型上下文。连接时在需要时处理 "
"OAuth 授权;断开连接会卸载服务器并清除其保存的 OAuth 认证。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:918
msgid ""
"Let `/mcp connect` accept multiple server names, connect them "
"concurrently, and complete each successive server argument."
msgstr "让 `/mcp connect` 接受多个服务器名,并发连接它们,并补全每个连续的服务器参数。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:919
msgid ""
"Align `/mcp` status columns and add compact connection-state markers for "
"faster scanning."
msgstr "对齐 `/mcp` 状态列,加入紧凑的连接状态标记以便更快扫读。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:920
msgid ""
"Render multi-server connection results as a compact vertical list instead"
" of one wrapped paragraph."
msgstr "把多服务器连接结果渲染为紧凑的垂直列表,而不是一个换行的段落。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:921
msgid ""
"Color a consistent solid-circle MCP status marker green when connected, "
"yellow when disconnected, red on error, and dim when skipped."
msgstr "用一致的实心圆 MCP 状态标记着色:连接时为绿色、断开时为黄色、出错时为红色、跳过时为暗色。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:922
msgid "Show the number of connected MCP servers in the `/status` context row."
msgstr "在 `/status` 的 context 行中显示已连接的 MCP 服务器数。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:923
msgid ""
"Make each selection in `/mcp` toggle that server in place, showing "
"connection progress without closing the selector, and limit `/mcp tools` "
"listings and completion to connected servers."
msgstr "让 `/mcp` 中的每次选择就地切换该服务器,显示连接进度而不关闭选择器,并把 `/mcp tools` 列表与补全限制为已连接的服务器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:926
msgid ""
"Remove the unreachable non-TUI `Ctrl-\\` model-request retry; interactive"
" retries use `/resend`, while transient errors still retry automatically."
msgstr "移除不可达的非 TUI `Ctrl-\\\\` 模型请求重试;交互式重试用 `/resend`,瞬时错误仍会自动重试。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:927
msgid ""
"Remove `/debug` cache-prefix diagnostics and persisted prefix "
"fingerprints; prompt caching and `/status` cache-hit metrics remain "
"unchanged."
msgstr "移除 `/debug` 缓存前缀诊断与持久化的前缀指纹;prompt 缓存与 `/status` 缓存命中指标保持不变。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:928
msgid ""
"Remove startup tips and the built-in `nanocode-help` skill; `/help` and "
"project/user skills remain available."
msgstr "移除启动提示与内置的 `nanocode-help` skill;`/help` 与项目/用户 skills 仍然可用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:929
msgid ""
"Remove the `--mcp` per-run selector and per-server `enabled` behavior; "
"comment out unwanted server sections instead. Legacy `enabled` keys are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"移除 `--mcp` 每次运行选择器与 per-server `enabled` 行为;请注释掉不需要的服务器小节。旧 `enabled` "
"键被忽略。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:932
msgid ""
"Retry OpenAI and Anthropic connection/timeout failures, retryable client "
"statuses, and every provider `5xx` response."
msgstr "重试 OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的连接/超时失败、可重试的客户端状态以及所有 provider 的 `5xx` 响应。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:933
msgid ""
"Bound MCP calls by timeout, recreate failed async loops, and close the "
"MCP loop safely during shutdown."
msgstr "用超时约束 MCP 调用,重建失败的异步循环,并在关闭期间安全地关闭 MCP 循环。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:934
msgid ""
"Keep concurrent MCP discovery status accurate, serialize OAuth "
"authorization in the manager, and expose resource-only servers through "
"`@server` mentions."
msgstr "保持并发 MCP 发现状态准确,在管理器中串行化 OAuth 授权,并通过 `@server` 提及暴露仅资源的服务器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:935
msgid ""
"Let explicit OAuth MCP connections validate cached credentials and "
"reauthorize interactively when the server rejects them."
msgstr "让显式 OAuth MCP 连接校验缓存的凭据,并在服务器拒绝时交互式重新授权。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:936
msgid ""
"Treat redirects to paths that merely start with `/dev/null` as writes "
"requiring confirmation; only the exact device remains auto-approved."
msgstr "把重定向到仅以 `/dev/null` 开头的路径视为需要确认的写入;只有精确的设备仍自动批准。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:937
msgid ""
"Prevent the plain CLI Bash live preview from accessing a nonexistent "
"command-loop reference."
msgstr "防止纯 CLI 的 Bash 实时预览访问不存在的命令循环引用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:940
msgid "0.9.9 - 2026-07-16"
msgstr "0.9.9 - 2026-07-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:943
msgid ""
"Show a one-line notice at startup when a newer version is available on "
"PyPI, pointing to `uv tool upgrade nanocode-cli`. The update check stays "
"cached and rate-limited to once per 24h, and never blocks startup."
msgstr ""
"启动时若有更新版本发布在 PyPI,显示一行提示,指向 `uv tool upgrade nanocode-cli`。更新检查保持缓存并限频为每 "
"24 小时一次,绝不阻塞启动。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:946
msgid ""
"README pointed at a `nanocode upgrade` command that no longer exists; the"
" upgrade instructions now use `uv tool upgrade nanocode-cli`."
msgstr ""
"README 指向的 `nanocode upgrade` 命令已不存在;升级说明现在使用 `uv tool upgrade nanocode-"
"cli`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:949
msgid "0.9.8 - 2026-07-16"
msgstr "0.9.8 - 2026-07-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:952
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-X` at the input prompt opens the current input in "
"`$VISUAL`/`$EDITOR` (falling back to vim) and loads the edited text back;"
" a non-zero exit or a failed launch leaves the input untouched."
msgstr ""
"输入提示符处的 `Ctrl-X` 在 `$VISUAL`/`$EDITOR` 中打开当前输入(回退到 "
"vim)并把编辑后的文本载回;非零退出或启动失败会保持输入不变。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:955
msgid "0.9.7 - 2026-07-16"
msgstr "0.9.7 - 2026-07-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:958
msgid ""
"Resume this project's latest session with `-c` (also `--last`, "
"`--latest`), matched by working directory. Mutually exclusive with "
"`--resume`, which still takes a UID or resolves the most recent session "
"across all projects."
msgstr ""
"用 `-c`(也即 `--last`、`--latest`)按工作目录匹配恢复本项目的最新会话。与 `--resume` 互斥,后者仍接受 UID"
" 或解析所有项目中最新的会话。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:961
msgid ""
"Rebuild the interactive REPL around a single persistent prompt-toolkit "
"application: live activity, input, approval prompts, selectors, the "
"`/diff` viewer, and the status bar now share one app, while completed "
"output prints above it into native terminal scrollback."
msgstr ""
"围绕单个持久的 prompt-toolkit 应用重建交互式 REPL:实时活动、输入、审批提示、选择器、`/diff` "
"查看器与状态栏现在共享一个应用,已完成的输出打印在它上方的原生终端滚动区。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:962
msgid ""
"Define `Ctrl-C` uniformly across that app: cancel an approval prompt, "
"clear the current input at an idle prompt, or interrupt a running turn. "
"Exit stays on `Ctrl-D` at an empty prompt and `/exit`."
msgstr ""
"在整个应用中统一定义 `Ctrl-C`:取消审批提示、在空闲提示符清除当前输入,或中断正在运行的回合。退出仍用空提示符的 `Ctrl-D` 与 "
"`/exit`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:964
msgid "0.9.6 - 2026-07-14"
msgstr "0.9.6 - 2026-07-14"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:967
msgid ""
"Revert unified diff background fill: the live `/diff` viewer spans the "
"pane width, while scrollback output keeps its natural width."
msgstr "回退统一 diff 背景填充:`/diff` 实时查看器横跨窗格宽度,滚动区输出保持自然宽度。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:969
msgid "0.9.5 - 2026-07-14"
msgstr "0.9.5 - 2026-07-14"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:972
msgid ""
"Disable Rich Markdown hyperlinks so OSC 8 terminal escape sequences don't"
" leak as visible text."
msgstr "禁用 Rich Markdown 超链接,使 OSC 8 终端转义序列不会作为可见文本泄漏。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:973
msgid ""
"Strip Markdown link URLs from assistant output for cleaner scrollback; "
"revert and re-apply with narrower scope."
msgstr "从 assistant 输出中剥离 Markdown 链接 URL 以获得更干净的滚动区;以更窄的作用域回退并重新应用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:974
msgid ""
"Defensively strip unknown terminal escapes from assistant output and add "
"a tip about hyperlink behavior."
msgstr "防御性地从 assistant 输出中剥离未知终端转义,并加入一条关于超链接行为的提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:975
msgid ""
"Update the system prompt to note that Markdown links won't render as "
"hyperlinks in this terminal."
msgstr "更新系统提示词,说明 Markdown 链接不会在此终端中渲染为超链接。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:978
msgid ""
"Prevent OSC 8 payload from leaking as visible text in assistant Markdown "
"output."
msgstr "防止 OSC 8 负载在 assistant 的 Markdown 输出中作为可见文本泄漏。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:980
msgid "0.9.4 - 2026-07-14"
msgstr "0.9.4 - 2026-07-14"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:983
msgid ""
"Auto-promote long-running Bash commands to background jobs after a "
"configurable timeout."
msgstr "在可配置的超时后,把长时间运行的 Bash 命令自动提升为后台任务。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:986
msgid "Show sub-second precision in the Bash live-preview `running…` label."
msgstr "在 Bash 实时预览的 `running…` 标签中显示亚秒精度。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:987
msgid ""
"Color the `·N` batch counter gray via `LogLine.meta` instead of syntax-"
"highlighted arguments."
msgstr "通过 `LogLine.meta` 把 `·N` 批量计数器着为灰色,而不是语法高亮的参数。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:988
msgid ""
"Pad diff backgrounds to pane width everywhere for solid Edit previews and"
" a full-width live `/diff` viewer."
msgstr "在所有地方把 diff 背景填充到窗格宽度,以获得实心的 Edit 预览和全宽的实时 `/diff` 查看器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:989
msgid ""
"Add breathing room to queued-message flushes so they match interactive "
"echo spacing."
msgstr "给排队消息的冲刷增加呼吸空间,使它们与交互式回显的间距一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:992
msgid ""
"Size diff background bands to the width after the outer log prefix so "
"indented diffs render cleanly."
msgstr "把 diff 背景条尺寸设为外层日志前缀之后的宽度,使缩进的 diff 渲染干净。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:993
msgid ""
"Preserve background-colored padding when stripping Rich's line-fill "
"whitespace on pane resize."
msgstr "在窗格调整大小时剥离 Rich 的行填充空白的同时保留背景色内边距。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:995
msgid "0.9.3 - 2026-07-13"
msgstr "0.9.3 - 2026-07-13"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:998
msgid ""
"Unify the live input prompt prefix to `>` and historical/queued user "
"message prefix to `•`, extracting both as `UiPrinter` constants."
msgstr "把实时输入提示前缀统一为 `>`,历史/排队用户消息前缀统一为 `•`,两者都提取为 `UiPrinter` 常量。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:999
msgid ""
"Add a `Theme.user.log` color key with a muted desert-orange palette and "
"resolve it through `UiPrinter.user_log_style()`."
msgstr "新增 `Theme.user.log` 颜色键,使用柔和的沙漠橙配色,并通过 `UiPrinter.user_log_style()` 解析。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1000
msgid ""
"Render resumed user messages with a `•` prefix and theme-aware orange "
"text, add a blank line above each user message, and drop the `user:` role"
" label."
msgstr "恢复的用户消息以 `•` 前缀和主题感知的橙色文本渲染,每条用户消息上方加一个空行,并去掉 `user:` 角色标签。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1001
msgid "Render resumed assistant messages without a role label or prefix."
msgstr "恢复的 assistant 消息不带角色标签或前缀渲染。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1002
msgid ""
"Keep nanocode's interactive theme active when the parent environment "
"exports `NO_COLOR`; redirected and headless output remains plain."
msgstr "当父环境导出 `NO_COLOR` 时仍保持 nanocode 的交互主题;重定向与无头输出保持纯文本。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1003
msgid ""
"Add a separate `replay_prefix` to `read_input` so the main user message "
"is echoed with `•` while the live prompt stays `>`."
msgstr "给 `read_input` 加一个独立的 `replay_prefix`,使主用户消息以 `•` 回显,而实时提示保持 `>`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1004
msgid ""
"Drop the gray `inflight` styling from queued follow-up messages so they "
"keep a consistent user color while pending."
msgstr "去掉排队跟进消息的灰色 `inflight` 样式,让它们在挂起时保持一致的用户颜色。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1005
msgid ""
"Update the system prompt to first acknowledge or briefly answer follow-"
"ups before carrying out the request."
msgstr "更新系统提示词:在执行请求前先确认或简要回答跟进。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1007
msgid "0.9.2 - 2026-07-13"
msgstr "0.9.2 - 2026-07-13"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1010
msgid ""
"Add `/diff`, a read-only viewer for edits made by nanocode. It shows the "
"latest user round and the overall net session diff in `Latest` and "
"`Session` tabs, supports keyboard navigation and paging, and persists "
"edit snapshots across `--resume`."
msgstr ""
"新增 `/diff`,一个 nanocode 所做编辑的只读查看器。它在 `Latest` 和 `Session` "
"标签中显示最近一轮用户回合与整体净会话 diff,支持键盘导航和翻页,并在 `--resume` 时持久化编辑快照。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1011
msgid ""
"Add a standalone animated progress row for manual `/compact` operations "
"while keeping the normal status line visible."
msgstr "为手动 `/compact` 操作新增独立的动画进度行,同时保持正常状态行可见。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1012
msgid ""
"Show a bounded Bash stdout/stderr preview in finished tool summaries when"
" no live preview was already kept visible."
msgstr "在已完成的工具摘要中,当没有实时预览保持可见时,显示有界的 Bash stdout/stderr 预览。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1013
msgid ""
"Add light-terminal theme support with automatic `COLORFGBG` detection and"
" a `runtime.theme` override."
msgstr "新增浅色终端主题支持,自动 `COLORFGBG` 检测与 `runtime.theme` 覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1016
msgid ""
"Use recursive internal layout boxes for turn hierarchy both live and "
"after resume: user and final-assistant messages stay at column zero, "
"intermediate-assistant messages and tool calls use two spaces, and tool "
"details use four. Restored role labels share their message indentation, "
"with a blank separator between turns."
msgstr ""
"为回合层级使用递归内部布局框:用户与最终 assistant 消息停在零列,中间 assistant "
"消息与工具调用用两个空格,工具细节用四个。恢复的角色标签与其消息共享缩进,回合之间用空行分隔。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1017
msgid ""
"Add two-level hierarchy to CLI tool logs: indented tool calls are root "
"events, approvals/output/errors/stored results use dim tree guides, Bash "
"commands use a background-neutral GitHub Dark syntax palette, commands "
"are shown once, compact tools remain single-line leaves, and flushed "
"follow-ups use a `nano+` prompt."
msgstr ""
"给 CLI 工具日志增加两级层级:缩进的工具调用是根事件,审批/输出/错误/存储结果使用暗色树形引导,Bash 命令使用背景中性的 GitHub "
"Dark 语法配色,命令只显示一次,紧凑工具保持单行叶节点,冲刷的跟进使用 `nano+` 提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1018
msgid ""
"Replace the `--debug`/`runtime.debug` mode and `/debug on|off` toggle "
"with an always-on, read-only `/debug` report. It keeps only the latest "
"three cache-prefix mismatch records in memory, including changed region "
"hashes and sizes, without retaining raw prompt content."
msgstr ""
"用始终开启、只读的 `/debug` 报告取代 `--debug`/`runtime.debug` 模式与 `/debug on|off` "
"开关。它只在内存中保留最近三条缓存前缀不匹配记录,包括变更区域的哈希与大小,不保留原始 prompt 内容。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1019
msgid ""
"Replace blank Enter as the queued-input send-now shortcut with Ctrl-C. "
"Enter queues a follow-up for the next model request; when follow-ups are "
"queued, Ctrl-C interrupts the active request so they can be sent "
"immediately. Queue guidance now appears as a contextual `+>` placeholder "
"and disappears while typing."
msgstr ""
"用 Ctrl-C 取代空白 Enter 作为排队输入的立即发送快捷键。Enter 为下一个模型请求排队跟进;有跟进排队时,Ctrl-C "
"中断当前请求以便立即发送。队列提示现在以上下文相关的 `+>` 占位符出现,输入时消失。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1020
msgid ""
"Remove the synthesized FILE STATE context projection. `Read` and `Edit` "
"outputs now remain as bounded, recallable conversation messages, and "
"`/context` shows only Environment and Memory."
msgstr ""
"移除合成的 FILE STATE 上下文投影。`Read` 和 `Edit` 输出现在作为有界、可召回的消息保留,`/context` 只显示 "
"Environment 与 Memory。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1021
msgid ""
"Show each Bash command once before execution, keep live output visible "
"without repeating the command, and use a compact dimmed `stored tr.N` "
"result marker after live runs."
msgstr "每个 Bash 命令在执行前显示一次,保持实时输出可见而不重复命令,实时运行后用紧凑暗色的 `stored tr.N` 结果标记。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1022
msgid ""
"Render changed diff code with equal-width saturated dark green/red "
"backgrounds while leaving line-number gutters and context rows unfilled."
msgstr "用等宽、饱和的深绿/红背景渲染变更的 diff 代码,行号沟槽与上下文行保持不填充。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1023
msgid ""
"Keep multiline queue pastes as one message; Up recalls the newest queued "
"follow-up for editing or deletion before the model claims it."
msgstr "把多行队列粘贴保持为一条消息;Up 会在模型认领之前召回最新的排队跟进以供编辑或删除。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1024
msgid ""
"Render `/ps` as a Markdown table and print resume commands on their own "
"line for easier copying."
msgstr "把 `/ps` 渲染为 Markdown 表格,并在单独一行打印恢复命令以便复制。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1025
msgid ""
"Show per-file addition/deletion counts in `/diff`, restore the previous "
"CLI view after closing it, and syntax-highlight non-Bash tool arguments "
"as well as Bash and Job commands."
msgstr "在 `/diff` 中显示每个文件的增/删计数,关闭后恢复之前的 CLI 视图,并对 Bash 与 Job 命令之外的工具参数也做语法高亮。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1026
msgid ""
"Refine the agent prompt around read-first engineering judgment, concise "
"progress updates, review behavior, follow-up responsiveness, and using "
"background jobs for potentially long-running work."
msgstr "围绕先读后写的工程判断、简洁的进度更新、评审行为、跟进响应性,以及用后台任务处理可能长时间运行的工作,打磨 agent 提示词。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1029
msgid ""
"Keep transient approval state (`approval required` and `[Y/n or reason]`)"
" out of terminal scrollback after a tool decision."
msgstr "在工具决策后,让瞬时的审批状态(`approval required` 和 `[Y/n or reason]`)不进入终端滚动区。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1030
msgid ""
"Follow edited files across unambiguous Bash moves so `/diff` reports "
"their final paths and logical net changes."
msgstr "跨无歧义的 Bash 移动跟踪被编辑的文件,使 `/diff` 报告它们的最终路径与逻辑净变化。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1031
msgid ""
"Prevent transient working dividers from leaking into CLI history during "
"Bash previews and approval handoffs."
msgstr "防止瞬时的 working 分隔线在 Bash 预览与审批交接期间泄漏进 CLI 历史。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1032
msgid "Prioritize queued follow-ups when building the next model request."
msgstr "构建下一个模型请求时优先处理排队的跟进。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1033
msgid ""
"Keep Bash preview colors consistent, preserve literal closing-tag text, "
"show bounded output when no live frame is available, and avoid repeating "
"commands or output around live runs and failures."
msgstr "保持 Bash 预览颜色一致,保留字面的闭合标签文本,无实时帧可用时显示有界输出,并避免在实时运行和失败时重复命令或输出。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1034
msgid ""
"Coalesce capped fallback edits into one `/diff` entry per file, count "
"only real hunk changes, and report `No changes` when a round has no net "
"effect."
msgstr "把受限的回退编辑按文件合并为一条 `/diff` 条目,只统计真实的 hunk 变更,回合无净效果时报告 `No changes`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1035
msgid ""
"Reject directory paths passed to `Edit` with a tool error instead of "
"crashing during edit planning."
msgstr "用工具错误拒绝传给 `Edit` 的目录路径,而不是在编辑规划时崩溃。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1036
msgid ""
"Persist the safe prefix of an active turn before each model request so "
"completed messages and tool calls survive interruption and `--resume`."
msgstr "在每个模型请求前持久化活动回合的安全前缀,使已完成的消息与工具调用在中断与 `--resume` 后存活。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1037
msgid ""
"Drain background-job output continuously so pipe buffers cannot deadlock "
"verbose commands, refresh completed job state before capacity and `/ps` "
"checks, and keep bounded output tails correct for small limits."
msgstr "持续排空后台任务输出,使管道缓冲无法死锁冗长命令;在容量与 `/ps` 检查前刷新已完成任务的状态,并让有界输出尾部对小的限制保持正确。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1038
msgid ""
"Clip Bash previews and status lines by terminal display width, preventing"
" CJK and emoji output from wrapping unexpectedly and desynchronizing live"
" rendering."
msgstr "按终端显示宽度裁剪 Bash 预览与状态行,防止 CJK 与 emoji 输出意外换行并使实时渲染失步。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1039
msgid ""
"Keep assistant tool-call messages together with their tool results when "
"compacting context, preventing invalid orphaned `tool` messages from "
"reaching model APIs."
msgstr "压缩上下文时让 assistant 工具调用消息与其工具结果保持在一起,防止无效的孤儿 `tool` 消息到达模型 API。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1040
msgid ""
"Correct dark-terminal detection for ANSI bright-black backgrounds and "
"keep the status line stable during manual compaction."
msgstr "修正 ANSI 亮黑背景下的深色终端检测,并让手动压缩期间状态行保持稳定。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1041
msgid ""
"Stop dropping files with oversized edit snapshots from the `/diff` "
"Session view; fall back to the recorded per-turn diffs so the file still "
"appears."
msgstr "不再把带超大编辑快照的文件从 `/diff` 的 Session 视图丢弃;回退到记录的逐回合 diff,使文件仍然出现。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1042
msgid ""
"Raise `TurnDiff.SNAPSHOT_CHAR_LIMIT` from 200KB to 1MB so typical large "
"source files (including nanocode.py itself) keep their before/after "
"snapshots and render as one clean unified diff instead of the "
"concatenated per-Edit fallback."
msgstr ""
"把 `TurnDiff.SNAPSHOT_CHAR_LIMIT` 从 200KB 提高到 1MB,使典型的大源文件(包括 nanocode.py "
"本身)保留前后快照,渲染为一条干净的统一 diff,而不是拼接的逐 Edit 回退。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1043
msgid ""
"Reconstruct legacy `/diff` for oversized-snapshot files by reverse-"
"applying stored per-Edit hunks against the on-disk content; produces one "
"clean unified diff when disk still matches the last tracked edit, "
"otherwise falls back to the raw hunks."
msgstr ""
"对超大快照文件重建旧版 `/diff`:对磁盘内容反向应用存储的逐 Edit hunks;磁盘仍与最后跟踪的编辑一致时产生一条干净的统一 "
"diff,否则回退到原始 hunks。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1044
msgid ""
"Close the raw file descriptor if `os.fdopen` fails inside "
"`MCPFileTokenStore.save`, preventing a descriptor leak on token-store "
"write errors."
msgstr ""
"在 `MCPFileTokenStore.save` 内 `os.fdopen` 失败时关闭原始文件描述符,防止 token "
"存储写入错误时描述符泄漏。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1046
msgid "0.9.1 - 2026-07-09"
msgstr "0.9.1 - 2026-07-09"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1049
msgid ""
"Add immediate queued-input flushing while the agent is waiting on a model"
" request. Pressing Enter in the `+>` queue still records text for the "
"next LLM request; pressing blank Enter with newly queued text interrupts "
"the active model request and retries it with that queued input included."
msgstr ""
"在 agent 等待模型请求时加入立即冲刷排队输入。在 `+>` 队列中按 Enter 仍为下一个 LLM 请求记录文本;有新排队文本时按空白 "
"Enter 会中断当前模型请求,并带上该排队输入重试。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1052
msgid ""
"Harden queued-input flushing so stale SIGINT delivery cannot cancel the "
"whole turn after a model request already returned."
msgstr "加固排队输入冲刷,使过期的 SIGINT 投递无法在模型请求已返回后取消整个回合。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1053
msgid ""
"Avoid needless duplicate retries when the active model request already "
"contains the queued input, prevent repeated blank Enter from stacking "
"retry counts, and clear whitespace-only queue input on Enter."
msgstr "当活动模型请求已包含排队输入时避免无谓的重复重试,防止反复按空白 Enter 堆叠重试计数,并在 Enter 时清除仅空白的队列输入。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1055
msgid "0.9.0 - 2026-07-07"
msgstr "0.9.0 - 2026-07-07"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1058
msgid ""
"Syntax-highlight inline Edit diff previews with Pygments. Added and "
"context lines (the \"new\" file version) are lexed together as one code "
"block so multiline strings and indentation-sensitive languages highlight "
"correctly; removed lines stay plain diff-red. Degrades gracefully to "
"plain diff coloring when Pygments is unavailable, the file extension is "
"unknown, or the lexer fails."
msgstr ""
"用 Pygments 为内联的 Edit diff "
"预览做语法高亮。新增行与上下文行（「新」文件版本）作为一个代码块一起词法分析，使多行字符串和缩进敏感的语言高亮正确；删除行保持纯 diff "
"红色。Pygments 不可用、文件扩展名未知或词法分析失败时，优雅降级为纯 diff 着色。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1059
msgid ""
"Add background jobs via a `Job` tool "
"(`start`/`status`/`wait`/`list`/`kill`). Long-running or non-blocking "
"work — dev servers, watchers, long builds and test suites — runs in its "
"own process group without blocking the agent; output is buffered (capped "
"per stream), drained non-blockingly on `status`, and returned as a tail. "
"Concurrency is capped (`MAX_JOBS`), running jobs surface in the status "
"bar (`jobs N`), the `/status` row, and a new read-only `/ps` command; "
"`kill` sends SIGTERM then SIGKILL to the group. Jobs run until they exit "
"or are killed (no foreground `shell_timeout` cap), and "
"`Job(action=\"wait\")` with no/zero timeout blocks until the process "
"exits."
msgstr ""
"通过 `Job` "
"工具新增后台任务（`start`/`status`/`wait`/`list`/`kill`）。长时间运行或不阻塞的工作——开发服务器、监视器、长构建与长测试套件——在独立的进程组中运行，不阻塞"
" agent；输出被缓冲（按流设上限）、`status` "
"时非阻塞地排空，并以尾部形式返回。并发有上限（`MAX_JOBS`），运行中的任务显示在状态栏（`jobs N`）、`/status` "
"行和新的只读 `/ps` 命令中；`kill` 向进程组先发 SIGTERM 再发 SIGKILL。任务一直运行到退出或被杀死（没有前台的 "
"`shell_timeout` 上限），`Job(action=\"wait\")` 不带或带零超时则会阻塞直到进程退出。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1063
msgid ""
"Rename the interactive `Question` tool to `Ask`; the old `Question` tool "
"name is no longer registered."
msgstr "把交互式 `Question` 工具改名为 `Ask`;旧的 `Question` 工具名不再注册。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1064
msgid ""
"Replace the status-bar `+N` queued-message counter with a live queue "
"region. While the agent works, messages you type sit below the +> input "
"under a dim \"── queued\" divider with a left→right sweep animation, "
"instead of being echoed into the scrollback log; when the turn flushes "
"them they move up into the log as `+ <text>` lines and the region shrinks"
" (the divider disappears once nothing is queued)."
msgstr ""
"用实时队列区域取代状态栏的 `+N` 排队消息计数器。agent 工作时，你输入的消息位于 `+>` 输入框下方、一条暗色「── "
"queued」分隔线之下，带从左到右的扫光动画，而不是回显到滚动日志中；回合把它们冲刷出去时，它们以 `+ <text>` "
"行上移到日志中，区域随之收缩（队列清空后分隔线消失）。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1065
msgid ""
"Cache the Anthropic request's stable `tools`+`system` prefix with a "
"`cache_control` breakpoint on the system block, so each turn no longer "
"reprocesses the system prompt and tool schemas from scratch (Anthropic "
"prompt caching only activates at an explicit breakpoint)."
msgstr ""
"用系统块上的 `cache_control` 断点缓存 Anthropic 请求的稳定 `tools`+`system` "
"前缀,使每个回合不再从头重新处理系统提示词与工具 schema(Anthropic prompt 缓存只在显式断点处激活)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1066
msgid ""
"Strengthen the system prompt for faster convergence: batch independent "
"reads/searches into one parallel request by default, and drive each Bash "
"call to complete in a single pass (chain known steps, split only on "
"genuinely unpredictable dependencies)."
msgstr ""
"加强系统提示词以更快收敛:默认把独立的读/搜索批量合并为一次并行请求,并让每次 Bash "
"调用单遍完成(串接已知步骤,只在真正不可预测的依赖上拆分)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1067
msgid ""
"Replace the dedicated `LineCount`, `List`, `Find`, and `Git` tools with "
"Bash-driven equivalents. The model now sees available shell commands near"
" the top of Environment, read-only Bash commands (including safe `git "
"status`/`diff`/`log` style commands) auto-run without confirmation, and "
"mutating shell/git commands still require approval."
msgstr ""
"用 Bash 驱动的等价物取代专门的 `LineCount`、`List`、`Find` 与 `Git` 工具。模型现在在 Environment"
" 顶部附近看到可用的 shell 命令,只读 Bash 命令(包括安全的 `git status`/`diff`/`log` "
"风格命令)无需确认自动运行,变更性的 shell/git 命令仍需审批。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1068
msgid ""
"Bash output is no longer erased from the terminal after the command "
"finishes; the live preview output stays in the scrollback history."
msgstr "命令结束后,Bash 输出不再从终端清除;实时预览输出保留在滚动区历史中。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1069
msgid ""
"Edit diff previews and approve messages remain visible in the CLI history"
" instead of being transiently cleared."
msgstr "Edit diff 预览与审批消息在 CLI 历史中保持可见,而不是被瞬时清除。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1070
msgid ""
"Remove the Ctrl-A expanded Edit preview and fixed-height transient "
"preview window. Edit approvals still show the full inline diff preview in"
" the CLI history, with Pygments highlighting preserved."
msgstr ""
"移除 Ctrl-A 展开的 Edit 预览与固定高度的瞬时预览窗口。Edit 审批仍在 CLI 历史中显示完整的内联 diff 预览,保留 "
"Pygments 高亮。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1071
msgid ""
"Git branch is no longer shown in the environment context sent to the "
"model."
msgstr "发送给模型的环境上下文中不再显示 Git 分支。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1072
msgid ""
"Removed branch-change detection protection that prevented `git commit` "
"after an external branch switch."
msgstr "移除在外部切换分支后阻止 `git commit` 的分支变更检测保护。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1075
msgid ""
"Close a hole in Bash read-only auto-approval: `&&`/`||` were flattened to"
" spaces and only the first command in a chain was validated, so `git log "
"&& rm -rf x` auto-ran without confirmation. Every stage of a `&& || | ; "
"newline` chain is now validated independently, a lone background `&` is "
"rejected, and a `cd` prefix (a benign builtin the model routinely adds) "
"no longer forces a prompt on an otherwise read-only command."
msgstr ""
"堵住 Bash 只读自动审批的一个漏洞:`&&`/`||` 被压平为空格,链中只有第一个命令被校验,因此 `git log && rm -rf "
"x` 无需确认就自动运行。现在 `&& || | ; newline` 链的每个阶段都独立校验,单独的背景 `&` 被拒绝,`cd` "
"前缀(模型经常加的无害内建)不再让本已只读的命令强制弹提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1076
msgid ""
"Follow common sense in the Bash read-only classifier rather than blanket "
"strictness: `sort`, `uniq`, `sed`, and `tree` auto-run (with guards only "
"on their real file-writing forms — `sort -o`, `uniq IN OUT`, `sed -i`, "
"`tree -o`), and the ubiquitous harmless redirections (`2>/dev/null`, "
"`>/dev/null`, `< /dev/null`, `2>&1`, `>&2`) no longer trigger a prompt. "
"Real writes to a file and command substitution still ask."
msgstr ""
"在 Bash 只读分类器中遵循常识而不是一刀切的严格:`sort`、`uniq`、`sed` 与 `tree` "
"自动运行(只对其真正写文件的形态设防——`sort -o`、`uniq IN OUT`、`sed -i`、`tree "
"-o`),无处不在的无害重定向(`2>/dev/null`、`>/dev/null`、`< "
"/dev/null`、`2>&1`、`>&2`)不再触发提示。对文件的真实写入与命令替换仍会询问。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1077
msgid ""
"Suppress prompt-toolkit's CPR warning in terminals that do not answer "
"cursor position requests by disabling CPR probing for nanocode's prompt "
"applications."
msgstr "在不应答光标位置请求的终端中,通过禁用 nanocode 提示应用的 CPR 探测,抑制 prompt-toolkit 的 CPR 警告。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1078
msgid ""
"Stop closed stdin from escaping as an unhandled exception in the queue-"
"input background thread."
msgstr "防止关闭的 stdin 在队列输入后台线程中逃逸为未处理异常。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1079
msgid ""
"Stable Edit anchors, eliminating spurious \"stale anchor\" errors. "
"`line_hash` no longer folds the trailing newline into the hash, so a "
"line's anchor stays valid when only its final newline changes (e.g. the "
"last line gaining or losing its `\\n`) and Read/Search/Edit anchors now "
"agree with InspectCode's. Edit also numbers lines exactly like Read — "
"both split on `\\n` only via a shared `ReadTool.split_lines`, replacing "
"`str.splitlines(True)`, which additionally breaks on `\\r`, `\\v`, `\\f`,"
" `\\x1c`–`\\x1e`, `\\x85`, `\\u2028`, `\\u2029` and desynced line "
"numbering (and thus anchors) for any file containing those characters."
msgstr ""
"稳定的 Edit 锚点，消除了虚假的「stale anchor」错误。`line_hash` "
"不再把尾部换行符折进哈希，因此当某行只有末尾换行变化时（例如最后一行增加或失去 `\\n`），锚点仍然有效，Read/Search/Edit "
"的锚点与 InspectCode 一致。Edit 的行号也精确与 Read 相同——两者都只通过共享的 "
"`ReadTool.split_lines` 按 `\\n` 切分，取代会额外在 "
"`\\r`、`\\v`、`\\f`、`\\x1c`–`\\x1e`、`\\x85`、`\\u2028`、`\\u2029` "
"上断行、导致含这些字符的文件行号（进而锚点）失步的 `str.splitlines(True)`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1080
msgid ""
"Bump `code-symbol-index` to `>=0.3.5`, fixing a tree-sitter range "
"extraction crash that could terminate `nanocode --resume last` with "
"SIGSEGV and leave a core dump during background index refresh, while "
"using the package's validated tree-sitter dependency floor."
msgstr ""
"把 `code-symbol-index` 提升到 `>=0.3.5`,修复 tree-sitter 范围提取崩溃——它可能以 SIGSEGV "
"终止 `nanocode --resume last` 并在后台索引刷新时留下核心转储——同时使用该包经过校验的 tree-sitter "
"依赖下限。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1081
msgid ""
"Render Ask choice previews with escaped `\\n` sequences expanded into "
"real lines, allow the choice window to use available vertical space above"
" the status bar, and stop repeating the full raw question text when "
"switching to \"Type freely...\"."
msgstr ""
"把 Ask 选项预览中被转义的 `\\n` 序列展开为真实换行，允许选项窗口使用状态栏上方的可用纵向空间，并停止在切换到「Type "
"freely...」时重复完整原始问题文本。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1082
msgid ""
"Render intermediate assistant markdown correctly while the `+>` queue "
"prompt is active; Rich ANSI output is now replayed through prompt-toolkit"
" instead of leaking as `?[90m`-style text."
msgstr ""
"在 `+>` 队列提示激活时正确渲染中间的 assistant markdown;Rich ANSI 输出现在通过 prompt-toolkit "
"重放,而不是泄漏为 `?[90m` 风格的文本。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1083
msgid ""
"Move the active-turn elapsed timer into the animated `working` divider; "
"the sweep now scans only the horizontal rule so the label stays readable."
msgstr "把活动回合的已用计时器移入动画 `working` 分隔线;sweep 现在只扫水平规则,使标签保持可读。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1084
msgid ""
"Show saved tool summaries on `--resume` even when the compacted "
"transcript no longer contains the original assistant tool-call messages."
msgstr "在 `--resume` 时显示保存的工具摘要,即使压缩后的记录不再包含原始的 assistant 工具调用消息。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1085
msgid ""
"Add regression coverage for Ask preview/free-text rendering, whole-second"
" working timers, and restored saved tool summaries."
msgstr "为 Ask 预览/自由文本渲染、整秒 working 计时器与恢复的保存工具摘要增加回归覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1087
msgid "0.8.2 - 2026-07-03"
msgstr "0.8.2 - 2026-07-03"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1090
msgid ""
"Auto-submit queued input you already pressed Enter on. While the agent is"
" working, typing in the `+>` queue and pressing Enter records the line "
"into `pending_user_inputs`; if the turn ended before a step consumed it, "
"that already-entered text was pre-filled back into the prompt and sat "
"there waiting for a *second* Enter (and could feel like a very delayed "
"send). Now, in interactive mode, Enter-committed queue input auto-submits"
" as the next turn with no second keypress, while text you were still "
"typing (never Enter'd) is still pre-filled into the prompt for review. "
"Mid-turn injection and the headless combined-submit path are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"自动提交你已经按过 Enter 的排队输入。agent 工作时,在 `+>` 队列中键入并按 Enter 会把该行记录到 "
"`pending_user_inputs`;如果回合在某个步骤消费它之前结束,这段已输入文本会被预填回提示符,等待*第二次* "
"Enter(可能感觉像一次严重延迟的发送)。现在,在交互模式下,按 Enter "
"提交的队列输入会自动作为下一回合提交,无需第二次按键;你仍在键入(从未按 "
"Enter)的文本仍会预填回提示符供审阅。回合中途注入与无头合并提交路径不变。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1092
msgid "0.8.1 - 2026-07-02"
msgstr "0.8.1 - 2026-07-02"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1095
msgid ""
"Add a `nanocode update` (alias `upgrade`) command that upgrades nanocode "
"to the latest PyPI release. It first checks the latest version, reports "
"and exits when already current, then detects how nanocode was installed "
"and runs the matching upgrade command: `uv tool upgrade nanocode-cli` for"
" uv-tool installs, `pipx upgrade nanocode-cli` for pipx, and `python -m "
"pip install --upgrade nanocode-cli` otherwise. Editable/dev installs are "
"detected (via the distribution's `direct_url.json`) and refused with a "
"hint to update the source instead."
msgstr ""
"新增 `nanocode update`(别名 `upgrade`)命令,把 nanocode 升级到最新的 PyPI "
"发行版。它先检查最新版本,已是最新时报告并退出,然后检测 nanocode 的安装方式并运行匹配的升级命令:`uv tool upgrade "
"nanocode-cli`(uv-tool 安装)、`pipx upgrade nanocode-cli`(pipx),否则 `python -m"
" pip install --upgrade nanocode-cli`。可编辑/开发安装会被检测到(通过发行版的 "
"`direct_url.json`)并拒绝,同时提示改为更新源码。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1097
msgid "0.8.0 - 2026-07-01"
msgstr "0.8.0 - 2026-07-01"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add Skills: reusable instruction packs discovered from "
"`.nanocode/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (project) and "
"`~/.nanocode/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (user; project wins on name clash). "
"Each skill is a Markdown file with `name`/`description` frontmatter and "
"may bundle helper scripts in its folder. A compact `SKILLS` index (name +"
" description) rides the cache-stable request prefix so the model knows "
"what exists, and the full body is pulled into the conversation only on "
"demand — either when the model calls the new `Skill(name)` tool or when "
"the user references a skill inline with `$name` (Tab-completed). A "
"`{skill_dir}` / `${SKILL_DIR}` placeholder in the body expands to the "
"skill's absolute folder path when loaded, so bundled scripts are runnable"
" via `Bash` without hardcoded paths. Repeated `Skill(name)` loads "
"collapse to a one-line pointer (like MCP `describe`), keeping the first "
"full body cached and not re-billing the instructions. A built-in "
"`nanocode-help` skill ships by default (out of the box, no install) that "
"answers questions about nanocode itself — how to use it, its features, "
"and common problems — from a self-contained manual, so it does not read "
"the source per question. The body is an authored manual (concepts, "
"workflows, troubleshooting) plus lists assembled at load time from the "
"same in-code constants the app uses (the `/help` text, each tool's "
"description, the settable config keys), so the prose is rich while the "
"lists cannot drift from the running version; the raw source is named only"
" as a last-resort fallback. A project/user skill of the same name "
"overrides it. Because a built-in is always present, the `SKILLS` section "
"and `Skill` tool ride every request; only a session with its skills "
"explicitly cleared drops back to the prior byte-identical prefix. "
"Installed skills are surfaced in the status bar (`skills N`), the "
"`/status` context row (`skills N`), a read-only `/skills` command, and "
"`/help` now documents the `$skill` inline mention."
msgstr ""
"新增 Skills:可复用的指令包,从 `.nanocode/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`(项目)和 "
"`~/.nanocode/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`(用户;同名时项目优先)发现。每个 skill 是一个 Markdown "
"文件,带 `name`/`description` frontmatter,可以在其文件夹中捆绑辅助脚本。一个紧凑的 `SKILLS` 索引(名称"
" + 描述)搭载缓存稳定的请求前缀,让模型知道有什么;完整正文只在需要时拉入对话——要么模型调用新的 `Skill(name)` 工具,要么用户用"
" `$name` 内联引用 skill(Tab 补全)。正文中的 `{skill_dir}` / `${SKILL_DIR}` "
"占位符在加载时展开为 skill 的绝对文件夹路径,因此捆绑脚本无需硬编码路径即可通过 `Bash` 运行。重复的 `Skill(name)` "
"加载收拢为一行指针(类似 MCP `describe`),保持首个完整正文被缓存,不再重复计费指令。默认内置一个 `nanocode-help` "
"skill(开箱即有,无需安装),从一个自包含手册回答关于 nanocode "
"本身的问题——如何使用、功能与常见问题——因此不会每次提问都读源码。正文是一部编写好的手册(概念、工作流、故障排查),外加加载时从应用使用的同一组代码内常量组装出的列表(`/help`"
" 文本、每个工具的描述、可设置的配置键),因此散文丰富而列表不会偏离运行版本;原始源码仅作为最后手段被点名。同名的项目/用户 skill "
"会覆盖它。由于内置 skill 始终存在,`SKILLS` 小节与 `Skill` 工具搭乘每次请求;只有显式清空 skills "
"的会话才会回退到之前逐字节一致的前缀。已安装的 skill 出现在状态栏(`skills N`)、`/status` 的 context "
"行(`skills N`)、只读的 `/skills` 命令中,`/help` 现在也记录 `$skill` 内联提及。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1101
msgid ""
"Replace `/memory` with `/context`, a viewer for the model's synthesized "
"context frame — the Environment, Memory (goal, plan, known facts, check, "
"code-index status), and File State sections that wrap the conversation on"
" every request. At an interactive prompt, bare `/context` opens a tabbed "
"viewer (`←/→` or `h/l` switch Environment/Memory/File State, `↑/↓` or "
"`j/k` scroll, `1`–`3` jump, `Esc`/`q` close) with the sections rendered "
"as Markdown tables/headings and a scroll-position indicator; while the "
"agent is working or without a TTY it prints the same content as a static "
"Markdown dump. `/context <path>` shows one in-context file's current "
"anchored lines (matched by exact path, basename, or suffix) inside a "
"fenced block. Unlike the old `/memory`, the Memory section now renders "
"exactly as the model receives it (so it includes `check` and code-index "
"status and omits the transcript-only summary)."
msgstr ""
"用 `/context` 取代 `/memory`,一个查看模型合成上下文帧的查看器——每次请求包裹对话的 "
"Environment、Memory(goal、plan、known facts、check、代码索引状态)与 File State "
"小节。在交互提示符下,裸 `/context` 打开标签页查看器(`←/→` 或 `h/l` 切换 Environment/Memory/File"
" State,`↑/↓` 或 `j/k` 滚动,`1`–`3` 跳转,`Esc`/`q` 关闭),各小节渲染为 Markdown "
"表格/标题并带滚动位置指示;agent 工作时或没有 TTY 时,它以静态 Markdown 转储打印同样内容。`/context <path>`"
" 在围栏块内显示一个上下文内文件当前的锚定行(按精确路径、基名或后缀匹配)。与旧的 `/memory` 不同,Memory "
"小节现在与模型接收到的完全一致(因此它包含 `check` 与代码索引状态,省略仅记录形式的摘要)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1102
msgid ""
"Detect prompt-prefix drift via fingerprinting. The cache-stable request "
"prefix (system prompt + environment + MCP tool index + sorted tool "
"schemas) is fingerprinted (SHA-256) each turn against a baseline pinned "
"to the first one seen; a healthy session keeps a single fingerprint start"
" to finish, while a second one means every token from the change onward "
"is a cache miss that previously failed silently and only surfaced on the "
"bill. `/status` shows a `⚠ prefix churn` warning with the distinct-"
"fingerprint count when more than one is seen, `--debug` writes a unified "
"diff of exactly what changed (`cache-prefix-drift`), and the fingerprints"
" persist across `--resume`."
msgstr ""
"通过指纹检测 prompt 前缀漂移。缓存稳定的请求前缀(系统提示词 + 环境 + MCP 工具索引 + 排序的工具 schema)每回合用 "
"SHA-256 与固定在首个所见值的基线比对;健康会话从头到尾保持单一指纹,第二个指纹意味着从变更点起的每个 token "
"都是缓存未命中——此前静默失败,只在账单上显现。`/status` 在看到多个指纹时显示 `⚠ prefix churn` "
"警告与不同指纹计数,`--debug` 写出恰好变更内容的统一 diff(`cache-prefix-drift`),指纹在 `--resume`"
" 间持久化。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1105
msgid ""
"Track and show the context compaction count in `/status`. `AgentState` "
"gains a persisted `compaction_count` incremented on every compaction path"
" (history, turn, and their fallbacks), surfaced in the `/status` context "
"row and preserved across session save/load."
msgstr ""
"在 `/status` 中跟踪并显示上下文压缩次数。`AgentState` 获得持久化的 "
"`compaction_count`,在每条压缩路径(历史、回合及其回退)上递增,显示在 `/status` 的 context "
"行中,并在会话保存/加载间保留。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1107
msgid "0.7.2 - 2026-06-26"
msgstr "0.7.2 - 2026-06-26"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1110
msgid ""
"Show a short, context-aware tip on startup (a curated set covering "
"sessions, context, model/reasoning, tools, and config). Tips whose "
"feature is unavailable are filtered out (e.g. `/strict` only shows when "
"the provider supports strict tools; MCP tips only when MCP is "
"configured). The line is styled as a muted hint with highlighted `code` "
"spans and can be disabled with `runtime.tips = false` (or `/set "
"runtime.tips off`)."
msgstr ""
"启动时显示一条简短、上下文感知的提示(一组精选,涵盖会话、上下文、模型/推理、工具与配置)。功能不可用的提示会被过滤掉(例如 `/strict` "
"只在 provider 支持严格工具时显示;MCP 提示只在配置了 MCP 时显示)。该行以柔和的提示样式呈现,带高亮的 `code` 片段,可用"
" `runtime.tips = false`(或 `/set runtime.tips off`)禁用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1111
msgid ""
"Add per-property `description` fields to every built-in tool's JSON "
"Schema (`Read`, `LineCount`, `List`, `Find`, `Search`, `InspectCode`, "
"`Edit`, `Bash`, `Git`, `Recall`, `Note`). The argument contract now lives"
" in the schema the model parses natively rather than only in the prose "
"signature, improving tool-call argument accuracy across providers."
msgstr ""
"给每个内置工具的 JSON "
"Schema(`Read`、`LineCount`、`List`、`Find`、`Search`、`InspectCode`、`Edit`、`Bash`、`Git`、`Recall`、`Note`)增加逐属性的"
" `description` 字段。参数契约现在存在于模型原生解析的 schema 中,而不仅是散文签名,跨 provider "
"提高工具调用参数的准确性。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1112
msgid ""
"Add a `/strict` command to toggle `provider.strict_tools` for the active "
"provider, reporting when it is enabled but inactive (the provider does "
"not support strict tool calling)."
msgstr ""
"新增 `/strict` 命令,切换活动 provider 的 "
"`provider.strict_tools`,在启用但未激活时报告(provider 不支持严格工具调用)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1113
msgid ""
"Add a `provider.strict_tools` option (default `false`, also settable via "
"`/set`) that constrains tool-call arguments to each tool's JSON Schema. "
"When enabled it is only active on hosts whose profile supports strict "
"mode (`api.openai.com`, `api.deepseek.com`) and on the chat path; every "
"other provider is unaffected. Activating it emits a strict-compliant "
"schema (all properties required, genuine optionals made nullable, "
"`additionalProperties: false`, and the unsupported "
"`minItems`/`maxItems`/`minLength`/`maxLength` keywords dropped) with "
"`strict: true` per function, and on DeepSeek it routes the client to the "
"`/beta` endpoint where the feature lives. Because optionals become "
"nullable, the model may send explicit `null` for an omitted argument; "
"nanocode now strips `null` values (recursively) before dispatching to a "
"tool, where `null` has always meant \"absent\"."
msgstr ""
"新增 `provider.strict_tools` 选项（默认 `false`，也可用 `/set` 设置），把工具调用参数约束到每个工具的 "
"JSON Schema。启用后仅在支持严格模式的主机（`api.openai.com`、`api.deepseek.com`）的 chat "
"路径上生效；其他 provider 不受影响。启用时发出符合严格模式的 "
"schema（所有属性必填、真正的可选值改为可空、`additionalProperties: false`，并丢弃不支持的 "
"`minItems`/`maxItems`/`minLength`/`maxLength` 关键字），每个函数带 `strict: true`；在"
" DeepSeek 上会把客户端路由到该功能所在的 `/beta` 端点。由于可选值变为可空，模型可能为省略的参数发送显式 "
"`null`；nanocode 现在在分发给工具前（递归地）剥离 `null` 值，因为 `null` 在工具侧一直表示「缺省」。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1116
msgid ""
"Add a `provider.max_tokens` option (also settable via `/set`) capping "
"chat-completion output. It defaults to `0` (unset) for generic OpenAI-"
"compatible providers, so their requests are unchanged, and resolves to a "
"profile default of `32768` on `api.deepseek.com` so DeepSeek thinking "
"mode has enough room for `reasoning_content` plus the answer."
msgstr ""
"新增 `provider.max_tokens` 选项(也可通过 `/set` 设置),限制 chat-completion 输出。对通用 "
"OpenAI 兼容 provider 默认为 `0`(未设置),请求不变;在 `api.deepseek.com` 上解析为 `32768` 的 "
"profile 默认值,让 DeepSeek 思考模式有足够空间容纳 `reasoning_content` 与答案。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1117
msgid ""
"Map `reasoning = \"high\"` to DeepSeek's agent-recommended `max` effort "
"in the thinking effort table (was `high`); `xhigh` still maps to `max` "
"and the default `medium` still maps to `high`. Only the DeepSeek/Qwen "
"`thinking` style is affected."
msgstr ""
"在思考力度表中把 `reasoning = \"high\"` 映射到 DeepSeek 官方推荐的 `max`（原为 "
"`high`）；`xhigh` 仍映射到 `max`，默认的 `medium` 仍映射到 `high`。只影响 DeepSeek/Qwen 的 "
"`thinking` 风格。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1118
msgid ""
"Skip the OpenAI-only `prompt_cache_key` parameter for `api.deepseek.com`,"
" which caches by prefix automatically and ignores the key. All other "
"hosts keep emitting it as before."
msgstr ""
"对 `api.deepseek.com` 跳过仅 OpenAI 的 `prompt_cache_key` "
"参数,它按前缀自动缓存并忽略该键。其它主机照常继续发送。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1121
msgid ""
"Keep the Bash live preview alive during blocking commands so the terminal"
" no longer looks frozen. A command that buffers its output (e.g. a quiet "
"long-runner, or `... | tail` that emits nothing until EOF) previously "
"left the screen completely static — the status bar is stopped while a "
"command runs and the preview only drew when output arrived. The preview "
"now renders an immediate frame showing the command being executed (`$ "
"<command>`) and a live elapsed timer (`running… 12.3s`), ticked by a "
"daemon heartbeat so the timer advances even with no output, and switches "
"to `output · 12.3s` once output streams. On finish the frame is now "
"erased (it previously lingered as dimmed ghost lines), and a full-width "
"line can no longer auto-wrap and desync the redraw cursor math."
msgstr ""
"让 Bash 实时预览在阻塞命令期间保持活动,终端不再看起来冻结。缓冲输出的命令(如安静的长运行器,或直到 EOF 才输出的 `... | "
"tail`)此前让屏幕完全静止——命令运行时状态栏停止,预览只在输出到达时绘制。预览现在立即渲染一帧显示正在执行的命令(`$ "
"<command>`)与实时已用计时器(`running… 12.3s`),由守护心跳驱动,因此即使没有输出计时器也会前进,一旦输出流动就切换到 "
"`output · 12.3s`。结束时帧现在会被擦除(此前作为暗色幽灵行残留),全宽行也不再自动换行并使重绘光标计算失步。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1122
msgid ""
"Set an explicit output ceiling for DeepSeek thinking mode so long "
"`reasoning_content` no longer exhausts the server-side default and "
"truncates the response or drops the tool call."
msgstr "为 DeepSeek 思考模式设置显式输出上限,使长 `reasoning_content` 不再耗尽服务器端默认值并截断响应或丢弃工具调用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1123
msgid ""
"Stop sending `temperature` on the chat path when a native thinking style "
"(`thinking`/`enable_thinking`) is enabled, since DeepSeek and Qwen reject"
" or ignore it in that mode. Other reasoning styles and providers are "
"untouched."
msgstr ""
"启用原生思考风格(`thinking`/`enable_thinking`)时,不再在 chat 路径发送 `temperature`,因为 "
"DeepSeek 与 Qwen 在该模式下会拒绝或忽略它。其它推理风格与 provider 不受影响。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1124
msgid ""
"Drain the MCP background event loop on exit. MCP work runs on a daemon "
"loop thread; at interpreter shutdown the `concurrent.futures` atexit hook"
" tore down the default executors before that thread was joined, so an in-"
"flight client cleanup (HTTP session termination, DNS via "
"`run_in_executor`) raced the teardown and printed `cannot schedule new "
"futures after shutdown` / `Session termination failed`. "
"`MCPManager.close()` now cancels pending tasks, stops the loop, and joins"
" the thread (5s timeout) from `main()`'s `finally` before the interpreter"
" tears down its executors."
msgstr ""
"退出时排空 MCP 后台事件循环。MCP 工作运行在守护循环线程上;解释器关闭时,`concurrent.futures` 的 atexit "
"钩子在该线程被 join 之前就拆掉了默认执行器,因此进行中的客户端清理(HTTP 会话终止、经 `run_in_executor` 的 "
"DNS)与拆解竞态,打印 `cannot schedule new futures after shutdown` / `Session "
"termination failed`。`MCPManager.close()` 现在在解释器拆掉执行器之前,从 `main()` 的 "
"`finally` 中取消挂起任务、停止循环并 join 线程(5 秒超时)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1126
msgid "0.7.1 - 2026-06-25"
msgstr "0.7.1 - 2026-06-25"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1129
msgid ""
"Run the code-symbol-index working-tree check off the UI critical path. "
"`/status` previously forced a synchronous `csi.status(check=True)` full-"
"tree scan (~1.5s on large repos) before rendering, and the same scan ran "
"inline at the end of every turn, delaying the answer. `/status` now reads"
" the last-known status instantly (`check=False`) and triggers the scan "
"asynchronously, and the per-turn `update_pending()` runs in a guarded "
"one-shot daemon thread, so neither blocks the UI. A new transient "
"`code_index_checking` guard prevents overlapping scans."
msgstr ""
"把 code-symbol-index 工作树检查移出 UI 关键路径。`/status` 此前在渲染前强制同步 "
"`csi.status(check=True)` 全树扫描(大仓库约 1.5 "
"秒),同一扫描也在每个回合结束时内联运行,延迟答案。`/status` "
"现在即时读取最后已知状态(`check=False`)并异步触发扫描;逐回合的 `update_pending()` "
"在受守护的一次性守护线程中运行,两者都不阻塞 UI。新增瞬时 `code_index_checking` 守卫防止重叠扫描。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1131
msgid "0.7.0 - 2026-06-24"
msgstr "0.7.0 - 2026-06-24"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1134
msgid ""
"Execute a model's batch of read-only tool calls concurrently. Within one "
"assistant turn, maximal runs of auto-approved, non-interactive read tools"
" (`Read`, `Search`, `Find`, `List`, `Recall`, `InspectCode`, read-only "
"`Git`, read-only `MCP`) now run in a bounded thread pool, while results "
"are finalized on the main thread in the exact order the model issued "
"them. Mutating tools, `Edit` batches, confirmations, `Bash` (live "
"output), and `Question` (interactive) stay serial. Bounded by the new "
"`runtime.max_parallel_tools` setting (default `4`; set to `1` to disable "
"and restore fully serial execution)."
msgstr ""
"并发执行模型的一批只读工具调用。在一个 assistant "
"回合内,最长串的自动批准、非交互读工具(`Read`、`Search`、`Find`、`List`、`Recall`、`InspectCode`、只读"
" `Git`、只读 `MCP`)现在运行在有界的线程池中,结果在主线程上按模型发出的确切顺序定稿。变更性工具、`Edit` "
"批、确认、`Bash`(实时输出)与 `Question`(交互)保持串行。由新的 `runtime.max_parallel_tools` "
"设置约束(默认 `4`;设为 `1` 可禁用并恢复完全串行执行)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1135
msgid ""
"Store `Note` plan items as explicit objects with `status` (`todo`, "
"`doing`, `done`, `blocked`) and `text`, while preserving old string plans"
" as `todo` during load/compaction. Model-visible memory renders readable "
"status text; CLI memory and Note previews keep compact `[ ]`, `[~]`, "
"`[x]`, `[-]` symbols."
msgstr ""
"把 `Note` 计划项存储为带 `status`(`todo`、`doing`、`done`、`blocked`)与 `text` "
"的显式对象,同时在加载/压缩期间把旧字符串计划保留为 `todo`。模型可见的记忆渲染可读的状态文本;CLI 记忆与 Note 预览保持紧凑的 "
"`[ ]`、`[~]`、`[x]`、`[-]` 符号。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1136
msgid ""
"Added a concise system-prompt `GUIDE` section covering `THINK BEFORE "
"CODING`, `SIMPLICITY FIRST`, `SURGICAL CHANGES`, and `GOAL-DRIVEN "
"EXECUTION`."
msgstr ""
"在系统提示词中增加简洁的 `GUIDE` 小节,涵盖 `THINK BEFORE CODING`、`SIMPLICITY "
"FIRST`、`SURGICAL CHANGES` 与 `GOAL-DRIVEN EXECUTION`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1139
msgid ""
"Stop auto-approved (yolo) tool calls from logging two near-identical CLI "
"lines. The pre-execution `auto …` line duplicated the result line's "
"header for tools without a preview (MCP, Bash, Git); it is now suppressed"
" in that case and the auto-approval is recorded by an `[auto]` tag on the"
" single result line. `Edit` still shows its `auto …` pre-line because it "
"carries the diff preview the result line omits."
msgstr ""
"阻止自动批准(yolo)的工具调用记录两条几乎相同的 CLI 行。执行前的 `auto …` "
"行对没有预览的工具(MCP、Bash、Git)重复了结果行的标题;这种情况下它现在被抑制,自动批准由单条结果行上的 `[auto]` "
"标签记录。`Edit` 仍显示其 `auto …` 前置行,因为它携带结果行省略的 diff 预览。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1140
msgid ""
"Depend on `fastmcp-slim[client]` instead of the full `fastmcp` meta-"
"package, since only the MCP client is used. This drops the unused "
"server/CLI stack (cyclopts, griffelib, uvicorn-side bits, "
"openapi/jsonschema tooling, the keyring/py-key-value cluster, etc.) for a"
" much smaller install."
msgstr ""
"依赖 `fastmcp-slim[client]` 而不是完整的 `fastmcp` 元包,因为只使用 MCP 客户端。这去掉未用的服务器/CLI"
" 栈(cyclopts、griffelib、uvicorn 相关部件、openapi/jsonschema 工具、keyring/py-key-"
"value 集群等),安装体积小得多。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1141
msgid ""
"Switched Read/Search/Edit/InspectCode anchors to the explicit "
"`anchor=line:hash | text` format and documented the hash as "
"`hash(line_content)` in FILE STATE."
msgstr ""
"把 Read/Search/Edit/InspectCode 锚点切换到显式的 `anchor=line:hash | text` 格式,并在 "
"FILE STATE 中把哈希记录为 `hash(line_content)`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1142
msgid ""
"Bumped the `code-symbol-index` dependency floor to `>=0.3.1` and use its "
"upstream explicit InspectCode anchor formatter instead of local "
"normalization."
msgstr ""
"把 `code-symbol-index` 依赖下限提升到 `>=0.3.1`,并使用其上游显式 InspectCode "
"锚点格式化器,而不是本地规范化。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1143
msgid ""
"Reduced `nanocode.py` by removing dead code, thin wrappers, and over-"
"complex helper paths without changing behavior."
msgstr "通过移除死代码、薄包装与过度复杂的辅助路径缩小 `nanocode.py`,行为不变。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1144
msgid ""
"Render Note success output with user-facing `goal:`, `check:`, `plan:`, "
"and `known:` labels, plus status-aware colors in the CLI, instead of "
"exposing internal field names like `set_goal` and `replace_plan`."
msgstr ""
"用面向用户的 `goal:`、`check:`、`plan:`、`known:` 标签渲染 Note 成功输出,并在 CLI "
"中带状态感知的颜色,而不是暴露 `set_goal`、`replace_plan` 这类内部字段名。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1147
msgid ""
"Keep every MCP server visible in the tools index. It previously built "
"full per-tool schemas and then hard-truncated the whole block at the size"
" cap, so one verbose server could consume the entire budget and silently "
"drop every later server, leaving the model blind to them. The index now "
"degrades by shedding detail rather than entities — inline schemas, then "
"schemas-dropped, then name-only — keeping all servers and tool names "
"visible (the model can re-fetch a schema via `describe`); only at "
"thousands of tools does it truncate, and that case now warns via a post-"
"discovery notice and a `!` status-line marker."
msgstr ""
"让每个 MCP 服务器在工具索引中保持可见。此前它构建完整的逐工具 "
"schema,然后在大小上限处硬截断整个块,于是一个冗长的服务器就能耗尽整个预算并静默丢弃所有后续服务器,让模型对它们视而不见。索引现在通过剥离细节而非实体来降级——先内联"
" schema,再丢弃 schema,最后只剩名称——保持所有服务器与工具名可见(模型可通过 `describe` 重新获取 "
"schema);只有数千个工具时才截断,此时通过发现后通知与状态行 `!` 标记给出警告。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1148
msgid ""
"Declare `websockets` as a direct dependency. The MCP client transport "
"imports it at runtime, but `fastmcp` only declared it under its server "
"extra, so trimming that extra broke MCP connections (including OAuth "
"login)."
msgstr ""
"把 `websockets` 声明为直接依赖。MCP 客户端传输在运行时导入它,但 `fastmcp` 只在服务器 extra "
"下声明它,因此裁剪该 extra 会破坏 MCP 连接(包括 OAuth 登录)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1149
msgid ""
"Render structured plan items in `/memory` and Note previews as status "
"symbols/text instead of leaking `PlanItem(...)` repr strings."
msgstr "在 `/memory` 与 Note 预览中把结构化计划项渲染为状态符号/文本,而不是泄漏 `PlanItem(...)` 的 repr 字符串。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1150
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Resume sessions whose transcript contains tool calls with multi-line "
"argument strings (e.g. a multi-line `git commit` message). Strict "
"`json.loads` rejected the literal newlines and dropped the args to `{}`, "
"which then failed the tool's own validation (`Git requires a non-empty "
"'argv' list`) and aborted `--resume`. Tool-call arguments now parse with "
"`strict=False`, and a malformed historical call renders without args "
"instead of crashing."
msgstr ""
"恢复记录中含有带多行参数字符串(如多行 `git commit` 消息)的工具调用的会话。严格的 `json.loads` "
"拒绝字面换行并把参数丢弃为 `{}`,随后工具自身校验失败(`Git requires a non-empty 'argv' list`),中止 "
"`--resume`。工具调用参数现在以 `strict=False` 解析,格式错误的历史调用无参数渲染而不是崩溃。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1151
msgid ""
"Stop malformed live tool-call arguments from aborting the whole turn. "
"Argument validation that ran while parsing a model response (e.g. `Git` "
"with an empty `argv`) raised outside the tool-execution boundary, ending "
"the turn with an error the model never saw. The error is now captured on "
"the call and surfaced as a normal failed tool result, so the model can "
"self-correct."
msgstr ""
"阻止格式错误的实时工具调用参数中止整个回合。解析模型响应期间运行的参数校验(如 `Git` 带空 "
"`argv`)在工具执行边界之外抛出,以模型从未见过的错误结束回合。错误现在被捕获在调用上,作为普通失败的工具结果呈现,模型可以自我纠正。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1152
msgid ""
"Decode `Bash` output with a per-stream incremental UTF-8 decoder. Each "
"4096-byte read was decoded independently, so a multibyte character split "
"across a read boundary (common with CJK output) was mangled into "
"replacement characters."
msgstr ""
"用逐流增量 UTF-8 解码器解码 `Bash` 输出。此前每个 4096 字节的读取独立解码,因此跨读取边界拆分(常见于 CJK "
"输出)的多字节字符会被弄成替换字符。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1154
msgid "0.6.6 - 2026-06-23"
msgstr "0.6.6 - 2026-06-23"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1157
msgid ""
"Report the prompt-cache hit rate in `/status` against input/prompt tokens"
" instead of total tokens (which folded in completion/reasoning output and"
" structurally understated the rate), and show the `cached/prompt` split "
"for both the cumulative and last-call figures."
msgstr ""
"`/status` 中的 prompt 缓存命中率按输入/prompt token 而非总 token 报告(后者折入 "
"completion/推理输出,结构性低估命中率),并对累计与最后调用两个数字显示 `cached/prompt` 拆分。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1158
msgid ""
"Land MCP `describe` results inline in the conversation history (bounded "
"and recallable like any tool output) instead of stripping them into a "
"recomputed `MCP TOOL DETAILS` tail block. The schema is now written once "
"and cached as the conversation grows, rather than re-billed uncached on "
"every request; the tools index tells the model not to describe a tool "
"again once its schema is already shown."
msgstr ""
"把 MCP `describe` 结果内联落在对话历史中(与任何工具输出一样有界、可召回),而不是剥离进重算的 `MCP TOOL "
"DETAILS` 尾部块。schema 现在只写一次,随对话增长被缓存,而不是每次请求都未缓存地重新计费;工具索引告诉模型,一旦 schema "
"已显示就不必再次 describe 该工具。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1159
msgid ""
"Collapse repeated MCP `describe` results for the same tool to a one-line "
"pointer when building the request, keeping only the first full schema per"
" `(server, tool)`. This is a stateless send-time transform that never "
"mutates stored history and only ever collapses the newer occurrence, so "
"it reclaims duplicate-schema tokens without disturbing the cached prefix."
msgstr ""
"构建请求时,把同一工具的重复 MCP `describe` 结果收拢为一行指针,每个 `(server, tool)` 只保留首个完整 "
"schema。这是无状态的发送时变换,从不改动存储的历史,只收拢较新的那次出现,因此在回收重复 schema token 的同时不扰动缓存前缀。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1161
msgid ""
"Tighten the final-answer style guidance: default to a few lines, scale "
"length to the task, lead with the result, and drop preamble / request-"
"restatement / step-by-step recaps, replacing the soft \"be concise\" "
"wording that models tended to ignore."
msgstr "收紧最终答案的风格指引：默认几行，篇幅随任务缩放，先给结果，去掉开场白、复述请求、逐步回顾，取代模型往往忽略的软性「be concise」措辞。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1162
msgid ""
"Add Tab/Shift-Tab completion (commands, paths, mentions) and a completion"
" menu to the queue-input area, matching the main prompt."
msgstr "给队列输入区添加 Tab/Shift-Tab 补全(命令、路径、提及)与补全菜单,与主提示符一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1163
msgid ""
"Run read-only slash commands (`/help`, `/status`, `/memory`, read-only "
"`/mcp`) plus `/yolo` typed in the queue-input area while the agent is "
"working, instead of sending them to the model as literal text. `/yolo` is"
" allowed because it is a single atomic flag the agent reads at the next "
"approval; other state-mutating or control commands are refused with a "
"hint to interrupt first, since they would race the in-flight turn."
msgstr ""
"在 agent 工作时运行在队列输入区键入的只读斜杠命令(`/help`、`/status`、`/memory`、只读 `/mcp`)与 "
"`/yolo`,而不是把它们作为字面文本发送给模型。允许 `/yolo` 是因为它是 agent "
"在下次审批时读取的单一原子标志;其它变更状态或控制命令被拒绝并提示先中断,因为它们会与在途回合竞态。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1164
msgid ""
"Pre-fill leftover queued input into the prompt for review/edit when a "
"turn finishes, instead of auto-submitting it as the next turn. Input "
"typed while the agent is working is still injected into the running task;"
" only input left over at the turn boundary now waits at an editable "
"prompt (non-interactive/piped input keeps auto-submitting, since there is"
" no one to confirm)."
msgstr ""
"回合结束时,把遗留的排队输入预填进提示符供审阅/编辑,而不是自动作为下一回合提交。agent "
"工作时键入的输入仍注入运行中的任务;只有回合边界遗留的输入现在等在可编辑的提示符处(非交互/管道输入保持自动提交,因为没有人确认)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1166
msgid ""
"Collapse argument/usage tool-call rejections to a quiet dim one-liner "
"(`tool X · rejected: <reason>`) in non-debug mode, instead of the full "
"red `[failed]` + error block. These are usually self-corrected on retry; "
"the full error still goes to the model and shows in debug, and real "
"execution failures stay fully visible."
msgstr ""
"在非调试模式下,把参数/用法工具调用拒绝收拢为安静的暗色单行(`tool X · rejected: <reason>`),而不是完整的红色 "
"`[failed]` + 错误块。这些通常在重试时自我纠正;完整错误仍发给模型并在调试中显示,真实执行失败保持完全可见。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1169
msgid ""
"Moved the volatile `code_index` status out of the early `Environment` "
"block (which sits ahead of the conversation history) into the late "
"`Memory` section, so its `synced ↔ stale` churn no longer invalidates the"
" cached conversation prefix every time files change or the indexer runs."
msgstr ""
"把易变的 `code_index` 状态从早期 `Environment` 块(位于对话历史之前)移到靠后的 `Memory` 小节,使它的 "
"`synced ↔ stale` 变化不再在文件变更或索引器运行时使缓存的对话前缀失效。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1171
msgid "0.6.5 - 2026-06-22"
msgstr "0.6.5 - 2026-06-22"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1174
msgid ""
"Surface each MCP tool's input JSON Schema to the model: the tools index "
"now carries a compact (capped) schema per tool and "
"`MCP(action=\"describe\")` emits the full schema, so the model can build "
"nested arguments correctly instead of guessing."
msgstr ""
"把每个 MCP 工具的输入 JSON Schema 暴露给模型：工具索引现在为每个工具携带精简（有上限）的 "
"schema，`MCP(action=\"describe\")` 输出完整 schema，让模型能正确构造嵌套参数而不是猜测。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1175
msgid ""
"Added MCP resource support: discover resources alongside tools "
"(concurrently, best-effort), list them in the tools index, and read them "
"via `MCP(action=\"list_resources\")` and `MCP(action=\"read_resource\", "
"uri=...)`. Resource reads flow through the normal tool-result path so "
"they land in cached conversation history."
msgstr ""
"新增 MCP 资源支持：与工具一起发现资源（并发、尽力而为），在工具索引中列出它们，并通过 "
"`MCP(action=\"list_resources\")` 和 `MCP(action=\"read_resource\", "
"uri=...)` 读取。资源读取走常规工具结果路径，因此会进入缓存的会话历史。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1176
msgid ""
"Surface resource-like URIs referenced in MCP tool descriptions on the "
"tool's index line, so doc references survive description truncation and "
"stay discoverable."
msgstr "在工具索引行上显示 MCP 工具描述中引用的资源类 URI,使文档引用在描述截断后仍存活、保持可发现。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1177
msgid ""
"List a server's resources in `@server` mention blocks, matching the tools"
" index."
msgstr "在 `@server` 提及块中列出服务器的资源,与工具索引一致。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1178
msgid ""
"Auto-read a resource referenced by an MCP tool's description on the first"
" call to that tool (once per uri per session, best-effort, web links "
"skipped), attaching it to the call result on success and to the error on "
"failure so argument-grammar docs reach the model on the first attempt and"
" land in cached history."
msgstr ""
"首次调用某 MCP 工具时自动读取其描述引用的资源(每个会话每个 uri 一次,尽力而为,跳过 web "
"链接),成功时附加到调用结果、失败时附加到错误上,使参数语法文档在第一次尝试就到达模型,并落入缓存历史。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1181
msgid ""
"Default the `MCP` tool `action` to `\"call\"` when omitted but "
"`tool`/`arguments` are present, and make the unknown-action error "
"actionable (lists valid actions and shows how to invoke a remote tool by "
"name)."
msgstr ""
"当 `MCP` 工具省略 `action` 但提供了 `tool`/`arguments` 时，默认其为 `\"call\"`，并让未知 "
"action 的错误可操作（列出合法 action，并说明如何按名称调用远程工具）。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1184
msgid ""
"Render connected MCP servers that advertise resources but no tools in the"
" tools index (previously gated on having ≥1 tool, so resource-only "
"servers were mislabeled \"not connected\" and their resources hidden); "
"`_pending_status` now distinguishes a connected-but-empty server from a "
"disconnected one."
msgstr ""
"在工具索引中渲染声明了资源但没有工具的已连接 MCP 服务器（此前以拥有 ≥1 个工具为门槛，因此仅资源的服务器被误标为「not "
"connected」，资源被隐藏）；`_pending_status` 现在区分已连接但为空的服务器与已断开的服务器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1186
msgid "0.6.4 - 2026-06-21"
msgstr "0.6.4 - 2026-06-21"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1189
msgid ""
"Added JSONL session persistence with append-only deltas for the normal "
"save path and `nanocode --resume [UID]` for restoring saved sessions."
msgstr "新增 JSONL 会话持久化,正常保存路径使用追加式 delta,`nanocode --resume [UID]` 用于恢复已保存的会话。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1190
msgid ""
"Added a `latest` session pointer and a resume command hint printed when "
"nanocode exits."
msgstr "新增 `latest` 会话指针,并在 nanocode 退出时打印恢复命令提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1191
msgid ""
"Added `nanocode --resume last` as an alias for resuming the latest saved "
"session."
msgstr "新增 `nanocode --resume last` 作为恢复最新已保存会话的别名。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1192
msgid ""
"Render restored session history once on resume without re-running tools "
"or commands."
msgstr "恢复时一次性渲染恢复的会话历史,不重新运行工具或命令。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1193
msgid "Show the active session id in `/status`."
msgstr "在 `/status` 中显示活动会话 id。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1194
msgid ""
"Added session persistence coverage for snapshot/delta save/load, "
"`latest`, usage/state/tool record roundtrips, missing snapshots, and exit"
" resume hints."
msgstr "新增会话持久化覆盖:快照/delta 保存与加载、`latest`、usage/state/工具记录往返、缺失快照与退出恢复提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1197
msgid ""
"Kept persisted session snapshots focused on necessary recovery data only,"
" deriving runtime tool-result lookup state from saved tool records "
"instead of storing config, settings, timestamps, git branch, or other "
"rebuildable runtime data."
msgstr ""
"让持久化的会话快照只聚焦必要的恢复数据,从保存的工具记录推导运行时工具结果查找状态,而不是存储配置、设置、时间戳、git "
"分支或其它可重建的运行时数据。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1198
msgid ""
"Skip first-save persistence for sessions with no recoverable content, "
"avoiding empty snapshots and stale `latest` pointers."
msgstr "对没有可恢复内容的会话跳过首次保存持久化,避免空快照与过期的 `latest` 指针。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1199
msgid ""
"Delete session files older than the configurable "
"`runtime.session_retention_days` retention window on startup; the default"
" is `7` days."
msgstr "启动时删除早于可配置 `runtime.session_retention_days` 保留窗口的会话文件;默认 `7` 天。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1200
msgid ""
"Treat retention and update-check interval settings as config-file policy "
"rather than `/set` runtime mutations."
msgstr "把保留与更新检查间隔设置视为配置文件策略,而不是 `/set` 运行时变更。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1201
msgid ""
"Split session snapshot encoding/merging from JSONL file storage, keeping "
"`Session` as a thin owner of runtime state."
msgstr "把会话快照编码/合并与 JSONL 文件存储拆分,让 `Session` 保持为运行时状态的薄属主。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1202
msgid ""
"Resume now applies the current config/runtime flags (`--config`, "
"`--yolo`, `--debug`, `--mcp`) while loading only conversation state from "
"the snapshot."
msgstr "恢复现在应用当前的配置/运行时标志(`--config`、`--yolo`、`--debug`、`--mcp`),同时只从快照加载对话状态。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1205
msgid ""
"Fixed command dispatch so ordinary non-command input reaches the agent "
"instead of being treated as an unknown slash command."
msgstr "修复命令分发,使普通非命令输入到达 agent,而不是被当作未知斜杠命令。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1206
msgid ""
"Changed the resume marker to an internal system message so it does not "
"affect latest-user compaction behavior."
msgstr "把恢复标记改为内部系统消息,使其不影响最新用户压缩行为。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1207
msgid "Report resume/load errors as CLI errors instead of uncaught exceptions."
msgstr "把恢复/加载错误报告为 CLI 错误,而不是未捕获异常。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1209
msgid ""
"Auto-submit queued input at round end: `queue_input_text` (typed but not "
"confirmed) and unconsumed `pending_user_inputs` both get drained and "
"submitted as the next user input; extracted as "
"`CommandLoop.drain_queued_input()`."
msgstr ""
"回合结束时自动提交排队输入:`queue_input_text`(已键入但未确认)与未消费的 `pending_user_inputs` "
"都会被排空并作为下一个用户输入提交;提取为 `CommandLoop.drain_queued_input()`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1210
msgid ""
"Clear blank `queue_input_text` even when it contains only whitespace, "
"preventing stale whitespace from lingering in the input area."
msgstr "即使 `queue_input_text` 只含空白也清除它,防止过期的空白滞留在输入区。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1212
msgid ""
"Record auto-submitted queued input in CLI history via "
"`FileHistory.append_string()`, so previously-queued text appears in "
"prompt history like any manually typed input."
msgstr ""
"通过 `FileHistory.append_string()` 把自动提交的排队输入记录进 CLI "
"历史,使之前排队的文本像任何手动输入一样出现在提示历史中。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1214
msgid "0.6.3 - 2026-06-21"
msgstr "0.6.3 - 2026-06-21"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1217
msgid ""
"Added `Question` tool that pauses the agent to ask the user one or more "
"questions (asked in sequence) when intent is genuinely ambiguous, a "
"design choice affects the external shape (module structure, public API, "
"naming), or prioritization is needed. Each question supports structured "
"choices with optional dynamic previews and an optional `recommended` "
"choice index (pre-selected and marked)."
msgstr ""
"新增 `Question` 工具:当意图确实含糊、设计选择影响外部形态(模块结构、公共 API、命名)或需要排定优先级时,暂停 agent "
"向用户提出一个问题或多个问题(按顺序提问)。每个问题支持带可选动态预览的结构化选项,以及可选的 `recommended` "
"选项索引(预选并标记)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1218
msgid ""
"Wired `Question` tool into the shared interactive selector with `j`/`k` "
"navigation, dynamic per-choice preview, Rich markdown rendering of the "
"question text, and a free-text fallback."
msgstr ""
"把 `Question` 工具接入共享交互选择器,带 `j`/`k` 导航、动态逐选项预览、问题文本的 Rich markdown "
"渲染与自由文本回退。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1219
msgid ""
"Echo the selected choice in the CLI after the interactive selector "
"closes, giving clear feedback on what was chosen."
msgstr "交互选择器关闭后在 CLI 中回显所选选项,给出所选内容的清晰反馈。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1220
msgid ""
"Prefix a position indicator (e.g. `(1/3)`) onto each question when "
"several are asked in one `Question` call."
msgstr "一次 `Question` 调用提多个问题时,为每个问题加位置指示前缀(如 `(1/3)`)。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1223
msgid ""
"Refined `Question` tool DESCRIPTION, SYSTEM_PROMPT usage guidance, and "
"README with clear principles: question only when intent is truly "
"ambiguous, design affects external shape, or prioritization is needed. "
"Skip internal details, contextually-determinable items, and already-"
"specified matters."
msgstr ""
"打磨 `Question` 工具的 DESCRIPTION、SYSTEM_PROMPT 用法指引与 "
"README,给出清晰原则:只在意图确实含糊、设计影响外部形态或需要排定优先级时提问。跳过内部细节、上下文可判定的条目与已规定的事项。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1226
msgid ""
"GitTool: validate non-empty `argv` in `payload_args` with a clear error "
"message when the model sends an empty command list."
msgstr "GitTool:在 `payload_args` 中校验非空 `argv`,模型发送空命令列表时给出清晰错误消息。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1227
msgid ""
"Update the tracked commit-target branch (renamed `initial_git_branch` → "
"`expected_git_branch`) after a tool-driven branch switch so commits on a "
"branch nanocode switched to are not rejected, while still guarding "
"against unexpected external switches."
msgstr ""
"在工具驱动的分支切换后更新跟踪的提交目标分支(改名 `initial_git_branch` → `expected_git_branch`),使"
" nanocode 切到的分支上的提交不被拒绝,同时仍防范意外的外部切换。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1229
msgid "0.6.2 - 2026-06-21"
msgstr "0.6.2 - 2026-06-21"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1232
msgid ""
"Simplified the agent system prompt while preserving the main `TOOLS`, "
"`FLOW`, `FILE STATE`, and `FINAL` sections."
msgstr "简化 agent 系统提示词,保留主要的 `TOOLS`、`FLOW`、`FILE STATE` 与 `FINAL` 小节。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1233
msgid ""
"Simplified MCP command handling and server config parsing by sharing "
"command metadata and config field parsing helpers."
msgstr "通过共享命令元数据与配置字段解析辅助,简化 MCP 命令处理与服务器配置解析。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1236
msgid ""
"Reused one manager-owned MCP event loop for async MCP operations, "
"including calls made while another event loop is already running."
msgstr "为异步 MCP 操作复用单个管理器拥有的 MCP 事件循环,包括在另一个事件循环已在运行时发出的调用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1237
msgid ""
"Made MCP OAuth token storage reuse one store and shared path lock to "
"avoid concurrent token file writes racing each other."
msgstr "让 MCP OAuth token 存储复用单个存储与共享路径锁,避免并发 token 文件写入互相竞态。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1238
msgid ""
"Allowed `env_http_headers.Authorization` when it is the only configured "
"authorization source."
msgstr "当 `env_http_headers.Authorization` 是唯一配置的授权来源时允许它。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1239
msgid ""
"Rejected extra `/mcp` subcommand arguments instead of silently ignoring "
"them."
msgstr "拒绝多余的 `/mcp` 子命令参数,而不是静默忽略。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1241
msgid "0.6.1 - 2026-06-19"
msgstr "0.6.1 - 2026-06-19"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1244
msgid ""
"Renamed `Note` fields: `goal` → `set_goal`, `plan` → `replace_plan`, "
"`known` → `append_known`, `check` → `set_check`; added `replace_known` "
"for full replacement of known facts."
msgstr ""
"改名 `Note` 字段:`goal` → `set_goal`、`plan` → `replace_plan`、`known` → "
"`append_known`、`check` → `set_check`;新增 `replace_known` 用于整体替换已知事实。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1245
msgid ""
"Aligned `Note` schemas and prompt guidance so `replace_plan`, "
"`append_known`, and `replace_known` are always arrays and can be empty "
"when replacing state."
msgstr ""
"对齐 `Note` schema 与提示指引,使 `replace_plan`、`append_known` 与 `replace_known` "
"始终是数组,替换状态时可以为空。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1246
msgid ""
"Split FILE STATE into its own prompt section and clarified it as the "
"working view for visible file content and Edit anchors, while noting it "
"may be partial."
msgstr "把 FILE STATE 拆为独立的提示词小节,并明确它是可见文件内容与 Edit 锚点的工作视图,同时注明它可能不完整。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1247
msgid ""
"MCP tool calls now confirm by default, auto-approving only tools "
"explicitly marked read-only (`readOnlyHint`) or non-destructive "
"(`destructiveHint: false`); undiscovered tools also require confirmation."
msgstr ""
"MCP 工具调用现在默认确认,只自动批准显式标记为只读(`readOnlyHint`)或非破坏(`destructiveHint: "
"false`)的工具;未发现的工具也需要确认。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1250
msgid ""
"New Note field `replace_known` that completely replaces the known list, "
"with test coverage."
msgstr "新增 Note 字段 `replace_known`,完全替换已知列表,带测试覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1253
msgid ""
"Made `Note` updates transactional, so invalid fields no longer partially "
"mutate session notes before returning a tool error."
msgstr "让 `Note` 更新成为事务性的,无效字段不再在返回工具错误前部分变更会话笔记。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1254
msgid ""
"Guarded MCP `login`/discovery error paths with the manager lock so they "
"no longer race background discovery while mutating server tool/error "
"state."
msgstr "用管理器锁保护 MCP `login`/发现错误路径,使它们在变更服务器工具/错误状态时不再与后台发现竞态。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1256
msgid "0.6.0 - 2026-06-18"
msgstr "0.6.0 - 2026-06-18"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1259
msgid ""
"Added MCP client router support through a single `MCP` tool, with URL-"
"based server configuration, bearer-token environment variable support, "
"OAuth login/logout with persistent tokens, asynchronous tool discovery, "
"compact model-visible MCP tool indexes, on-demand tool details, and "
"`/mcp` inspection/refresh commands."
msgstr ""
"通过单个 `MCP` 工具加入 MCP 客户端路由器支持:基于 URL 的服务器配置、bearer-token 环境变量支持、带持久化 token"
" 的 OAuth 登录/登出、异步工具发现、紧凑的模型可见 MCP 工具索引、按需工具细节,以及 `/mcp` 检查/刷新命令。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1260
msgid ""
"Added local stdio MCP servers via `command`/`args`/`env`, alongside the "
"existing streamable-HTTP transport; each server is `url` or `command`, "
"and stdio servers reject the HTTP-only auth options."
msgstr ""
"通过 `command`/`args`/`env` 加入本地 stdio MCP 服务器,与已有的 streamable-HTTP "
"传输并存;每个服务器是 `url` 或 `command`,stdio 服务器拒绝仅 HTTP 的认证选项。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1261
msgid ""
"Added `@server` and `@server.tool` mentions in user input that inject a "
"server's tool list or a tool's details into the turn, force discovery of "
"undiscovered servers, report login/errors inline, and tab-complete server"
" and tool names."
msgstr ""
"在用户输入中加入 `@server` 与 `@server.tool` "
"提及:把服务器的工具列表或某工具的细节注入回合,强制发现未发现的服务器,内联报告登录/错误,并 Tab 补全服务器与工具名。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1262
msgid ""
"Added MCP coverage for result normalization, successful tool calls, "
"context pruning, `/mcp tools NAME`, missing-server refresh handling, and "
"stdio config parsing/validation."
msgstr "新增 MCP 覆盖:结果规范化、成功工具调用、上下文剪枝、`/mcp tools NAME`、缺失服务器刷新处理与 stdio 配置解析/校验。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1263
msgid ""
"Added bounded MCP connection timeouts, concise MCP connection-failure "
"logs, a `--debug` flag for starting with debug mode enabled, and a "
"`--mcp` selector for choosing MCP servers by name glob."
msgstr ""
"新增有界的 MCP 连接超时、简洁的 MCP 连接失败日志、用于以调试模式启动的 `--debug` 标志,以及用名称 glob 选择 MCP "
"服务器的 `--mcp` 选择器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1266
msgid ""
"Refined the status bar with lowercase `mcp`, right-side loading "
"animation, and semantic per-section colors."
msgstr "打磨状态栏:小写 `mcp`、右侧加载动画与按小节区分的语义颜色。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1267
msgid "Show MCP discovery progress in the status bar while servers are loading."
msgstr "服务器加载时在状态栏显示 MCP 发现进度。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1268
msgid ""
"Render `/mcp` server and tool listings as Markdown tables for clearer "
"terminal display."
msgstr "把 `/mcp` 服务器与工具列表渲染为 Markdown 表格,终端显示更清晰。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1269
msgid "Load configured MCP servers in parallel during discovery."
msgstr "发现期间并行加载配置的 MCP 服务器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1270
msgid ""
"Include the MCP endpoint URL when OAuth login fails before an "
"authorization URL is available."
msgstr "OAuth 登录在获得授权 URL 之前失败时,在错误中包含 MCP 端点 URL。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1271
msgid ""
"Suppress duplicate FastMCP OAuth URL logs and omit OAuth-login-required "
"notices from startup MCP error logs."
msgstr "抑制重复的 FastMCP OAuth URL 日志,并从启动 MCP 错误日志中省略需要 OAuth 登录的通知。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1272
msgid ""
"Skip MCP server discovery without startup error logs when bearer-token "
"environment variables are missing."
msgstr "缺少 bearer-token 环境变量时跳过 MCP 服务器发现,不输出启动错误日志。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1273
msgid ""
"List all enabled MCP servers in the model-visible index, adding a \"not "
"yet available\" section for servers that are still discovering, need "
"login, or errored, so the model never assumes a configured server is "
"absent."
msgstr ""
"在模型可见的索引中列出所有已启用的 MCP 服务器，为仍在发现中、需要登录或出错的服务器增加「not yet "
"available」区段，让模型永远不会以为已配置的服务器不存在。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1274
msgid ""
"Enriched MCP tool-call logging with compact `key=value` arguments in the "
"header (also shown in the approval preview), a success result summary "
"(shape and payload size), and round-trip latency."
msgstr "丰富 MCP 工具调用日志:头部带紧凑的 `key=value` 参数(也显示在审批预览中)、成功结果摘要(形状与负载大小)与往返延迟。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1275
msgid ""
"Steered the agent toward `InspectCode` for symbol navigation with a "
"`SEARCH/NAV` prompt section, and surfaced the code-index status in the "
"Environment context so it knows when the tool is usable."
msgstr ""
"用 `SEARCH/NAV` 提示小节把 agent 引向用 `InspectCode` 做符号导航,并在 Environment "
"上下文中显示代码索引状态,让它知道工具何时可用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1276
msgid ""
"Separated each round with a blank line after the user input and a rule "
"before the agent's answer."
msgstr "每个回合用用户输入后的空行与 agent 答案前的规则线分隔。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1277
msgid ""
"Clarified prompt guidance around FILE STATE snapshots, automatic "
"Read/Edit refreshes, stale-anchor retries, and avoiding unchanged failed "
"tool-call retries."
msgstr "澄清 FILE STATE 快照、自动 Read/Edit 刷新、过期锚点重试,以及避免重试未变更的失败工具调用周围的提示指引。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1278
msgid ""
"Tightened the system prompt's tool-choice guidance to prefer `Edit` for "
"file changes, `Read` for known file ranges, `Search` for text lookup, and"
" `InspectCode` for symbol navigation."
msgstr ""
"收紧系统提示词的工具选择指引:文件变更优先 `Edit`、已知文件范围用 `Read`、文本查找用 `Search`、符号导航用 "
"`InspectCode`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1279
msgid ""
"Added current git branch to Environment context while keeping branch-"
"specific data out of the stable system prompt."
msgstr "在 Environment 上下文中加入当前 git 分支,同时把分支相关数据排除在稳定系统提示词之外。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1282
msgid ""
"Expanded `Edit` no-op errors with current target-range content when "
"anchored edits produce no changes, so agents can distinguish already-"
"applied edits from wrong replacement content."
msgstr "锚定编辑无变化时,用当前目标范围内容扩展 `Edit` 的无操作错误,使 agent 能区分已应用的编辑与错误的替换内容。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1283
msgid ""
"Guarded git branch safety so yolo mode cannot auto-approve branch-"
"changing commands, and git commits refuse to run after the branch changes"
" from the session start."
msgstr "加固 git 分支安全,使 yolo 模式无法自动批准改变分支的命令,分支自会话开始后变化时 git commit 拒绝运行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1285
msgid "0.5.12 - 2026-06-15"
msgstr "0.5.12 - 2026-06-15"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1288
msgid ""
"Preserved queued input typed during a running turn and prefilled it into "
"the next prompt instead of dropping it at turn completion."
msgstr "保留运行回合期间键入的排队输入,并预填进下一个提示符,而不是在回合完成时丢弃。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1290
msgid "0.5.11 - 2026-06-12"
msgstr "0.5.11 - 2026-06-12"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1293
msgid ""
"`InspectCode` gained `refs`, `impls`, `callers`, and `callees` modes, "
"backed by `code-symbol-index` 0.3.0: behavior-classified references, "
"implementor listing, and transitive call-chain walks (`depth`). `refs` "
"hides import/attribute noise by default, with `ref_kind` to filter to an "
"explicit subset or `all_kinds` to show everything; `callees` takes "
"`loose` to include ambiguous cross-module matches; `refs`/`impls` page "
"with `offset`."
msgstr ""
"`InspectCode` 新增 `refs`、`impls`、`callers` 与 `callees` 模式,由 `code-symbol-"
"index` 0.3.0 支撑:行为分类的引用、实现者列表与传递调用链遍历(`depth`)。`refs` 默认隐藏导入/属性噪声,可用 "
"`ref_kind` 过滤到显式子集,或用 `all_kinds` 显示全部;`callees` 接受 `loose` "
"以包含有歧义的跨模块匹配;`refs`/`impls` 用 `offset` 分页。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1296
msgid "Bumped `code-symbol-index` floor to `>=0.3.0`."
msgstr "把 `code-symbol-index` 下限提升到 `>=0.3.0`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1298
msgid "0.5.10 - 2026-06-02"
msgstr "0.5.10 - 2026-06-02"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1301
msgid "Cached gitignore patterns across tool calls with mtime-based invalidation."
msgstr "跨工具调用缓存 gitignore 模式,基于 mtime 失效。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1304
msgid "Clarified Bash tool output limits in its description."
msgstr "在 Bash 工具描述中澄清输出限制。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1305
msgid ""
"Strengthened assistant language prompt to reduce unnecessary `cd` "
"commands."
msgstr "加强 assistant 语言提示,减少不必要的 `cd` 命令。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1306
msgid ""
"Clarified Git tool description so the model sees it defaults to the cwd "
"from Environment."
msgstr "澄清 Git 工具描述,让模型看到它默认使用 Environment 中的 cwd。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1308
msgid "0.5.9 - 2026-06-01"
msgstr "0.5.9 - 2026-06-01"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1311
msgid "Colorized `Ctrl-A` full edit previews when shown through `less`."
msgstr "通过 `less` 显示时给 `Ctrl-A` 完整编辑预览着色。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1313
msgid "0.5.8 - 2026-06-01"
msgstr "0.5.8 - 2026-06-01"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1316
msgid "Added `Ctrl-A` full edit preview in an external pager during approval."
msgstr "审批期间在外部分页器中加入 `Ctrl-A` 完整编辑预览。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1319
msgid "Compact oversized current turns instead of only prior history."
msgstr "压缩过大的当前回合,而不只是之前的历史。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1320
msgid "Removed thin internal wrappers without changing behavior."
msgstr "移除薄内部包装,行为不变。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1323
msgid "Rejected broad `git add` commands unless explicit file paths are supplied."
msgstr "拒绝宽泛的 `git add` 命令,除非提供明确的文件路径。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1324
msgid ""
"Stopped exposing the output-language sentinel inside model-visible file "
"state."
msgstr "不再在模型可见的文件状态中暴露输出语言哨兵。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1326
msgid "0.5.7 - 2026-05-30"
msgstr "0.5.7 - 2026-05-30"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1329
msgid ""
"Encouraged early `Note` usage for multi-step work with goal and plan "
"updates."
msgstr "鼓励多步工作尽早使用 `Note`,配合 goal 与 plan 更新。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1330
msgid ""
"Added lightweight empty-memory guidance when goal or plan has not been "
"set."
msgstr "未设置 goal 或 plan 时加入轻量的空记忆指引。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1331
msgid ""
"Ordered `FILE STATE` files by most recent visible Read/Edit source before"
" stable path fallback."
msgstr "在稳定路径回退之前,按最近可见的 Read/Edit 来源排序 `FILE STATE` 文件。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1333
msgid "0.5.6 - 2026-05-30"
msgstr "0.5.6 - 2026-05-30"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1336
msgid "Added a visible purple approval wait indicator."
msgstr "新增可见的紫色审批等待指示器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1337
msgid ""
"Expanded compact logic tests around latest-turn retention, recent-message"
" windows, fallback trimming, and tool-result preservation."
msgstr "扩展压缩逻辑测试:最新回合保留、近期消息窗口、回退裁剪与工具结果保留。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1340
msgid "Clarified prompt rules for user-visible interim output and final answers."
msgstr "澄清面向用户可见的中间输出与最终答案的提示规则。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1341
msgid ""
"Simplified core flow by removing thin wrappers and duplicate tool-schema "
"name extraction."
msgstr "通过移除薄包装与重复的工具 schema 名提取,简化核心流程。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1344
msgid ""
"Preserved raw tool results referenced from compact summaries so `tr.N` "
"keys remain recallable."
msgstr "保留压缩摘要引用的原始工具结果,使 `tr.N` 键保持可召回。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1345
msgid "Improved transient model error retry detection and final retry reporting."
msgstr "改进瞬时模型错误的重试检测与最终重试报告。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1347
msgid "0.5.5 - 2026-05-30"
msgstr "0.5.5 - 2026-05-30"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1350
msgid ""
"Tightened the system prompt around FILE STATE, anchored edits, and final-"
"answer flow."
msgstr "围绕 FILE STATE、锚定编辑与最终答案流程收紧系统提示词。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1353
msgid ""
"Added limited automatic retries for transient model request failures such"
" as 5xx, rate limits, and timeouts."
msgstr "为瞬时模型请求失败(如 5xx、限流与超时)加入受限的自动重试。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1355
msgid "0.5.4 - 2026-05-29"
msgstr "0.5.4 - 2026-05-29"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1358
msgid ""
"Reworked running-turn context as a current turn conversation, preserving "
"mid-turn assistant text and appended user input."
msgstr "把运行中回合的上下文重构为当前回合对话,保留回合中段的 assistant 文本与追加的用户输入。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1359
msgid ""
"Made running-turn appended input visible through a `+>` prompt and "
"compact `+N` status indicator."
msgstr "让运行回合追加的输入通过 `+>` 提示与紧凑的 `+N` 状态指示器可见。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1362
msgid ""
"Started Bash live preview before command output so the `+>` prompt cannot"
" cover it."
msgstr "在命令输出前启动 Bash 实时预览,使 `+>` 提示无法覆盖它。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1363
msgid "Avoided extra approval prompt line clearing after confirmation."
msgstr "避免确认后多余的审批提示行清除。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1365
msgid "0.5.3 - 2026-05-29"
msgstr "0.5.3 - 2026-05-29"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1368
msgid "Added support for additional user input during running agent turns."
msgstr "加入在 agent 回合运行期间提供额外用户输入的支持。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1369
msgid "Added multiline approval input for pasted refusal reasons."
msgstr "为粘贴的拒绝理由加入多行审批输入。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1372
msgid ""
"Simplified approval handling so direct non-yes input is treated as a "
"refusal reason."
msgstr "简化审批处理,直接的非 yes 输入被视为拒绝理由。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1375
msgid ""
"Fixed CreateFile escaped-newline handling so preview and written content "
"stay multiline."
msgstr "修复 CreateFile 的转义换行处理,使预览与写入内容保持多行。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1376
msgid ""
"Made CreateFile/Edit code-index updates use the tool call path as a "
"fallback."
msgstr "让 CreateFile/Edit 的代码索引更新以工具调用路径作为回退。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1378
msgid "0.5.2 - 2026-05-29"
msgstr "0.5.2 - 2026-05-29"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1381
msgid ""
"Animated the statusbar code-index refresh indicator while keeping "
"`/status` semantic."
msgstr "让状态栏的代码索引刷新指示器动画化,同时保持 `/status` 语义化。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1384
msgid ""
"Switched startup code-index refresh to the `code-symbol-index` async "
"refresh API to avoid parser thread ownership errors."
msgstr "把启动代码索引刷新切换到 `code-symbol-index` 的异步刷新 API,避免解析器线程所有权错误。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1386
msgid "0.5.1 - 2026-05-29"
msgstr "0.5.1 - 2026-05-29"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1389
msgid ""
"Added the current date to context immediately before the current user "
"request."
msgstr "在当前用户请求之前立即把当前日期加入上下文。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1392
msgid ""
"Sanitized context/debug/model-request text so surrogate characters from "
"terminal input cannot break UTF-8 encoding."
msgstr "净化上下文/调试/模型请求文本,使终端输入的代理字符不会破坏 UTF-8 编码。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1393
msgid ""
"Made Search ignore hidden paths and `.gitignore` paths consistently "
"across ripgrep and Python fallback paths."
msgstr "让 Search 在 ripgrep 与 Python 回退路径中一致地忽略隐藏路径与 `.gitignore` 路径。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1395
msgid "0.5.0 - 2026-05-28"
msgstr "0.5.0 - 2026-05-28"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1398
msgid ""
"Added cached system information to the top of model context: cwd, OS, "
"arch, shell timeout, and detected commands."
msgstr "在模型上下文顶部加入缓存的系统信息:cwd、OS、arch、shell 超时与检测到的命令。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1399
msgid "Added configurable `runtime.max_context_tokens`."
msgstr "新增可配置的 `runtime.max_context_tokens`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1400
msgid ""
"Added key behavior tests for tools, agent loop, context management, "
"provider adaptation, and code index integration."
msgstr "为工具、agent 循环、上下文管理、provider 适配与代码索引集成加入关键行为测试。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1403
msgid ""
"Replaced the legacy implementation with the smaller v1 core in "
"`nanocode.py`."
msgstr "用 `nanocode.py` 中更小的 v1 核心取代旧实现。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1404
msgid ""
"Rebuilt README around the current command set, context design, and "
"screenshot."
msgstr "围绕当前命令集、上下文设计与截图重建 README。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1405
msgid "Simplified tool schemas for broader OpenAI-compatible provider support."
msgstr "简化工具 schema,以支持更广的 OpenAI 兼容 provider。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1406
msgid ""
"Improved tool-call display for Search and Recall, and surfaced "
"intermediate assistant progress before tool calls."
msgstr "改进 Search 与 Recall 的工具调用显示,并在工具调用前呈现中间的 assistant 进度。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1409
msgid ""
"Fixed Moonshot/Kimi-compatible tool schemas by avoiding unsupported "
"schema forms."
msgstr "通过避免不支持的 schema 形式,修复 Moonshot/Kimi 兼容的工具 schema。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1410
msgid ""
"Fixed repeated command probing in context rendering by caching system "
"command detection per session."
msgstr "通过在每次会话缓存系统命令检测,修复上下文渲染中重复的命令探测。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1412
msgid "0.4.11 - 2026-05-24"
msgstr "0.4.11 - 2026-05-24"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1415
msgid "Bumped version from 0.4.10 to 0.4.11."
msgstr "把版本从 0.4.10 提升到 0.4.11。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1416
msgid "0.4.8 - 2026-05-23"
msgstr "0.4.8 - 2026-05-23"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1419
msgid "Renamed the `EditFile` tool to `Edit` across the codebase and tests."
msgstr "在代码库与测试中把 `EditFile` 工具改名为 `Edit`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1421
msgid "0.4.5 - 2026-05-21"
msgstr "0.4.5 - 2026-05-21"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1424
msgid "Updated the built-in code index integration for `code-symbol-index` 0.1.7."
msgstr "为 `code-symbol-index` 0.1.7 更新内置代码索引集成。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1425
msgid "Added indexed symbol filters for kind, path, and exact matching."
msgstr "新增 kind、path 与精确匹配的索引符号过滤器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1426
msgid ""
"Added file-local symbol outlines and bounded pending-index details in "
"`/status`."
msgstr "在 `/status` 中新增文件级符号大纲与有界的挂起索引细节。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1428
msgid "0.4.4 - 2026-05-20"
msgstr "0.4.4 - 2026-05-20"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1431
msgid ""
"Added built-in indexed code navigation backed by project data and "
"`/index` for manual init/sync."
msgstr "新增由项目数据支撑的内置索引代码导航,以及用于手动初始化/同步的 `/index`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1434
msgid ""
"Replaced the external code-navigation CLI integration with the bundled "
"code index API."
msgstr "用捆绑的代码索引 API 取代外部代码导航 CLI 集成。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1435
msgid ""
"Hid code navigation tools until an index exists, while lightly updating "
"existing indexes at startup."
msgstr "在索引存在之前隐藏代码导航工具,同时在启动时轻量更新现有索引。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1436
msgid ""
"Updated status/docs to describe code index availability without exposing "
"dependency-install wording."
msgstr "更新状态/文档以描述代码索引可用性,不暴露依赖安装的措辞。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1438
msgid "0.4.3 - 2026-05-20"
msgstr "0.4.3 - 2026-05-20"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1441
msgid "Removed stable knowledge state while keeping current-task known facts."
msgstr "移除稳定的知识状态,保留当前任务的 known facts。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1442
msgid ""
"Extracted shared numbered-content and line-range helpers for tool "
"output/range handling."
msgstr "为工具输出/范围处理提取共享的编号内容与行范围辅助。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1443
msgid "Trimmed thin helper wrappers in List and indexed code-inspection tools."
msgstr "精简 List 与索引代码检查工具中的薄辅助包装。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1445
msgid "0.4.2 - 2026-05-19"
msgstr "0.4.2 - 2026-05-19"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1448
msgid ""
"Added indexed code inspection tools for symbol lookup, symbol "
"investigation, and file outlines when the local index is available."
msgstr "本地索引可用时,新增符号查找、符号调查与文件大纲的索引代码检查工具。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1449
msgid "Added queued user feedback during long-running turns."
msgstr "在长时间运行的回合中新增排队用户反馈。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1450
msgid "Added `PatchFile` for multi-location file edits."
msgstr "为多位置文件编辑新增 `PatchFile`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1453
msgid "Moved model calls to the OpenAI SDK and function-tool protocol."
msgstr "把模型调用迁移到 OpenAI SDK 与 function-tool 协议。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1454
msgid "Reworked task-shape prompts for chat, one-shot tasks, and tracked tasks."
msgstr "为聊天、一次性任务与跟踪任务重构任务形态提示。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1455
msgid ""
"Prioritized indexed code inspection for structural lookup while keeping "
"Search/Read for exact literals and edit ranges."
msgstr "结构化查找优先用索引代码检查,同时为精确字面量与编辑范围保留 Search/Read。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1456
msgid ""
"Improved terminal UX with persistent status, queued-input handling, Bash "
"live preview, and terminal-friendly assistant output rules."
msgstr "用持久状态、排队输入处理、Bash 实时预览与终端友好的 assistant 输出规则改进终端 UX。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1457
msgid "Renamed `ListDir` to `List`."
msgstr "把 `ListDir` 改名为 `List`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1458
msgid ""
"Improved `Read`, `Edit`, `ReplaceRange`, `PatchFile`, `Bash`, and `Git` "
"tool guidance."
msgstr "改进 `Read`、`Edit`、`ReplaceRange`、`PatchFile`、`Bash` 与 `Git` 的工具指引。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1459
msgid ""
"Simplified gate behavior so only deterministic, correctable model errors "
"are refused."
msgstr "简化闸门行为,只拒绝确定、可纠正的模型错误。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1462
msgid "Fixed duplicate final replies for goal-only text answers."
msgstr "修复仅 goal 文本答案的重复最终回复。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1463
msgid ""
"Fixed repeated recall loops and several format/tool-name compatibility "
"issues."
msgstr "修复重复的召回循环与若干格式/工具名兼容问题。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1464
msgid "Fixed PatchFile diagnostics and empty-hunk handling."
msgstr "修复 PatchFile 的诊断与空 hunk 处理。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1465
msgid ""
"Fixed queued feedback delivery, Ctrl-C/Ctrl-D handling, and Bash "
"interrupt reporting."
msgstr "修复排队反馈投递、Ctrl-C/Ctrl-D 处理与 Bash 中断报告。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1467
msgid "0.3.35 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.35 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1470
msgid ""
"Added batched `ReplaceRange` edits for multiple independent ranges in the"
" same file."
msgstr "为同一文件中的多个独立范围新增批量 `ReplaceRange` 编辑。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1471
msgid ""
"Added a design document covering agent state, context construction, tool-"
"result storage, observe policy, and verification."
msgstr "新增设计文档,涵盖 agent 状态、上下文构建、工具结果存储、observe 策略与验证。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1474
msgid "Aligned tool-result context layout with the design document."
msgstr "让工具结果上下文布局与设计文档对齐。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1475
msgid ""
"Refined tool-result context reduction around unreduced raw results, "
"retained results, and checkpoint-based pruning."
msgstr "围绕未缩减的原始结果、保留结果与基于检查点的剪枝,细化工具结果上下文缩减。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1476
msgid "Compressed ACT and OBSERVE system prompts."
msgstr "压缩 ACT 与 OBSERVE 系统提示词。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1477
msgid ""
"Reduced routine OBSERVE triggers by raising the pending-result threshold "
"and keeping ordinary tool failures in ACT for repair."
msgstr "通过提高挂起结果阈值减少常规 OBSERVE 触发,让普通工具失败留在 ACT 中修复。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1478
msgid ""
"Simplified agent gate and feedback handling, including single active plan"
" item normalization."
msgstr "简化 agent 闸门与反馈处理,包括单个活动计划项规范化。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1479
msgid ""
"Added soft feedback for state-update-only ACT turns so models continue "
"with frontier tools, verification, or completion."
msgstr "为仅状态更新的 ACT 回合加入软反馈,让模型继续推进前沿工具、验证或完成。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1480
msgid ""
"Highlighted recognized slash commands and reported unknown slash commands"
" directly."
msgstr "高亮已识别的斜杠命令,并直接报告未知斜杠命令。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1483
msgid ""
"Accepted harmless model output variants including trailing progress text,"
" action type casing, and `message` action aliases."
msgstr "接受无害的模型输出变体,包括尾随进度文本、动作类型大小写与 `message` 动作别名。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1484
msgid ""
"Ignored pending verification requests instead of treating them as "
"blocking model output."
msgstr "忽略挂起的验证请求,而不是把它们当作阻塞性模型输出。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1486
msgid "0.3.34 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.34 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1489
msgid ""
"Trigger observe by unresolved pending tool-result count only, instead of "
"consecutive tool batch count."
msgstr "只按未解决的挂起工具结果数触发 observe,而不是连续工具批次数。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1491
msgid "0.3.33 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.33 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1494
msgid ""
"Keep unresolved pending tool results visible as raw ACT context until "
"observe mode explicitly keeps or forgets them."
msgstr "在 observe 模式显式保留或遗忘之前,让未解决的挂起工具结果作为原始 ACT 上下文保持可见。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1496
msgid "0.3.32 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.32 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1499
msgid ""
"Removed the pending tool-result character threshold for observe mode; "
"observe now triggers from failures, pending result count, or consecutive "
"tool turns."
msgstr "移除 observe 模式的挂起工具结果字符阈值;observe 现在由失败、挂起结果数或连续工具回合触发。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1501
msgid "0.3.31 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.31 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1504
msgid ""
"Require a new user turn with retained task context to align via `start`, "
"`goal`, or `plan` before running more tools."
msgstr "在运行更多工具之前,要求带保留任务上下文的新用户回合通过 `start`、`goal` 或 `plan` 对齐。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1507
msgid "Removed an unused pytest import from bash tool tests."
msgstr "从 bash 工具测试中移除未使用的 pytest 导入。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1509
msgid "0.3.30 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.30 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1512
msgid ""
"Status bar now shows compact token totals and model stream rate, "
"including `turn:` duration labeling."
msgstr "状态栏现在显示紧凑的 token 总数与模型流速率,包括 `turn:` 时长标签。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1513
msgid ""
"Stream rate uses live character-based estimation and completion-token "
"usage when available."
msgstr "流速率在可用时使用实时的基于字符的估算与 completion-token 用量。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1515
msgid "0.3.29 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.29 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1518
msgid ""
"Ignored code-fence-only text when converting interleaved model output "
"into progress actions."
msgstr "把交错的模型输出转换为进度动作时,忽略仅含代码围栏的文本。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1520
msgid "0.3.28 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.28 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1523
msgid ""
"Status bar now labels model calls as `working`, `observing`, or "
"`compacting`."
msgstr "状态栏现在把模型调用标记为 `working`、`observing` 或 `compacting`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1524
msgid ""
"Removed the hard gate for multiple `doing` plan items while keeping "
"prompt guidance to prefer a single active item."
msgstr "移除多个 `doing` 计划项的硬闸门,同时保留倾向单个活动项的提示指引。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1527
msgid ""
"Preserved specific retry notices such as `err:format` instead of "
"overwriting them with generic gate notices."
msgstr "保留具体的重试通知(如 `err:format`),而不是用通用闸门通知覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1528
msgid ""
"Accepted unmarked action streams with interleaved progress text between "
"JSON actions."
msgstr "接受未标记的动作流,JSON 动作之间夹杂进度文本。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1529
msgid ""
"Normalized tool-name action types such as `Search` or `ListDir` into tool"
" actions."
msgstr "把 `Search` 或 `ListDir` 这类工具名动作类型规范化为工具动作。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1531
msgid "0.3.27 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.27 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1534
msgid ""
"Added a nanocode `User-Agent` header to provider requests so OpenAI-"
"compatible gateways that reject Python urllib defaults can accept chat "
"and model-list requests."
msgstr ""
"给 provider 请求加入 nanocode `User-Agent` 头,使拒绝 Python urllib 默认值的 OpenAI "
"兼容网关能接受聊天与模型列表请求。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1536
msgid "0.3.26 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.26 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1539
msgid ""
"Generated configs now leave `reasoning_payload` unset by default for "
"broader provider compatibility."
msgstr "生成的配置现在默认不设置 `reasoning_payload`,以获得更广的 provider 兼容性。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1540
msgid ""
"Documented when to enable `reasoning_payload`, including OpenRouter-style"
" reasoning providers."
msgstr "记录何时启用 `reasoning_payload`,包括 OpenRouter 风格的推理 provider。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1542
msgid "0.3.25 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.25 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1545
msgid ""
"Added Vim-style selector search with `/keyword`, `j`/`k` navigation, and "
"step-back Esc behavior."
msgstr "新增 Vim 风格选择器搜索:`/keyword`、`j`/`k` 导航与逐步回退的 Esc 行为。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1546
msgid ""
"Made `/model` reasoning selection transactional so Esc returns to model "
"selection instead of applying a partial change."
msgstr "让 `/model` 推理选择成为事务性的,Esc 返回模型选择而不是应用部分变更。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1548
msgid "0.3.24 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.24 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1551
msgid ""
"`/model` now groups configured `available_models` first and appends "
"deduplicated models discovered from the provider."
msgstr "`/model` 现在先把配置的 `available_models` 分组在前,再追加从 provider 发现的去重模型。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1552
msgid ""
"Default generated config now documents `available_models` without writing"
" an empty setting."
msgstr "默认生成的配置现在记录 `available_models`,而不写入空设置。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1553
msgid ""
"Split latest/recent and kept tool-result context budgets for steadier "
"context growth."
msgstr "拆分 latest/recent 与保留的工具结果上下文预算,使上下文增长更平稳。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1554
msgid "Compacted tool-result CLI output while keeping result keys visible."
msgstr "压缩工具结果 CLI 输出,同时保持结果键可见。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1555
msgid ""
"Removed `ApplyPatch`; editing now uses `Edit` for tiny literal changes "
"and `ReplaceRange` for read-backed focused ranges."
msgstr "移除 `ApplyPatch`;编辑现在用 `Edit` 做微小的字面变更,用 `ReplaceRange` 做读支持的有界范围。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1556
msgid ""
"Refined editing prompts to prefer minimal new-file skeletons followed by "
"focused `ReplaceRange` chunks."
msgstr "细化编辑提示,偏好最小的新文件骨架,随后用聚焦的 `ReplaceRange` 块。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1559
msgid ""
"Stopped executing later tool calls after the first failed tool call in a "
"batch."
msgstr "批中第一个工具调用失败后停止执行后续工具调用。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1560
msgid ""
"Reported Ctrl-C interrupted Bash runs as explicit interrupted tool "
"results."
msgstr "把 Ctrl-C 中断的 Bash 运行报告为显式的中断工具结果。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1562
msgid "0.3.23 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.23 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1565
msgid ""
"Reworked tool-result context around latest, recent, pending, and kept "
"results."
msgstr "围绕 latest、recent、pending 与 kept 结果重构工具结果上下文。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1566
msgid "Increased default provider and plan-mode response timeouts."
msgstr "提高默认 provider 与 plan 模式的响应超时。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1567
msgid ""
"Simplified result keep/forget handling and removed stale evidence naming "
"from agent context."
msgstr "简化结果保留/遗忘处理,并从 agent 上下文移除过期的 evidence 命名。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1570
msgid ""
"Kept non-argument tool failures visible to observe mode while treating "
"argument errors as immediate feedback."
msgstr "让非参数工具失败对 observe 模式保持可见,同时把参数错误当作立即反馈。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1571
msgid ""
"Preserved Recall access to stored tool logs while allowing noisy context "
"entries to be forgotten."
msgstr "保留对存储工具日志的 Recall 访问,同时允许遗忘嘈杂的上下文条目。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1573
msgid "0.3.22 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.22 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1576
msgid ""
"Preserved tool-result store entries referenced by Known, Hypotheses, and "
"Evidence."
msgstr "保留 Known、Hypotheses 与 Evidence 引用的工具结果存储条目。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1577
msgid ""
"Aligned plan-mode verify guidance with the implemented verify action "
"shape."
msgstr "让 plan 模式的 verify 指引与已实现的 verify 动作形态对齐。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1580
msgid ""
"Generated hypothesis status prompt schema from the enum to avoid prompt "
"drift."
msgstr "从枚举生成假设状态提示 schema,避免提示漂移。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1582
msgid "0.3.21 - 2026-05-16"
msgstr "0.3.21 - 2026-05-16"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1585
msgid ""
"Added investigation hypotheses, including `dropped` for branches that are"
" no longer worth tracking."
msgstr "新增调查假设,包括用于不再值得跟踪分支的 `dropped`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1586
msgid ""
"Added evidence forgetting so ruled-out or dropped branches can release "
"old tool results from context."
msgstr "新增证据遗忘,使被排除或丢弃的分支能从上下文释放旧工具结果。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1589
msgid ""
"Tightened completion gates, verification blockers, and compact state "
"update grouping."
msgstr "收紧完成闸门、验证阻塞器与压缩状态更新分组。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1590
msgid ""
"Simplified Search argument parsing and removed legacy knowledge-update "
"behavior."
msgstr "简化 Search 参数解析,移除旧的知识更新行为。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1591
msgid "Made provider reasoning payload shape configurable."
msgstr "让 provider 推理负载形态可配置。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1593
msgid "0.3.20 - 2026-05-15"
msgstr "0.3.20 - 2026-05-15"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1596
msgid ""
"Clarified Search tool guidance so models use at most one `glob=` per "
"Search action and split multiple globs into multiple actions."
msgstr "澄清 Search 工具指引:模型每个 Search 动作最多用一个 `glob=`,多个 glob 拆成多个动作。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1598
msgid "0.3.19 - 2026-05-15"
msgstr "0.3.19 - 2026-05-15"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1601
msgid ""
"Observe mode now requires every latest tool-result key to be covered by "
"either `evidence` or `discard`."
msgstr "observe 模式现在要求每个最新的工具结果键都被 `evidence` 或 `discard` 覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1602
msgid ""
"Verification pass/fail/block tool results are treated as decision-"
"changing evidence until verification is recorded."
msgstr "验证的 pass/fail/block 工具结果在验证记录之前被视为改变决策的证据。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1605
msgid ""
"Prevented partial observe checkpoints from silently dropping unhandled "
"tool results."
msgstr "防止部分 observe 检查点静默丢弃未处理的工具结果。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1607
msgid "0.3.18 - 2026-05-15"
msgstr "0.3.18 - 2026-05-15"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1610
msgid ""
"Added `provider.<name>.available_models` and an interactive `/model` "
"selector."
msgstr "新增 `provider.<name>.available_models` 与交互式 `/model` 选择器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1611
msgid "Added an interactive `/provider` selector."
msgstr "新增交互式 `/provider` 选择器。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1612
msgid "Added reasoning effort selection after changing models."
msgstr "更换模型后新增推理强度选择。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1615
msgid ""
"Selection prompts now use a subtle selected-item background, support "
"`j`/`k`, and clear after completion."
msgstr "选择提示现在使用微妙的选中项背景,支持 `j`/`k`,并在完成后清除。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1616
msgid ""
"Removed the redundant `keep current` option from selection prompts; "
"current values are marked inline."
msgstr "从选择提示中移除多余的 `keep current` 选项;当前值内联标记。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1617
msgid ""
"Removed the startup status snapshot now that the persistent status bar is"
" always shown."
msgstr "既然持久状态栏始终显示,移除启动状态快照。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1620
msgid "Disallowed no-value `/set provider.key` and `/set provider.url` queries."
msgstr "禁止无值的 `/set provider.key` 与 `/set provider.url` 查询。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1622
msgid "0.3.17 - 2026-05-15"
msgstr "0.3.17 - 2026-05-15"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1625
msgid ""
"Added plan mode with readonly tool limits, plan-specific timeouts, and "
"stricter plan-mode completion formatting."
msgstr "新增 plan 模式:只读工具限制、plan 专属超时与更严格的 plan 模式完成格式。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1626
msgid ""
"Added persistent prompt status display while keeping active status "
"updates during agent work."
msgstr "新增持久提示状态显示,同时保持 agent 工作期间的活跃状态更新。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1627
msgid ""
"Added completion pressure gates so settled tasks finish by default unless"
" the plan is reopened with context."
msgstr "新增完成压力闸门,使已定案的任务默认完成,除非 plan 带上下文重新打开。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1628
msgid ""
"Added global runtime data storage under `~/.nanocode`, with per-session "
"debug/tool-result logs and per-project user rules."
msgstr "在 `~/.nanocode` 下新增全局运行时数据存储,带 per-session 调试/工具结果日志与 per-project 用户规则。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1631
msgid "Replaced project-local `[paths].nanocode_dir` with `[paths].data_dir`."
msgstr "用 `[paths].data_dir` 取代项目本地 `[paths].nanocode_dir`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1632
msgid "Moved prompt history to global `~/.nanocode/history`."
msgstr "把提示历史移到全局 `~/.nanocode/history`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1633
msgid ""
"Replaced `/clean-logs` with `/clean`, which removes tool-result logs "
"across all stored sessions."
msgstr "用 `/clean` 取代 `/clean-logs`,移除所有存储会话中的工具结果日志。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1634
msgid ""
"Compact observed tool-call results after they have been digested into "
"agent state."
msgstr "观察到的工具调用结果被消化进 agent 状态后压缩它们。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1637
msgid "Rejected chat actions in plan mode."
msgstr "在 plan 模式中拒绝聊天动作。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1638
msgid ""
"Tightened blocked verification completion so it requires explicit "
"user/manual confirmation context."
msgstr "收紧受阻验证的完成,要求显式的用户/手动确认上下文。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:1639
msgid ""
"Kept unbounded tool-result logs available on disk while bounded results "
"stay in model context."
msgstr "让无界的工具结果日志在磁盘上可用,同时有界结果保持在模型上下文中。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Tool approvals answer to single keys."
#~ " The prompt is an ordinary input "
#~ "line — what you type is the "
#~ "refusal reason — so the actions "
#~ "use keys that cannot start a "
#~ "sentence and fire only while the "
#~ "line is still empty: `Esc` refuses "
#~ "at any tool's approval, and a "
#~ "Delegate send adds `Tab` to view "
#~ "the order and `Shift-Tab` to "
#~ "adjust the worker config, none of "
#~ "them needing Enter. Each key submits "
#~ "exactly the line you could have "
#~ "typed, so the typed protocol is "
#~ "unchanged and headless runs keep "
#~ "`y`/`n`/`v`/`c` verbatim."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "工具审批现在支持单键操作。审批提示是一行普通输入——你打的内容就是拒绝理由——因此这些动作用的是不可能作为句子开头的按键，且只在该行仍为空时才触发：`Esc`"
#~ " 在任何工具的审批下都表示拒绝，Delegate 发送另外提供 `Tab` 查看 "
#~ "order、`Shift-Tab` 调整 worker 配置，都不需要再按 "
#~ "Enter。每个按键提交的正是你本可以手打的那一行，因此文本协议保持不变，无界面运行仍然原样使用 "
#~ "`y`/`n`/`v`/`c`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`/compact log` reviews what compaction "
#~ "evicted: stored segments newest first "
#~ "with their time, scope, and trigger, "
#~ "and for the one opened, the "
#~ "summary it produced plus the "
#~ "conversation it replaced, rendered the "
#~ "way those messages looked in the "
#~ "transcript. `/compact log seg.N` prints "
#~ "one segment in full."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`/compact log` "
#~ "用于回顾压缩丢弃了什么：按时间倒序列出已存储的片段及其时间、范围与触发方式；打开某个片段可看到当时生成的摘要，以及它所替换掉的那段对话，按这些消息在"
#~ " transcript 中的样子渲染。`/compact log seg.N` "
#~ "则直接完整打印某个片段。"

#~ msgid "Unreleased"
#~ msgstr "未发布"
